(564839, 57807, 9073, '<td valign="top">Very good photo. Lovely use of grain/ noise. Tonal range and textures very nicely done. It''s a stretch to see how it fits the challenge, though. (Yes, I understand your title.) 7</td>', 'Very good photo. Lovely use of grain/ noise. Tonal range and textures very nicely done. It''s a stretch to see how it fits the challenge, though. (Yes, I understand your title.) 7', '2004-02-02 00:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
