(564894, 57956, 8624, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and the tones you created, but is that a platic ball? it would have had much stronger textures and impact with a real ball.</td>', 'I really like this shot and the tones you created, but is that a platic ball? it would have had much stronger textures and impact with a real ball.', '2004-02-02 00:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
