(564950, 57766, 9073, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately true. Good choice of b&amp;w - illustrating the starkness of war and money. I especially like the ''prison bars'' shadows at the top - really pushing your message home. For a final, wonderful, touch, you''ve got one of the US''s founding fathers looking down on the mess he''s created. Powerful stuff. So, in terms of meaning, I think that you''ve done a splendid job here. Visually? Not bad. 8</td>', 'Unfortunately true. Good choice of b&w - illustrating the starkness of war and money. I especially like the ''prison bars'' shadows at the top - really pushing your message home. For a final, wonderful, touch, you''ve got one of the US''s founding fathers looking down on the mess he''s created. Powerful stuff. So, in terms of meaning, I think that you''ve done a splendid job here. Visually? Not bad. 8', '2004-02-02 01:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(564951, 58146, 15959, '<td valign="top">red background was an excellent choice</td>', 'red background was an excellent choice', '2004-02-02 01:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(564952, 57622, 9073, '<td valign="top">A simple object captured cleanly. I wonder, though, about the challenge itself, which was not to shoot two things which are used together, but to find interesting combinations, IMHO. 6</td>', 'A simple object captured cleanly. I wonder, though, about the challenge itself, which was not to shoot two things which are used together, but to find interesting combinations, IMHO. 6', '2004-02-02 01:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
