(564972, 57873, 14499, '<td valign="top">Thats pushing it ..the statement that is, I sure you will explain it to us but I wouldn''t have picked Youth and Age going together. Nice Image Tough!</td>', 'Thats pushing it ..the statement that is, I sure you will explain it to us but I wouldn''t have picked Youth and Age going together. Nice Image Tough!', '2004-02-02 01:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
