(564983, 57421, 8054, '<td valign="top">All-american pasttime! Great idea and I almost did the same thing. I would liked to have seen more of the bat, however. Good detail, focus and lighting.</td>', 'All-american pasttime! Great idea and I almost did the same thing. I would liked to have seen more of the bat, however. Good detail, focus and lighting.', '2004-02-02 01:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
