(564996, 58082, 8054, '<td valign="top">Having never taken a picture of the aurora borealis, I cannot begin to think how difficult these are to photograph. I like the way the aurora streams across the night sky and its color. However, it looks like you had to use a faster ISO setting of 400-800 to capture this and it shows with excessive noise levels.</td>', 'Having never taken a picture of the aurora borealis, I cannot begin to think how difficult these are to photograph. I like the way the aurora streams across the night sky and its color. However, it looks like you had to use a faster ISO setting of 400-800 to capture this and it shows with excessive noise levels.', '2004-02-02 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(564998, 58192, 9073, '<td valign="top">You''ve taken a long time to get this just right. I hope that you score well overall, just for your efforts. The final product, IMHO, is okay, but the obvious staging detracts somewhat from any sponaneous sense. Still, for your effort I''m giving you a 7</td>', 'You''ve taken a long time to get this just right. I hope that you score well overall, just for your efforts. The final product, IMHO, is okay, but the obvious staging detracts somewhat from any sponaneous sense. Still, for your effort I''m giving you a 7', '2004-02-02 01:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(564999, 58124, 14499, '<td valign="top">Don''t sit there to long!  Nice image.. i like it</td>', 'Don''t sit there to long!  Nice image.. i like it', '2004-02-02 01:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(565000, 58080, 16052, '<td valign="top">Better focus on the second piece would have been better.  Otherwise, the best puzzle composition I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Better focus on the second piece would have been better.  Otherwise, the best puzzle composition I''ve seen so far.', '2004-02-02 01:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(565002, 57582, 14499, '<td valign="top">Nice, i like these types of shots.</td>', 'Nice, i like these types of shots.', '2004-02-02 01:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(565003, 58196, 9073, '<td valign="top">This is how I feel when I try to think up original responses to each challenge. It''s a shame that one nail is still usable. I really, really like the out-of-the-border nail. 9</td>', 'This is how I feel when I try to think up original responses to each challenge. It''s a shame that one nail is still usable. I really, really like the out-of-the-border nail. 9', '2004-02-02 01:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(565004, 57718, 8054, '<td valign="top">Looks like an infrared filter was used here. Very creative and definitely out of the ordinary! It give the picture a spooky glow and I really like it! 10! It has good focus and all that other stuff, too.</td>', 'Looks like an infrared filter was used here. Very creative and definitely out of the ordinary! It give the picture a spooky glow and I really like it! 10! It has good focus and all that other stuff, too.', '2004-02-02 01:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(565005, 57829, 9073, '<td valign="top">You''re lucky that the challenge directions didn''t specify ''things that go WELL together''. This is a very effective moralistic photograph. Well done. 9</td>', 'You''re lucky that the challenge directions didn''t specify ''things that go WELL together''. This is a very effective moralistic photograph. Well done. 9', '2004-02-02 01:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(565006, 58202, 9073, '<td valign="top">A bit obviously staged, but there''s a good sense of life and action here. 6</td>', 'A bit obviously staged, but there''s a good sense of life and action here. 6', '2004-02-02 01:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(565007, 57956, 8054, '<td valign="top">Although I know what this is, even without the title, I would like to see more of the glove. I really like the details you''ve captured of the glove. Amazing! And it looks like you''ve tried to focus on the glove vs the ball which I also like (nice use of DOF). 8.</td>', 'Although I know what this is, even without the title, I would like to see more of the glove. I really like the details you''ve captured of the glove. Amazing! And it looks like you''ve tried to focus on the glove vs the ball which I also like (nice use of DOF). 8.', '2004-02-02 01:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(565008, 57880, 9073, '<td valign="top">Not my taste. The colours look too artificial, especially on the ball. 3</td>', 'Not my taste. The colours look too artificial, especially on the ball. 3', '2004-02-02 01:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(565010, 57921, 9073, '<td valign="top">These really do go together. You''ve shown a very real and compelling story here. 8</td>', 'These really do go together. You''ve shown a very real and compelling story here. 8', '2004-02-02 01:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(565011, 58090, 8054, '<td valign="top">I know that''s a VW/Audi key (I have one myself). Good focus and details of the metal. I also like the use of DOF to blur the ignition key. I also like the soft lighting.<br/> <br/>Now on to the (only) issue.  :) I would have cloned out the small reddish spot on the silver hoop. Nice overall effort!</td>', 'I know that''s a VW/Audi key (I have one myself). Good focus and details of the metal. I also like the use of DOF to blur the ignition key. I also like the soft lighting. Now on to the (only) issue.  :) I would have cloned out the small reddish spot on the silver hoop. Nice overall effort!', '2004-02-02 01:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(565012, 58124, 8054, '<td valign="top">Hilarious! Although I normally read the comics at the table, to each his own, I say.  :) Is it me or is the top of the tile tilted downward towards the lower right? The floor looks horizontal but the tile throws me off.</td>', 'Hilarious! Although I normally read the comics at the table, to each his own, I say.  :) Is it me or is the top of the tile tilted downward towards the lower right? The floor looks horizontal but the tile throws me off.', '2004-02-02 01:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(565013, 58150, 9073, '<td valign="top">Sorry. It seems that you''ve stretched the challenge a bit too far. Now, if the shot had been done perfectly, I could forgive you. But the lack of water on any other part of the shot indicates a set-up. Also, flower shots need a focal point, that special point of interest. This one lacks this. It is sharp, and the dof is good. 5</td>', 'Sorry. It seems that you''ve stretched the challenge a bit too far. Now, if the shot had been done perfectly, I could forgive you. But the lack of water on any other part of the shot indicates a set-up. Also, flower shots need a focal point, that special point of interest. This one lacks this. It is sharp, and the dof is good. 5', '2004-02-02 01:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(565014, 57791, 9073, '<td valign="top">Wow! A product shot. Very clean. Very effective. Okay, an old technique in DPC, but one done very well here. 9</td>', 'Wow! A product shot. Very clean. Very effective. Okay, an old technique in DPC, but one done very well here. 9', '2004-02-02 01:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(565015, 58206, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Crisp water shows force. High marks for originality and photo quality.</td>', 'Very nice. Crisp water shows force. High marks for originality and photo quality.', '2004-02-02 01:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(565016, 58123, 9073, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what you''re dipping the oreo into. Good composition, but otherwise, for me, a slightly bland image. 4</td>', 'I don''t know what you''re dipping the oreo into. Good composition, but otherwise, for me, a slightly bland image. 4', '2004-02-02 01:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(565018, 58136, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.... very original. Great texture and well done in b/w.</td>', 'Nice photo.... very original. Great texture and well done in b/w.', '2004-02-02 01:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(565020, 57829, 12160, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Love the color and composition. Concept is very original.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Love the color and composition. Concept is very original.', '2004-02-02 01:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(565021, 57875, 9073, '<td valign="top">I know that you''re trying for a relaxed, subdued mood here. I just find the effect a little soft and a little lacking. 3</td>', 'I know that you''re trying for a relaxed, subdued mood here. I just find the effect a little soft and a little lacking. 3', '2004-02-02 01:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(565024, 57191, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great</td>', 'Great', '2004-02-02 01:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(565025, 58200, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice, romantic effect here. The exposure on the cheese is fine, but you needed to adjust your levels to bring the bottle and glass into the frame. I''m not sure about the stem being cut off, or the actual positioning of the rose head. 4</td>', 'Nice, romantic effect here. The exposure on the cheese is fine, but you needed to adjust your levels to bring the bottle and glass into the frame. I''m not sure about the stem being cut off, or the actual positioning of the rose head. 4', '2004-02-02 01:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(565026, 58150, 12160, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Crystal clear focus... shallow dof works really well... exposure and composition and perfect.</td>', 'Great photo. Crystal clear focus... shallow dof works really well... exposure and composition and perfect.', '2004-02-02 01:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(565028, 57607, 9073, '<td valign="top">What a bad joke. Ouch. A well-taken shot, though. For me, it''s just not that interesting. 4</td>', 'What a bad joke. Ouch. A well-taken shot, though. For me, it''s just not that interesting. 4', '2004-02-02 01:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(565031, 58101, 9073, '<td valign="top">This has a very classy feel to it. The nostalgic colours, the oldness of the leather, the black backing. I think, for me, the best thing here is the tonal range. Very nice. Just one little gripe, for me, the challenge wasn''t to shoot things which are commonly used together, but to create interesting combinations. 9</td>', 'This has a very classy feel to it. The nostalgic colours, the oldness of the leather, the black backing. I think, for me, the best thing here is the tonal range. Very nice. Just one little gripe, for me, the challenge wasn''t to shoot things which are commonly used together, but to create interesting combinations. 9', '2004-02-02 01:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(565033, 57929, 9073, '<td valign="top">Needles and thread. I feel that the compositional aspect of this shot needs some more thought. The top layer has been cut off for no reason I can see. The black foreground gives the needle some space, but it seems too set-up for my tastes. 4</td>', 'Needles and thread. I feel that the compositional aspect of this shot needs some more thought. The top layer has been cut off for no reason I can see. The black foreground gives the needle some space, but it seems too set-up for my tastes. 4', '2004-02-02 02:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
