(565058, 57759, 16188, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.</td>', 'What a great shot.', '2004-02-02 02:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(565059, 57896, 9073, '<td valign="top">Whereas this is skillful capture, I''m not left feeling much about this shot. 3</td>', 'Whereas this is skillful capture, I''m not left feeling much about this shot. 3', '2004-02-02 02:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(565060, 57191, 14499, '<td valign="top">Interesting, love the lack of depth.</td>', 'Interesting, love the lack of depth.', '2004-02-02 02:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(565061, 57843, 9073, '<td valign="top">They would go well together, but I can''t see the heels. Also, the skirt at the top distracts a touch. 4</td>', 'They would go well together, but I can''t see the heels. Also, the skirt at the top distracts a touch. 4', '2004-02-02 02:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(565062, 58145, 16188, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, well executed. :)</td>', 'Fun idea, well executed. :)', '2004-02-02 02:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(565065, 58180, 9073, '<td valign="top">The colour scheme seems a bit off. Also the subject isn''t exactly enthralling. Sorry. 3</td>', 'The colour scheme seems a bit off. Also the subject isn''t exactly enthralling. Sorry. 3', '2004-02-02 02:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(565066, 57634, 14499, '<td valign="top">my first thought was ...WHAT THE!   its pretty cool though :)</td>', 'my first thought was ...WHAT THE!   its pretty cool though :)', '2004-02-02 02:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(565067, 57582, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. One of the best. Everything works just great together. I wish I took this shot. 10</td>', 'Excellent photo. One of the best. Everything works just great together. I wish I took this shot. 10', '2004-02-02 02:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(565068, 58085, 16188, '<td valign="top">I always associated Guns and Roses with hard rock rather than soft focus! :)</td>', 'I always associated Guns and Roses with hard rock rather than soft focus! :)', '2004-02-02 02:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(565069, 57760, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge theme. I like the space concept here. The peas are all tightly bunched up, so you''ve given a lot of white to balance. Nice. The peas, though, look a bit plasticky. 8</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge theme. I like the space concept here. The peas are all tightly bunched up, so you''ve given a lot of white to balance. Nice. The peas, though, look a bit plasticky. 8', '2004-02-02 02:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(565070, 58108, 16188, '<td valign="top">Indeed! :)</td>', 'Indeed! :)', '2004-02-02 02:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(565071, 58204, 9073, '<td valign="top">The backing adds a classy touch to this shot. The sheet''s colours balance well with the violin. The music, itself, though is a bit dark. The white of the paper could be brought out more. The right side of the instrument, too, is too dark, indicating a general underexposure in the scene. 5</td>', 'The backing adds a classy touch to this shot. The sheet''s colours balance well with the violin. The music, itself, though is a bit dark. The white of the paper could be brought out more. The right side of the instrument, too, is too dark, indicating a general underexposure in the scene. 5', '2004-02-02 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(565072, 57723, 14499, '<td valign="top">Ahh that make 2 peas and carrots! I like this betterthough :) very clever. 8.... "My mother used to say!"</td>', 'Ahh that make 2 peas and carrots! I like this betterthough :) very clever. 8.... "My mother used to say!"', '2004-02-02 02:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(565073, 58090, 9073, '<td valign="top">Even though this is a nicely executed shot, just a key set by itself is a rather bland subject. The placing high in the frame, helps, though. 5</td>', 'Even though this is a nicely executed shot, just a key set by itself is a rather bland subject. The placing high in the frame, helps, though. 5', '2004-02-02 02:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(565075, 57936, 9073, '<td valign="top">Cute. I like the general layout of this shot, and the content is appealing, too. One little quibble, the fur looks a bit odd. 7</td>', 'Cute. I like the general layout of this shot, and the content is appealing, too. One little quibble, the fur looks a bit odd. 7', '2004-02-02 02:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(565076, 57676, 9073, '<td valign="top">The level of sharpening  used really upsets the overall feel. The brights stand out too much, especially noticable on the handle of the brush. Nice idea, though. 5</td>', 'The level of sharpening  used really upsets the overall feel. The brights stand out too much, especially noticable on the handle of the brush. Nice idea, though. 5', '2004-02-02 02:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(565077, 57759, 9073, '<td valign="top">Spot on. (Just a question - an outtake for the NG challenge?) Nothing to say except fabulous.10</td>', 'Spot on. (Just a question - an outtake for the NG challenge?) Nothing to say except fabulous.10', '2004-02-02 02:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(565078, 58080, 14499, '<td valign="top">Simple and efective a 10 from me!</td>', 'Simple and efective a 10 from me!', '2004-02-02 02:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(565079, 57751, 16188, '<td valign="top">Are you and the cat setting the fish up...? :)</td>', 'Are you and the cat setting the fish up...? :)', '2004-02-02 02:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(565080, 57760, 14499, '<td valign="top">Beutifull, just squeeses under my radar for fitting the mandate and slots right into a 10</td>', 'Beutifull, just squeeses under my radar for fitting the mandate and slots right into a 10', '2004-02-02 02:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(565081, 57935, 9073, '<td valign="top">Lovely, vibrant colours. Sharp and clean. Nice image. Maybe the old flower to the left could have been cropped out. 8</td>', 'Lovely, vibrant colours. Sharp and clean. Nice image. Maybe the old flower to the left could have been cropped out. 8', '2004-02-02 02:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(565083, 57641, 9073, '<td valign="top">They certainly are. So, unfortunately, are flashes and shadows. Real care has to be taken to avoid them. 4</td>', 'They certainly are. So, unfortunately, are flashes and shadows. Real care has to be taken to avoid them. 4', '2004-02-02 02:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(565084, 57493, 14499, '<td valign="top">Ohhh ... I like that, and I just had the same theme on the last image too!<br/>I really like this :) I will either try and replicate it or buy a print off you :)  Ohh yeah lots of Ideas comming to me now... may get that bottle of Grange out...10 from me.</td>', 'Ohhh ... I like that, and I just had the same theme on the last image too!I really like this :) I will either try and replicate it or buy a print off you :)  Ohh yeah lots of Ideas comming to me now... may get that bottle of Grange out...10 from me.', '2004-02-02 02:35:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(565085, 57894, 9073, '<td valign="top">This has the makings of a good shot. But you needed to get close in and bring out the colours of the moth more. The empty space on the left does nothing here. 4</td>', 'This has the makings of a good shot. But you needed to get close in and bring out the colours of the moth more. The empty space on the left does nothing here. 4', '2004-02-02 02:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(565086, 58110, 16188, '<td valign="top">That''s funny. :)</td>', 'That''s funny. :)', '2004-02-02 02:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(565087, 57888, 9073, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry. Even if they do go together, I don''t think that they make an interesting subject as is. Your capture is fine, no technical complaints. 3</td>', 'I''m sorry. Even if they do go together, I don''t think that they make an interesting subject as is. Your capture is fine, no technical complaints. 3', '2004-02-02 02:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(565089, 58207, 9073, '<td valign="top">A good, classy interpretation of the challenge theme. I like the border a lot. Also, I like the overal tonal range. On the negative side, I think that the coins at the top are overexposed and that there''s an overal softness. 6</td>', 'A good, classy interpretation of the challenge theme. I like the border a lot. Also, I like the overal tonal range. On the negative side, I think that the coins at the top are overexposed and that there''s an overal softness. 6', '2004-02-02 02:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(565090, 58147, 9073, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice subdued feeling here. A comfortable scene. I wouldn''t have cropped to have the glasses touching the border at the bottom, though. 6</td>', 'There''s a nice subdued feeling here. A comfortable scene. I wouldn''t have cropped to have the glasses touching the border at the bottom, though. 6', '2004-02-02 02:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(565091, 58085, 9073, '<td valign="top">This shot would be a winner if the focus had been sharp. 4</td>', 'This shot would be a winner if the focus had been sharp. 4', '2004-02-02 02:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(565092, 58192, 16188, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and lighting as well as the fantastic combination of the elements and title.</td>', 'I really like the composition and lighting as well as the fantastic combination of the elements and title.', '2004-02-02 03:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(565093, 58208, 9073, '<td valign="top">I find this scene too busy and lacking a main point of interest to work. 4</td>', 'I find this scene too busy and lacking a main point of interest to work. 4', '2004-02-02 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(565095, 57565, 9073, '<td valign="top">I take it that the wiggly lines in the left section are meant to represent sound waves. Okay. The guitar isn''t as sharp as it needs to be. Also, for the sound waves to exist, the guitar strings need to be moving too. 4</td>', 'I take it that the wiggly lines in the left section are meant to represent sound waves. Okay. The guitar isn''t as sharp as it needs to be. Also, for the sound waves to exist, the guitar strings need to be moving too. 4', '2004-02-02 03:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(565096, 58119, 16703, '<td valign="top">suberb DOF, shadows, lighting... this is the best of all lock and key pictures i think. definetaly a contender for the "ribbon"...</td>', 'suberb DOF, shadows, lighting... this is the best of all lock and key pictures i think. definetaly a contender for the "ribbon"...', '2004-02-02 03:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(565097, 57893, 9073, '<td valign="top">Good idea. The skin texture is a bit off due to the flash(?) especially noticable to the right of the nose. 5</td>', 'Good idea. The skin texture is a bit off due to the flash(?) especially noticable to the right of the nose. 5', '2004-02-02 03:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(565098, 58198, 9073, '<td valign="top">Hey! For the first time so far, I''ve seen a lock and key shot which I like. You''ve filled the frame well. You managed to personify the objects with a kind of ''in-your-face'' attitude. Well done. This shot means something to me. 9</td>', 'Hey! For the first time so far, I''ve seen a lock and key shot which I like. You''ve filled the frame well. You managed to personify the objects with a kind of ''in-your-face'' attitude. Well done. This shot means something to me. 9', '2004-02-02 03:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(565099, 57582, 16703, '<td valign="top">a rocket! a spaceship! ohh no, it is a stapler! i have never seen a stapler looking this good... there is something haunting about seeing everyday objects from fresh new perspectives... a great photo...</td>', 'a rocket! a spaceship! ohh no, it is a stapler! i have never seen a stapler looking this good... there is something haunting about seeing everyday objects from fresh new perspectives... a great photo...', '2004-02-02 03:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(565100, 58043, 3540, '<td valign="top">A Les Paul Custom?</td>', 'A Les Paul Custom?', '2004-02-02 03:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(565102, 57812, 9073, '<td valign="top">I really like the border you created using the paper ontop of a black backing. Neat. A cute idea. 7</td>', 'I really like the border you created using the paper ontop of a black backing. Neat. A cute idea. 7', '2004-02-02 03:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(565103, 57792, 16703, '<td valign="top">this is a remarkable image... it represents the challenge subject rather differently.. but in my opinion this needs to be way on top.. i hope you dont get burned because of subject matter..</td>', 'this is a remarkable image... it represents the challenge subject rather differently.. but in my opinion this needs to be way on top.. i hope you dont get burned because of subject matter..', '2004-02-02 03:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(565104, 58148, 9073, '<td valign="top">Stylish and well executed. The low key element works well here. 7</td>', 'Stylish and well executed. The low key element works well here. 7', '2004-02-02 03:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(565105, 57935, 16703, '<td valign="top">this picture makes me wanna get naked and run around in flower fields.. vivid colors and sharp focus... i only wish the bee was facing the camera...</td>', 'this picture makes me wanna get naked and run around in flower fields.. vivid colors and sharp focus... i only wish the bee was facing the camera...', '2004-02-02 03:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(565106, 58082, 9073, '<td valign="top">When the challenge is over, please post the original for all to see. A truly remarkable shot. 9</td>', 'When the challenge is over, please post the original for all to see. A truly remarkable shot. 9', '2004-02-02 03:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(565107, 57881, 16703, '<td valign="top">this is the photo that makes me want to come back as a lipstick when i am reincarnated...</td>', 'this is the photo that makes me want to come back as a lipstick when i am reincarnated...', '2004-02-02 03:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(565109, 57430, 9073, '<td valign="top">You''ve used the light as a graphic element - that''s both daring and artistic. Good luck in the challenge. I''ll give a 6 because, although I''m not overly fond of this image, you deserve it.</td>', 'You''ve used the light as a graphic element - that''s both daring and artistic. Good luck in the challenge. I''ll give a 6 because, although I''m not overly fond of this image, you deserve it.', '2004-02-02 03:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(565110, 58036, 9073, '<td valign="top">They do go well together. The capture is fine, but the overal effect is a touch bland for me. Sorry. 4</td>', 'They do go well together. The capture is fine, but the overal effect is a touch bland for me. Sorry. 4', '2004-02-02 03:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(565111, 57728, 9073, '<td valign="top">They go well together. The composition, capture, elements are all fine. I''m not moved by the photo, though. 5</td>', 'They go well together. The composition, capture, elements are all fine. I''m not moved by the photo, though. 5', '2004-02-02 03:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(565113, 57996, 9073, '<td valign="top">Sorry. Although these things fit the challenge very well, I''m not sure that they make an interesting photo as is. You need to find a way to photograph them which brings out their taste or their colours, or something which is more visually interesting. 2</td>', 'Sorry. Although these things fit the challenge very well, I''m not sure that they make an interesting photo as is. You need to find a way to photograph them which brings out their taste or their colours, or something which is more visually interesting. 2', '2004-02-02 03:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(565116, 57712, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I''d have preferred a purely triangular approach here, seeing as the watch face is almost the same size as the coins. The extra coins at the bottom confuse me. 4</td>', 'Nice idea. I''d have preferred a purely triangular approach here, seeing as the watch face is almost the same size as the coins. The extra coins at the bottom confuse me. 4', '2004-02-02 03:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(565120, 58094, 7703, '<td valign="top">Hehe one of my coworker drinks Corona and puts a slice of this fruit (lemon?) down into the bootle :) I gues then this must go together :)<br/>You should have taken the knife away because it distract to much. Other then that then this it''s fine and I give you 6</td>', 'Hehe one of my coworker drinks Corona and puts a slice of this fruit (lemon?) down into the bootle :) I gues then this must go together :)You should have taken the knife away because it distract to much. Other then that then this it''s fine and I give you 6', '2004-02-02 03:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(565127, 57077, 7703, '<td valign="top">Digital art? If not then please tell ...</td>', 'Digital art? If not then please tell ...', '2004-02-02 03:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(565134, 57935, 12902, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful... I will sure see it somewhere on the top. I like the way you managed to pull the flower out of the field. Wonderful composition and very bright, vivid colours. 10</td>', 'This is so beautiful... I will sure see it somewhere on the top. I like the way you managed to pull the flower out of the field. Wonderful composition and very bright, vivid colours. 10', '2004-02-02 04:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(565138, 57417, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, really nice detail and nice clean background the colour of which really complements the peppercorn reds.</td>', 'Beautifully done, really nice detail and nice clean background the colour of which really complements the peppercorn reds.', '2004-02-02 04:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(565139, 57760, 3087, '<td valign="top">Composition within the empty frame works well, could see this used in an advertisement. Nicely done!</td>', 'Composition within the empty frame works well, could see this used in an advertisement. Nicely done!', '2004-02-02 04:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(565141, 58119, 3087, '<td valign="top">Black and white is absolutely the right choice and really throws the focus onto your lovely use of light and shadow.</td>', 'Black and white is absolutely the right choice and really throws the focus onto your lovely use of light and shadow.', '2004-02-02 04:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(565142, 57758, 3087, '<td valign="top">Some great opposing diagonals here which really complement the circle of the bowl.</td>', 'Some great opposing diagonals here which really complement the circle of the bowl.', '2004-02-02 04:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(565143, 58124, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strategic positioning of the paper there! Black and white does lift this I think.</td>', 'Strategic positioning of the paper there! Black and white does lift this I think.', '2004-02-02 04:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(565144, 57728, 3087, '<td valign="top">Composition is great but focus seems too soft to me.</td>', 'Composition is great but focus seems too soft to me.', '2004-02-02 04:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(565145, 58101, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely "still life" kind of image... seems to convey a whole life story.</td>', 'A lovely "still life" kind of image... seems to convey a whole life story.', '2004-02-02 04:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(565147, 57956, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the texture detail. Feels just a touch too dark at lower end of frame to me though I do like the shadow behind glove, infront of ball.</td>', 'Love the texture detail. Feels just a touch too dark at lower end of frame to me though I do like the shadow behind glove, infront of ball.', '2004-02-02 05:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(565149, 57766, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of thing I can actually see on the front cover of serious magazines... Excellent use of lighting.</td>', 'This is the kind of thing I can actually see on the front cover of serious magazines... Excellent use of lighting.', '2004-02-02 05:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(565150, 58142, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea - execution not as strong - the biggest problem for me is the angle of the pots - they need to be parallel. The line between black and white could also be a little neater. But I do like the diagonal composition you''ve designed.</td>', 'Great idea - execution not as strong - the biggest problem for me is the angle of the pots - they need to be parallel. The line between black and white could also be a little neater. But I do like the diagonal composition you''ve designed.', '2004-02-02 05:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(565151, 58119, 7263, '<td valign="top">great shot - like the darkness and the contrast. 10</td>', 'great shot - like the darkness and the contrast. 10', '2004-02-02 05:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(565152, 57612, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and I love that we can actually see the pattern from printing - what''s that called now? I think it might be moire, I always forget. It''s cool that it''s visible so clearly.</td>', 'Nice shapes and I love that we can actually see the pattern from printing - what''s that called now? I think it might be moire, I always forget. It''s cool that it''s visible so clearly.', '2004-02-02 05:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(565153, 58040, 7263, '<td valign="top">great idea for the challenge - very well executed. Only bad point is the border - think it''s awful - sorry. But you photo is superb.</td>', 'great idea for the challenge - very well executed. Only bad point is the border - think it''s awful - sorry. But you photo is superb.', '2004-02-02 05:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(565154, 58178, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done but lighting is a little low - the peppercorns really fade into the background. Either a little more lighting to bring those out or perhaps a different colour background.</td>', 'Nicely done but lighting is a little low - the peppercorns really fade into the background. Either a little more lighting to bring those out or perhaps a different colour background.', '2004-02-02 05:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(565155, 57883, 6130, '<td valign="top">This is very good.</td>', 'This is very good.', '2004-02-02 05:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(565156, 57613, 6130, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.', '2004-02-02 05:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(565157, 58179, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2004-02-02 05:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(565161, 58197, 14499, '<td valign="top">Note that well done I am afraid, looks very fake.</td>', 'Note that well done I am afraid, looks very fake.', '2004-02-02 06:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(565162, 58040, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very sharp image, well lit.</td>', 'Very sharp image, well lit.', '2004-02-02 06:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(565163, 58108, 14499, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of interesting things to look at here. Needs a stand out feature e.g. No green tree in the B/G More interesting sky, better angle on the tree. I guess what I am saying is... It just looks like a snap shot to me, I could go out side and do the same thing in 30 Seconds. A good pictures needs somthing special.</td>', 'Not a lot of interesting things to look at here. Needs a stand out feature e.g. No green tree in the B/G More interesting sky, better angle on the tree. I guess what I am saying is... It just looks like a snap shot to me, I could go out side and do the same thing in 30 Seconds. A good pictures needs somthing special.', '2004-02-02 06:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(565164, 58035, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very moody feel to this image,suits the b/w format.</td>', 'Very moody feel to this image,suits the b/w format.', '2004-02-02 06:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(565165, 57612, 14603, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed</td>', 'Great idea and well executed', '2004-02-02 06:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
