(565354, 57939, 8624, '<td valign="top">I see that several other people went for this idea too. The tilt really distracts me. I keep waiting for the  S&amp;P container and the plate to go sliding out of frame. I also think that the yin/yang, which should be the main subject of the image, is overwhelmed by the plate.</td>', 'I see that several other people went for this idea too. The tilt really distracts me. I keep waiting for the  S&P container and the plate to go sliding out of frame. I also think that the yin/yang, which should be the main subject of the image, is overwhelmed by the plate.', '2004-02-02 09:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(565355, 58119, 14068, '<td valign="top">Great use of outlining with light and shadows for a well choosen pair of objects. One of my favorties (9).</td>', 'Great use of outlining with light and shadows for a well choosen pair of objects. One of my favorties (9).', '2004-02-02 09:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(565356, 57607, 8624, '<td valign="top">cute. nice composition, although the hot spots on the bolts are overblown.</td>', 'cute. nice composition, although the hot spots on the bolts are overblown.', '2004-02-02 09:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(565357, 57751, 14068, '<td valign="top">IMrpessive how they stare at each other.Great concept and well done! 9</td>', 'IMrpessive how they stare at each other.Great concept and well done! 9', '2004-02-02 09:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(565358, 58080, 8624, '<td valign="top">simple and elegant. I would have preferred greater depth of field to get the back piece more in focus, but it still works OK.</td>', 'simple and elegant. I would have preferred greater depth of field to get the back piece more in focus, but it still works OK.', '2004-02-02 09:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(565359, 58149, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but would have preferred to see the sunglasses withought the rectangular reflections in the lenses. nicely cropped and composed.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but would have preferred to see the sunglasses withought the rectangular reflections in the lenses. nicely cropped and composed.', '2004-02-02 09:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(565360, 57490, 13336, '<td valign="top">there seems to be a little too much green happening here - the black of the camera seems way more green than i think it actually is.  nice composition.  a little low in contrast.</td>', 'there seems to be a little too much green happening here - the black of the camera seems way more green than i think it actually is.  nice composition.  a little low in contrast.', '2004-02-02 09:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(565362, 57417, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the closeup detail in this shot, as compared with the several other entries that attempted the same thing. The rock salt gives nice textural contrast to the whole peppercorns. I don''t like the background though. I don''t know if you masked it out but it looks very unnatual to me. I would have preferred a more appropriate setting for the subject and natural shadows.</td>', 'I like the closeup detail in this shot, as compared with the several other entries that attempted the same thing. The rock salt gives nice textural contrast to the whole peppercorns. I don''t like the background though. I don''t know if you masked it out but it looks very unnatual to me. I would have preferred a more appropriate setting for the subject and natural shadows.', '2004-02-02 09:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(565363, 57676, 8624, '<td valign="top">nicely composed, but I don''t care for the out of focus inkwell being in the foreground. I think it distracts from the subject. I like shallow DOF, but would tend to place the secondary objects in the back so they do not dominate the image.</td>', 'nicely composed, but I don''t care for the out of focus inkwell being in the foreground. I think it distracts from the subject. I like shallow DOF, but would tend to place the secondary objects in the back so they do not dominate the image.', '2004-02-02 09:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(565365, 58119, 8624, '<td valign="top">very nice. the leading lines of the dorr moldings strengthen the shot. I like the linear contrast between the dangling vertical keys and the horizontal key in the lock. lighting is good and moody.</td>', 'very nice. the leading lines of the dorr moldings strengthen the shot. I like the linear contrast between the dangling vertical keys and the horizontal key in the lock. lighting is good and moody.', '2004-02-02 09:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(565366, 58010, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice and sharp, but I think the illustration in the foreground detracts from the glasses.</td>', 'nice and sharp, but I think the illustration in the foreground detracts from the glasses.', '2004-02-02 09:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(565367, 58196, 8624, '<td valign="top">clever take - "things that don''t go together". I like the composition except for the out of frame screw. it would have been more visually interesting if it crossed the frame boundary but you could still see the whole thing. as it is, it just looks awkwardly cut off.</td>', 'clever take - "things that don''t go together". I like the composition except for the out of frame screw. it would have been more visually interesting if it crossed the frame boundary but you could still see the whole thing. as it is, it just looks awkwardly cut off.', '2004-02-02 09:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(565369, 58196, 13336, '<td valign="top">great idea and strong composition.  great use of dof.  i really dig the contrast of natural sepia tones and white background.  the border is simple and sharp and the way that one nail goes over the line is smart and adds to the enjoyment of the image.  though this is definately an example of futility, the lightness of the presentation makes it accessible.  creative, strong, effective.  my idea of a perfect 10.</td>', 'great idea and strong composition.  great use of dof.  i really dig the contrast of natural sepia tones and white background.  the border is simple and sharp and the way that one nail goes over the line is smart and adds to the enjoyment of the image.  though this is definately an example of futility, the lightness of the presentation makes it accessible.  creative, strong, effective.  my idea of a perfect 10.', '2004-02-02 09:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(565370, 58110, 8624, '<td valign="top">I''ll be interested in reading how you set up the shot to have the cookie floating like this.</td>', 'I''ll be interested in reading how you set up the shot to have the cookie floating like this.', '2004-02-02 09:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(565371, 58205, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice use of color and negative space. I don''t know of the steam swirl was digitally added, but it looks good.</td>', 'nice use of color and negative space. I don''t know of the steam swirl was digitally added, but it looks good.', '2004-02-02 09:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(565372, 57781, 8624, '<td valign="top">I think my arteries are hardening just looking at this image...</td>', 'I think my arteries are hardening just looking at this image...', '2004-02-02 09:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(565373, 58204, 13336, '<td valign="top">this is nice, but it could probably do with some greater contrast, maybe with some mroe dramatic lighting.  right now it looks a little flat.</td>', 'this is nice, but it could probably do with some greater contrast, maybe with some mroe dramatic lighting.  right now it looks a little flat.', '2004-02-02 09:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(565374, 57564, 8624, '<td valign="top">I think there might have been a more visually interesting way to show the relationship between soda and ice, perhaps with the beverage pouring over the ice. As it is, it is pretty static.</td>', 'I think there might have been a more visually interesting way to show the relationship between soda and ice, perhaps with the beverage pouring over the ice. As it is, it is pretty static.', '2004-02-02 09:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(565378, 58195, 14477, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred this photo with a darker background.</td>', 'Would have preferred this photo with a darker background.', '2004-02-02 09:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(565379, 57751, 5158, '<td valign="top">My favorit in this challenge! How the cat looks at the fish is awesome. Would have liked it to see a bit more of the glass though.<br/>Hope you do very well!</td>', 'My favorit in this challenge! How the cat looks at the fish is awesome. Would have liked it to see a bit more of the glass though.Hope you do very well!', '2004-02-02 09:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(565380, 57876, 13336, '<td valign="top">is the idea that the word PAIR denotes the idea that two things go together?  i''m not quite seeing anything else that seems to be an exploration of this challenge, and the word alone, painted on the side of a bus (?) isn''t doing much for me in terms of a photograph.  I do think there is some interesting composition going on here with the levels of different lines, the rivets and the archs of the tires below, but its not enough to carry the image without a stronger central focus.  i give it a 6.</td>', 'is the idea that the word PAIR denotes the idea that two things go together?  i''m not quite seeing anything else that seems to be an exploration of this challenge, and the word alone, painted on the side of a bus (?) isn''t doing much for me in terms of a photograph.  I do think there is some interesting composition going on here with the levels of different lines, the rivets and the archs of the tires below, but its not enough to carry the image without a stronger central focus.  i give it a 6.', '2004-02-02 09:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(565381, 57493, 8624, '<td valign="top">Your exposure is very good. I like the composition, but not the angle.  I think I understand the look and feel you were going for, but liguids presented at an angle like this look unnatural, like it will slide off the frame at any moment.</td>', 'Your exposure is very good. I like the composition, but not the angle.  I think I understand the look and feel you were going for, but liguids presented at an angle like this look unnatural, like it will slide off the frame at any moment.', '2004-02-02 09:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(565383, 58110, 14398, '<td valign="top">NIce action shot. Took me a second to see that it was mid-air.</td>', 'NIce action shot. Took me a second to see that it was mid-air.', '2004-02-02 09:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(565384, 57816, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but I would have preferred to see you position the bird lower in the frame, making better use of the whitespace around and above it.</td>', 'I like this image, but I would have preferred to see you position the bird lower in the frame, making better use of the whitespace around and above it.', '2004-02-02 09:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(565385, 57473, 13336, '<td valign="top">its pretty grainy, but the grain kind of goes well here.  gives it a bit of a film noir feel.</td>', 'its pretty grainy, but the grain kind of goes well here.  gives it a bit of a film noir feel.', '2004-02-02 09:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(565386, 58146, 8624, '<td valign="top">why keep the lens cap on, wouldn''t it be more visually appealing to see the lens details?</td>', 'why keep the lens cap on, wouldn''t it be more visually appealing to see the lens details?', '2004-02-02 09:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(565388, 57883, 8624, '<td valign="top">The red makes a nice colorful contrast with the rest of the scene. nice textures.</td>', 'The red makes a nice colorful contrast with the rest of the scene. nice textures.', '2004-02-02 09:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(565389, 58110, 14453, '<td valign="top">I also took a cookies and milk picture... But I am proud I choose chocolate chips instead of  Oreo!!!  I like the contrast, short focus is also well done.  Maybe a bit dark. 8</td>', 'I also took a cookies and milk picture... But I am proud I choose chocolate chips instead of  Oreo!!!  I like the contrast, short focus is also well done.  Maybe a bit dark. 8', '2004-02-02 09:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(565390, 58056, 13336, '<td valign="top">the composition of the fireplace seems a little flat.  did you mean to have that basket sticking in on the left side - it seems kind of haphazardly out of place.  i see the effect you used here in the taking of the photograph, but i''m not seeing why two semi-transparent images of a person by a fire are being used here - it seems tacked on.  you obviously have strong photographic potential, i think there just needs to be a little more consideration put into it.</td>', 'the composition of the fireplace seems a little flat.  did you mean to have that basket sticking in on the left side - it seems kind of haphazardly out of place.  i see the effect you used here in the taking of the photograph, but i''m not seeing why two semi-transparent images of a person by a fire are being used here - it seems tacked on.  you obviously have strong photographic potential, i think there just needs to be a little more consideration put into it.', '2004-02-02 09:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(565391, 57792, 13336, '<td valign="top">dramatic pose and use of lighting.  very effective.</td>', 'dramatic pose and use of lighting.  very effective.', '2004-02-02 09:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(565392, 58083, 13336, '<td valign="top">normally i find color really does wonders for a photo, the more the merrier, but this seems to have stepped just a little bit over the edge.  great composition, use of negagive space, and the lighting is nice and even.  the pen and paper are just a little tacky for my taste.</td>', 'normally i find color really does wonders for a photo, the more the merrier, but this seems to have stepped just a little bit over the edge.  great composition, use of negagive space, and the lighting is nice and even.  the pen and paper are just a little tacky for my taste.', '2004-02-02 10:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(565395, 57077, 14398, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept.  Good use of the glass chess pieces. ;)</td>', 'Excellent concept.  Good use of the glass chess pieces. ;)', '2004-02-02 10:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(565400, 58058, 13336, '<td valign="top">this image is a tad chaotic - there is nothing drawing my eye in any controlled direction - i''m shifting all over the image with all the lines and breaks in space.  in a way i find this interesting, but i still think it could have used a little more control.</td>', 'this image is a tad chaotic - there is nothing drawing my eye in any controlled direction - i''m shifting all over the image with all the lines and breaks in space.  in a way i find this interesting, but i still think it could have used a little more control.', '2004-02-02 10:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(565401, 57402, 13336, '<td valign="top">nice and simple.  good placement of the subject, i like the white space.  the lighting is nice and even except for a touch of overexposure on the top inside rim.</td>', 'nice and simple.  good placement of the subject, i like the white space.  the lighting is nice and even except for a touch of overexposure on the top inside rim.', '2004-02-02 10:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(565402, 57403, 14398, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised there weren''t more of these.  8 for idea!</td>', 'I''m surprised there weren''t more of these.  8 for idea!', '2004-02-02 10:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(565403, 57746, 14398, '<td valign="top">Nice choice in gun.</td>', 'Nice choice in gun.', '2004-02-02 10:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(565404, 58178, 9964, '<td valign="top">-<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-09 00:04:38.</i></td>', '-', '2004-02-02 10:21:29.000000', '2005-04-09 01:04:38.000000', 1),
(565405, 58090, 14398, '<td valign="top">Ahhh a VW owner very nice... 7</td>', 'Ahhh a VW owner very nice... 7', '2004-02-02 10:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(565406, 58101, 13336, '<td valign="top">hmmm, this is nice, i like the sepia tones, and the ball and glove come off as having a lot of character and history, but i find the square framing a little dull.  i think a little more negative space above the glove would have been nice here.  i like the black background, but with the soft contrast happening in the subjects it makes the overall image a little dim.  not sure if white would be better or maybe just a little more contrast in the subject.  this is easily an 8 with the potential to have been a 10.  nice work.</td>', 'hmmm, this is nice, i like the sepia tones, and the ball and glove come off as having a lot of character and history, but i find the square framing a little dull.  i think a little more negative space above the glove would have been nice here.  i like the black background, but with the soft contrast happening in the subjects it makes the overall image a little dim.  not sure if white would be better or maybe just a little more contrast in the subject.  this is easily an 8 with the potential to have been a 10.  nice work.', '2004-02-02 10:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(565411, 57751, 9964, '<td valign="top">-<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-09 00:03:50.</i></td>', '-', '2004-02-02 10:28:25.000000', '2005-04-09 01:03:50.000000', 1),
(565413, 57894, 13336, '<td valign="top">wow - that is a great capture.  i''ve been staring at this, marveling at how you were able to catch the moth so perfectly still (when those things fly it is a blur of powdery wing action) and yet achieve such a high level of detail and richness of color.  i''m figuring the lightbulb must be giving off a fair ammount of light.  nice composition, i dig the background, the lines, the rustic remnants of paint, the negative space.  very nice.  you get a 9.</td>', 'wow - that is a great capture.  i''ve been staring at this, marveling at how you were able to catch the moth so perfectly still (when those things fly it is a blur of powdery wing action) and yet achieve such a high level of detail and richness of color.  i''m figuring the lightbulb must be giving off a fair ammount of light.  nice composition, i dig the background, the lines, the rustic remnants of paint, the negative space.  very nice.  you get a 9.', '2004-02-02 10:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(565415, 57641, 14477, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed</td>', 'A bit overexposed', '2004-02-02 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(565416, 58198, 13336, '<td valign="top">dof here is a little shallow, or perhaps misplaced.  if it could have been pulled ahead a bit so as not to lose the tips of the keys...</td>', 'dof here is a little shallow, or perhaps misplaced.  if it could have been pulled ahead a bit so as not to lose the tips of the keys...', '2004-02-02 10:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(565419, 58040, 9964, '<td valign="top">wonderful color and detail</td>', 'wonderful color and detail', '2004-02-02 10:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(565421, 57995, 9964, '<td valign="top">great shot. Nice use of DOF</td>', 'great shot. Nice use of DOF', '2004-02-02 10:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(565422, 58147, 9964, '<td valign="top">-<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-09 00:02:56.</i></td>', '-', '2004-02-02 10:42:54.000000', '2005-04-09 01:02:56.000000', 1),
(565423, 57893, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the desaturation and composition.  Lighting is too harsh and hot and is clearly visible in the lipstick holder. It has also caused a problem with loss of detail in parts of the cheeks and glare in the lips.  It appears like her nose is running. Finally, the visible hairs around the nostrils and cheek are unsightly.</td>', 'I like the desaturation and composition.  Lighting is too harsh and hot and is clearly visible in the lipstick holder. It has also caused a problem with loss of detail in parts of the cheeks and glare in the lips.  It appears like her nose is running. Finally, the visible hairs around the nostrils and cheek are unsightly.', '2004-02-02 10:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(565425, 58146, 5822, '<td valign="top">Camera looks too dark and you''ve lost too much detail. Plus, the photo appears to have a yellow cast.  Composition is good but I would prefer a less saturated background.</td>', 'Camera looks too dark and you''ve lost too much detail. Plus, the photo appears to have a yellow cast.  Composition is good but I would prefer a less saturated background.', '2004-02-02 10:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(565427, 58010, 5822, '<td valign="top">This version of this common subject matter brings nothing fresh or interesting and you''ve ignored the top third of the photo.</td>', 'This version of this common subject matter brings nothing fresh or interesting and you''ve ignored the top third of the photo.', '2004-02-02 10:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(565428, 58182, 13336, '<td valign="top">sorry, but i have to disagree.  these do not go together at all.</td>', 'sorry, but i have to disagree.  these do not go together at all.', '2004-02-02 11:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(565429, 57403, 5822, '<td valign="top">Looks like I can see your shadow top left and focus could be more crisp.  I do like your take on the subject of cutting off the crust.</td>', 'Looks like I can see your shadow top left and focus could be more crisp.  I do like your take on the subject of cutting off the crust.', '2004-02-02 11:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(565430, 57829, 13336, '<td valign="top">unfortunate and true.  as hideous as this is, you have captured it well.</td>', 'unfortunate and true.  as hideous as this is, you have captured it well.', '2004-02-02 11:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(565432, 58205, 13336, '<td valign="top">i really like this, but i''m not sure why its called titanice.  i love the red gloves and the height of the negative space.  i''m pretty sure that line of steam was photoshoped in, but its still nice.</td>', 'i really like this, but i''m not sure why its called titanice.  i love the red gloves and the height of the negative space.  i''m pretty sure that line of steam was photoshoped in, but its still nice.', '2004-02-02 11:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(565433, 58192, 13336, '<td valign="top">cute, and very creative.</td>', 'cute, and very creative.', '2004-02-02 11:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(565437, 57634, 13336, '<td valign="top">oooh, soft and seductive.  you have captured the true essence of this essential snack!</td>', 'oooh, soft and seductive.  you have captured the true essence of this essential snack!', '2004-02-02 11:08:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(565439, 57920, 6667, '<td valign="top">Half mast and up side down!  Cute butt.</td>', 'Half mast and up side down!  Cute butt.', '2004-02-02 11:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(565441, 57746, 13336, '<td valign="top">no.</td>', 'no.', '2004-02-02 11:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(565444, 58145, 13336, '<td valign="top">thats funny - almost a little disconcerting, the way it is as though your heads appear severed from your bodies.  crazy how well your faces fit together.  creative.</td>', 'thats funny - almost a little disconcerting, the way it is as though your heads appear severed from your bodies.  crazy how well your faces fit together.  creative.', '2004-02-02 11:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(565445, 57935, 6667, '<td valign="top">As I sit here looking out at snow in 12F degree temperature, where in the world was this taken?! <br/>I think there is too much background.  Why not focus just on the flower and bee?</td>', 'As I sit here looking out at snow in 12F degree temperature, where in the world was this taken?! I think there is too much background.  Why not focus just on the flower and bee?', '2004-02-02 11:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(565447, 57781, 13336, '<td valign="top">the blue in the background is great!  it really punches this image up - must be a complimentary color or something.  great composition an dof.  i feel a simultaneous craving and sickness looking at this image.  thats what i call emotive.</td>', 'the blue in the background is great!  it really punches this image up - must be a complimentary color or something.  great composition an dof.  i feel a simultaneous craving and sickness looking at this image.  thats what i call emotive.', '2004-02-02 11:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(565449, 57760, 15982, '<td valign="top">I think a little bit tighter crop would look better, not much, maybe a touch off the top and right side. I love the picture though! Great color and contrast. There just seems like a little too much space for my eye to investigate. Good luck!!</td>', 'I think a little bit tighter crop would look better, not much, maybe a touch off the top and right side. I love the picture though! Great color and contrast. There just seems like a little too much space for my eye to investigate. Good luck!!', '2004-02-02 11:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(565451, 58110, 5822, '<td valign="top">A neat trick, but not enough to make the photo for me.  I find it''s hard to look at this picture. Maybe it''s the harsh lighting and the glare on the plate or the shadow produced on the milk in the glass.  I don''t like the uneven focus on the cookies in the plate.  Contrast is good, but this image cries out for some interesting tone or color.</td>', 'A neat trick, but not enough to make the photo for me.  I find it''s hard to look at this picture. Maybe it''s the harsh lighting and the glare on the plate or the shadow produced on the milk in the glass.  I don''t like the uneven focus on the cookies in the plate.  Contrast is good, but this image cries out for some interesting tone or color.', '2004-02-02 11:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(565452, 58199, 15982, '<td valign="top">Much more light would have satisfied my opinion much more. Really cool picture though. Good luck!</td>', 'Much more light would have satisfied my opinion much more. Really cool picture though. Good luck!', '2004-02-02 11:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(565453, 57565, 16482, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2004-02-02 11:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(565457, 58119, 5822, '<td valign="top">DOF is good, but nothing really stands out in this commonplace subject matter.</td>', 'DOF is good, but nothing really stands out in this commonplace subject matter.', '2004-02-02 11:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(565460, 57383, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excessive grain and harsh lighting really detract from what could have been an interesting abstract. Colors look washed out and dull and I"m not sure I really find this to meet the challenge theme.</td>', 'Excessive grain and harsh lighting really detract from what could have been an interesting abstract. Colors look washed out and dull and I"m not sure I really find this to meet the challenge theme.', '2004-02-02 11:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(565468, 57829, 5822, '<td valign="top">I dont'' think you''re making enough of a link to industry here as all I see are towers and I''m not sure they by themselves are symbolic of industry. Would have preferred more of a wide angle shot to see that indeed the smoke does come from some kind of industrial processing.  Also, the glare in the upper left is distracting.  I certainly like your message, though.</td>', 'I dont'' think you''re making enough of a link to industry here as all I see are towers and I''m not sure they by themselves are symbolic of industry. Would have preferred more of a wide angle shot to see that indeed the smoke does come from some kind of industrial processing.  Also, the glare in the upper left is distracting.  I certainly like your message, though.', '2004-02-02 11:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(565469, 57935, 15982, '<td valign="top">I think this is an awesome picture, and in my opinion, the best! Hope to see you finish well! Nice job!</td>', 'I think this is an awesome picture, and in my opinion, the best! Hope to see you finish well! Nice job!', '2004-02-02 11:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(565472, 57807, 15982, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!!! Tells a story without the title. Good luck! 10</td>', 'Awesome shot!!! Tells a story without the title. Good luck! 10', '2004-02-02 11:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
