(565760, 57419, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good idea, like the lighting here.  I think I can see (no pun intended) what the glasses were meant to do, but the top half seems in focus without the glasses. 7</td>', 'Good idea, like the lighting here.  I think I can see (no pun intended) what the glasses were meant to do, but the top half seems in focus without the glasses. 7', '2004-02-02 16:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
