(565765, 58142, 13136, '<td valign="top">Probably should have painted the black, I can see it coming up a little. Good Idea and set-up.</td>', 'Probably should have painted the black, I can see it coming up a little. Good Idea and set-up.', '2004-02-02 16:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(565766, 58178, 13136, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Good idea and execution. Added point for the patience this shot must have taken.</td>', 'Cool shot. Good idea and execution. Added point for the patience this shot must have taken.', '2004-02-02 16:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(565768, 57759, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice nature shot. Good combination.</td>', 'Nice nature shot. Good combination.', '2004-02-02 16:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(565770, 57941, 13136, '<td valign="top">Not sure about candy and lemonade going together. Never heard of it. Interesting shot with lots of color contrasts.</td>', 'Not sure about candy and lemonade going together. Never heard of it. Interesting shot with lots of color contrasts.', '2004-02-02 16:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(565772, 57403, 13136, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised to only see one peanut butter &amp; jelly shot in this challenge (I prefer JIF). What is the brown stain in the back of the picture?</td>', 'I''m surprised to only see one peanut butter & jelly shot in this challenge (I prefer JIF). What is the brown stain in the back of the picture?', '2004-02-02 16:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(565773, 57641, 13136, '<td valign="top">A bit overly bright.</td>', 'A bit overly bright.', '2004-02-02 16:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(565774, 57612, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot.  Good entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice macro shot.  Good entry for this challenge.', '2004-02-02 16:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(565775, 57766, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the message and the way it''s been conveyed in this photo.  I especially like how you''ve emphasized Lincoln''s gaze with the shadow lines that lead right to the standing soldier. Very effective.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the message and the way it''s been conveyed in this photo.  I especially like how you''ve emphasized Lincoln''s gaze with the shadow lines that lead right to the standing soldier. Very effective.  Good job.', '2004-02-02 16:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(565777, 58082, 13136, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see one of these for myself. Good shot.</td>', 'I wish I could see one of these for myself. Good shot.', '2004-02-02 16:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(565780, 58101, 5822, '<td valign="top">Sepia/brown tones look really good against the rich black background.  Focus is clear and crisp and lighting is good as well. Good job.</td>', 'Sepia/brown tones look really good against the rich black background.  Focus is clear and crisp and lighting is good as well. Good job.', '2004-02-02 16:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(565781, 57747, 5822, '<td valign="top">Not much to look at in the photo.  You could have at least shown a deeper DOF so that we could see the color of the thread.  Grain is evident too.</td>', 'Not much to look at in the photo.  You could have at least shown a deeper DOF so that we could see the color of the thread.  Grain is evident too.', '2004-02-02 16:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(565782, 57963, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic most impressive composition.  How you managed to squeeze out the toothpaste in an artistic magical fashion is especially splendid!  The lighting is equally nice.  I''m interested how you got such a great complementing background.  Get''s a very easy 10.</td>', 'This is a fantastic most impressive composition.  How you managed to squeeze out the toothpaste in an artistic magical fashion is especially splendid!  The lighting is equally nice.  I''m interested how you got such a great complementing background.  Get''s a very easy 10.', '2004-02-02 16:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(565783, 58204, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think this photo should have a darker background (or maybe less light shining on the it) and preferrably a spotlight on the violin for a dramatic effect. Maybe even a rose lying at the bottom to give it some more color and a touch of class.  As it is now, this image does not move me.</td>', 'I think this photo should have a darker background (or maybe less light shining on the it) and preferrably a spotlight on the violin for a dramatic effect. Maybe even a rose lying at the bottom to give it some more color and a touch of class.  As it is now, this image does not move me.', '2004-02-02 16:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(565788, 57843, 5822, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred maybe a side angled shot of the stilletos to see their heel better and maybe more sheer and transparent skin toned stockings.  As it is now, I think the top of the image is weak and you could have cropped right below the knees.  Adding another accoutrement would also strengthen the image, such as a small purse to match the shoes, but that would necessitate a different stance by the model.</td>', 'Would have preferred maybe a side angled shot of the stilletos to see their heel better and maybe more sheer and transparent skin toned stockings.  As it is now, I think the top of the image is weak and you could have cropped right below the knees.  Adding another accoutrement would also strengthen the image, such as a small purse to match the shoes, but that would necessitate a different stance by the model.', '2004-02-02 16:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(565789, 57878, 5822, '<td valign="top">The cookies do not look appealing to me and I think you''re lighting is too harsh. Contrast is good.</td>', 'The cookies do not look appealing to me and I think you''re lighting is too harsh. Contrast is good.', '2004-02-02 16:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(565791, 57935, 5822, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful shot with beautiful colors and excellent DOF.  A joy to view.</td>', 'Really wonderful shot with beautiful colors and excellent DOF.  A joy to view.', '2004-02-02 16:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(565796, 57417, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great concept but looks like you''ve lost detail in the corn by using harsh lighting.  Overall I like.</td>', 'Great concept but looks like you''ve lost detail in the corn by using harsh lighting.  Overall I like.', '2004-02-02 16:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(565798, 58013, 16739, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-02-02 16:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(565801, 58194, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like how clear this picture is, especially the TV program.  The woman''s right foot and leg appear too bright.</td>', 'I really like how clear this picture is, especially the TV program.  The woman''s right foot and leg appear too bright.', '2004-02-02 16:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
