(566157, 58080, 16829, '<td valign="top">Very striking and well concieved</td>', 'Very striking and well concieved', '2004-02-02 21:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(566165, 58080, 806, '<td valign="top">oh man! this has great potential.. now.. hear me out.<br/>the white on white is done beautifully, but I am looking for more DOF to see the puzzle piece that is toward the rear. A bit of too much highlight on the front piece making the back edge lose definition.<br/>I really like it... don''t get me wrong.<br/>I think this was clever.</td>', 'oh man! this has great potential.. now.. hear me out.the white on white is done beautifully, but I am looking for more DOF to see the puzzle piece that is toward the rear. A bit of too much highlight on the front piece making the back edge lose definition.I really like it... don''t get me wrong.I think this was clever.', '2004-02-02 21:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(566166, 57705, 806, '<td valign="top">Is this near Niagra Falls? It looks familiar.<br/>I realize it is a grey day, but it could be a bit brighter... exposure?<br/>nice leading lines.</td>', 'Is this near Niagra Falls? It looks familiar.I realize it is a grey day, but it could be a bit brighter... exposure?nice leading lines.', '2004-02-02 21:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
