(566169, 58204, 806, '<td valign="top">nice idea. the lighting and focus is better at the top of the instrument.. I''d like to see more of that at the bottom of the image on the sheet music and center of the instrument.</td>', 'nice idea. the lighting and focus is better at the top of the instrument.. I''d like to see more of that at the bottom of the image on the sheet music and center of the instrument.', '2004-02-02 21:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
