(566172, 57746, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a great shot of the Beretta.  Nice gun.  Maybe if there was a couple bullets showing instead of just the clip.<br/>Just an idea.  Awesome shot though.<br/></td>', 'What a great shot of the Beretta.  Nice gun.  Maybe if there was a couple bullets showing instead of just the clip.Just an idea.  Awesome shot though.', '2004-02-02 22:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(566176, 57863, 10818, '<td valign="top">Not sure about all those gummy bear looking things...maybe just a standard pencil.  But, its very clear and has some nice shadows.  Good luck to ya.</td>', 'Not sure about all those gummy bear looking things...maybe just a standard pencil.  But, its very clear and has some nice shadows.  Good luck to ya.', '2004-02-02 22:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(566180, 57921, 11324, '<td valign="top">nice theme...just for the theme, I''ll score it higher than I would.  Picture isn''t exaclty that interesting, but the abstract thought is very creative - 6</td>', 'nice theme...just for the theme, I''ll score it higher than I would.  Picture isn''t exaclty that interesting, but the abstract thought is very creative - 6', '2004-02-02 22:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(566182, 58198, 11324, '<td valign="top">nice abstract thought - I would have liked to see more of the top curve of the lock in focus, not so much the middle of the key - 7</td>', 'nice abstract thought - I would have liked to see more of the top curve of the lock in focus, not so much the middle of the key - 7', '2004-02-02 22:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(566193, 58177, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea overall (a good pairing, needle and thread!), good idea for directional light here, but it looks overexposed on the spool, and it might have been good to have all the thread highlighted (it crosses into the dark areas in the foreground and on the right.</td>', 'Nice idea overall (a good pairing, needle and thread!), good idea for directional light here, but it looks overexposed on the spool, and it might have been good to have all the thread highlighted (it crosses into the dark areas in the foreground and on the right.', '2004-02-02 22:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(566194, 58191, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the moment.  Overall a good shot, but there needs to be more light on the ducks face and eye (or just underexposed there).</td>', 'Good capture of the moment.  Overall a good shot, but there needs to be more light on the ducks face and eye (or just underexposed there).', '2004-02-02 22:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(566195, 57751, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent hi key shot!  I don''t know if a fish and a cat go together (but I bet the cat thinks the fish would go nice with a little milk. ;)</td>', 'Excellent hi key shot!  I don''t know if a fish and a cat go together (but I bet the cat thinks the fish would go nice with a little milk. ;)', '2004-02-02 22:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(566197, 57807, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting tones and a very nice shot.  I find the composition interesting, but I also wonder how it might hae looked with a little more of his face on the left (mainly because he''s so thi looking here.)</td>', 'Interesting tones and a very nice shot.  I find the composition interesting, but I also wonder how it might hae looked with a little more of his face on the left (mainly because he''s so thi looking here.)', '2004-02-02 22:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(566209, 57942, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good combo, and good shot with interesting light.  A bit too close on the right crop though, and the closeup, almost centered might have been more interesting with a different composition.  Overall, still very good.</td>', 'Good combo, and good shot with interesting light.  A bit too close on the right crop though, and the closeup, almost centered might have been more interesting with a different composition.  Overall, still very good.', '2004-02-02 23:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
