(566330, 58199, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo, love the originality. 8</td>', 'beautiful photo, love the originality. 8', '2004-02-03 01:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(566350, 58182, 14355, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the pistol and bullets - target in the background is a nice touch.  Pistol looks like an early 1980''s AMT Hardballer - I''m sure adjustable rear sights, higher profile front sight and adjustable trigger would up your score :)  That, and those light weight Hydra-Shock bullets will jam if you don''t convert to a lighter after market recoil spring.</td>', 'Good capture of the pistol and bullets - target in the background is a nice touch.  Pistol looks like an early 1980''s AMT Hardballer - I''m sure adjustable rear sights, higher profile front sight and adjustable trigger would up your score :)  That, and those light weight Hydra-Shock bullets will jam if you don''t convert to a lighter after market recoil spring.', '2004-02-03 01:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(566361, 57751, 6100, '<td valign="top">I think one is about to become a victum rather than a partner. Regardless, you''ve handled a wide tonal range very well. It''s a very effective photograph.</td>', 'I think one is about to become a victum rather than a partner. Regardless, you''ve handled a wide tonal range very well. It''s a very effective photograph.', '2004-02-03 01:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(566367, 57944, 14355, '<td valign="top">A circular polarizer would have helped this shot considerably.  Try to keep one tucked in your camera case or close and handy when ever around water.  I''m guessing, like most photographers - you probably own a nice one but don''t carry it so it doesn''t get hurt.  They don''t do you any good sitting in the filter case........ but ......... you could pick up a second hand one on ebay for very little and keep that one real handy.</td>', 'A circular polarizer would have helped this shot considerably.  Try to keep one tucked in your camera case or close and handy when ever around water.  I''m guessing, like most photographers - you probably own a nice one but don''t carry it so it doesn''t get hurt.  They don''t do you any good sitting in the filter case........ but ......... you could pick up a second hand one on ebay for very little and keep that one real handy.', '2004-02-03 01:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(566373, 57894, 14355, '<td valign="top">Nice to see an original ''idea'' among all the tired and repeat entries so far.  Good composition - good eye appeal.  Keep thinking out of the box!  10</td>', 'Nice to see an original ''idea'' among all the tired and repeat entries so far.  Good composition - good eye appeal.  Keep thinking out of the box!  10', '2004-02-03 01:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(566379, 57816, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot... well-composed, lovely colours.</td>', 'beautiful shot... well-composed, lovely colours.', '2004-02-03 01:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(566386, 57751, 12160, '<td valign="top">very striking contrast... beautiful photo. 9</td>', 'very striking contrast... beautiful photo. 9', '2004-02-03 01:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(566390, 57077, 12160, '<td valign="top">love the color and texture, lighting is good too. fits the challenge well.</td>', 'love the color and texture, lighting is good too. fits the challenge well.', '2004-02-03 02:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(566393, 58192, 12160, '<td valign="top">creative and well thought. good composition and colour.</td>', 'creative and well thought. good composition and colour.', '2004-02-03 02:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(566398, 58090, 11895, '<td valign="top">seems to have a yellowish cast to it, otherwise pretty nice</td>', 'seems to have a yellowish cast to it, otherwise pretty nice', '2004-02-03 02:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(566421, 58059, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great wide angle shot with the double rainbows! Lighting is good too, but the image suffers due to pixelation/noise.</td>', 'Great wide angle shot with the double rainbows! Lighting is good too, but the image suffers due to pixelation/noise.', '2004-02-03 02:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(566438, 57490, 5822, '<td valign="top">Pronouced yellow cast and ugly background spoils this image for me.  Lighting is too strong causing hot spots on the film cannisters and is uneven on both sides of the picture. Could probably use some fill.</td>', 'Pronouced yellow cast and ugly background spoils this image for me.  Lighting is too strong causing hot spots on the film cannisters and is uneven on both sides of the picture. Could probably use some fill.', '2004-02-03 02:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(566441, 58207, 11895, '<td valign="top">border is too heavy, maybe a medium light gray instead of black would have worked better, otherwise a pretty nice photo</td>', 'border is too heavy, maybe a medium light gray instead of black would have worked better, otherwise a pretty nice photo', '2004-02-03 02:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(566443, 58059, 11895, '<td valign="top">needs rotation and a little more contrast</td>', 'needs rotation and a little more contrast', '2004-02-03 02:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(566444, 58183, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really good idea here, I like how you have set up the pen to be inside the pencils.  Your DOF is good, like how the front is the main focus point.<br/> <br/>It does however seem a little blurred.  If you have a macro mode on your camera that may have helped, or move your camera back a bit.  A good shot though!  7</td>', 'Really good idea here, I like how you have set up the pen to be inside the pencils.  Your DOF is good, like how the front is the main focus point. It does however seem a little blurred.  If you have a macro mode on your camera that may have helped, or move your camera back a bit.  A good shot though!  7', '2004-02-03 02:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(566462, 58207, 16493, '<td valign="top">nice time is money setup - I dont like the frame and the the picture might come out stronger with a black background at the top left and right. the coins at 10 to 12 are bit overexposed. Over all very good.</td>', 'nice time is money setup - I dont like the frame and the the picture might come out stronger with a black background at the top left and right. the coins at 10 to 12 are bit overexposed. Over all very good.', '2004-02-03 03:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(566467, 57718, 16493, '<td valign="top">hmm, I''m not much of a whiskey fan but isn''t it best on the rocks - whiskey and ice? Very mystic blue color hope you tell us about the makeing of this picture.<br/>What is it sticking into the picture from the lower right? Very nice setup.</td>', 'hmm, I''m not much of a whiskey fan but isn''t it best on the rocks - whiskey and ice? Very mystic blue color hope you tell us about the makeing of this picture.What is it sticking into the picture from the lower right? Very nice setup.', '2004-02-03 03:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
