(566492, 58145, 16493, '<td valign="top">unique idea!<br/>I would have done  a bit more post editing on the forhead to remove the line from the eyes to the hair line.</td>', 'unique idea!I would have done  a bit more post editing on the forhead to remove the line from the eyes to the hair line.', '2004-02-03 03:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(566493, 57935, 16493, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. Probably a long time to make this shot.</td>', 'Very good composition. Probably a long time to make this shot.', '2004-02-03 04:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(566506, 58196, 16493, '<td valign="top">dont like the frame but I like the nail that is sticking out of it. Too much space at the top.</td>', 'dont like the frame but I like the nail that is sticking out of it. Too much space at the top.', '2004-02-03 04:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(566536, 57746, 16493, '<td valign="top">I would have made the background totally black in the top left in post editing.</td>', 'I would have made the background totally black in the top left in post editing.', '2004-02-03 04:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(566543, 57607, 16493, '<td valign="top">nice background - very creative.</td>', 'nice background - very creative.', '2004-02-03 05:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(566545, 57766, 16648, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2004-02-03 05:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(566551, 57712, 2553, '<td valign="top">I find the concept of "time and money" to be an fuzzy concept at best, and don''t think of it in terms of things that "go together".  However, that being my personal view, I am not voting down for that.  The photo has a good tonal range, and seems well focused.  On my monitor the color is somewhat red-violet, and I don''t care for that.  The composition is fairly uninteresting in that it does not get my attention, and there seems to be nothing to "focus" on - everything is "equal".  Perhaps a more dynamic composition, or something unexpected would help to boost the impact of the shot.</td>', 'I find the concept of "time and money" to be an fuzzy concept at best, and don''t think of it in terms of things that "go together".  However, that being my personal view, I am not voting down for that.  The photo has a good tonal range, and seems well focused.  On my monitor the color is somewhat red-violet, and I don''t care for that.  The composition is fairly uninteresting in that it does not get my attention, and there seems to be nothing to "focus" on - everything is "equal".  Perhaps a more dynamic composition, or something unexpected would help to boost the impact of the shot.', '2004-02-03 05:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(566560, 57499, 2553, '<td valign="top">Pretty good lighting, strong color, and I like the dof.  I dislike the red/orange  in the border-it seems to compete with the flowers. I find the black in the background  a little distracting.  The color gives it a modicum of immediate visual impact.</td>', 'Pretty good lighting, strong color, and I like the dof.  I dislike the red/orange  in the border-it seems to compete with the flowers. I find the black in the background  a little distracting.  The color gives it a modicum of immediate visual impact.', '2004-02-03 05:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(566568, 57816, 2553, '<td valign="top">What a lovely winter shot.  The composition is perfect for your subject, as is the lighting.  This makes me want to set up my tripod and hang out some bird food on my deck!  On my monitor, there is some kind of a "shadow" to the right of the bird.  Almost like there is another bird there, but you can''t really see it-it extends from an area behind the bird''s head, all the way down to his tail feathers.  Similarly, there is a "bar" of shadow across the entire bottom of the photo.  These are both faint, but noticeable.</td>', 'What a lovely winter shot.  The composition is perfect for your subject, as is the lighting.  This makes me want to set up my tripod and hang out some bird food on my deck!  On my monitor, there is some kind of a "shadow" to the right of the bird.  Almost like there is another bird there, but you can''t really see it-it extends from an area behind the bird''s head, all the way down to his tail feathers.  Similarly, there is a "bar" of shadow across the entire bottom of the photo.  These are both faint, but noticeable.', '2004-02-03 05:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(566575, 58145, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a very clever shot. I know you wish your wife had a slight smile so the morphed image was more even around the mouth but very good none the less.</td>', 'This is a very clever shot. I know you wish your wife had a slight smile so the morphed image was more even around the mouth but very good none the less.', '2004-02-03 05:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(566577, 57751, 2553, '<td valign="top">Too cute!  Fabulous light, color, and composition if this was taken as one shot.  The capture of the cat and the fish is just perfect.  One of my top picks.  I hope this wins and pisses off all the cat haters! (But I do hope this isn''t a composite of two separate photos-I would be disappointed in that).</td>', 'Too cute!  Fabulous light, color, and composition if this was taken as one shot.  The capture of the cat and the fish is just perfect.  One of my top picks.  I hope this wins and pisses off all the cat haters! (But I do hope this isn''t a composite of two separate photos-I would be disappointed in that).', '2004-02-03 05:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(566581, 57760, 2553, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, good color and light.  I feel that a "third" would have made a more dynamic composition, but nevertheless, this shot really stands out.</td>', 'Simple and effective, good color and light.  I feel that a "third" would have made a more dynamic composition, but nevertheless, this shot really stands out.', '2004-02-03 05:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(566582, 58204, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Seems like the camera was focused behind the violin. There is a slight shadow which makes me think you were not controlling the lighting as well as you wanted to. This picture has excellent potential.</td>', 'Nice composition. Seems like the camera was focused behind the violin. There is a slight shadow which makes me think you were not controlling the lighting as well as you wanted to. This picture has excellent potential.', '2004-02-03 05:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(566583, 57402, 2553, '<td valign="top">Because this shot is so perfect from the standpoint of lighting, color, focus, I am rating it fairly high.  However, for me, the composition is definitely lacking.  With this subject, there are just so many ways to have a dynamic, interesting and unexpected composition that this plain, dead center, head on composition leaves me disappointed.</td>', 'Because this shot is so perfect from the standpoint of lighting, color, focus, I am rating it fairly high.  However, for me, the composition is definitely lacking.  With this subject, there are just so many ways to have a dynamic, interesting and unexpected composition that this plain, dead center, head on composition leaves me disappointed.', '2004-02-03 05:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(566585, 58040, 3306, '<td valign="top">Vert nice. I like the simplicity, texture and colors. Very nicely focused and composed.</td>', 'Vert nice. I like the simplicity, texture and colors. Very nicely focused and composed.', '2004-02-03 05:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(566589, 58180, 3306, '<td valign="top">This picture has potential. I don''t care for the lighting. Might have looked better in Black and white and cropped in to eliminate the distraction in the upper right corner.</td>', 'This picture has potential. I don''t care for the lighting. Might have looked better in Black and white and cropped in to eliminate the distraction in the upper right corner.', '2004-02-03 05:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(566590, 58135, 3306, '<td valign="top">Excellent compostion. It looks a little grainy which I know is hard to control under low light conditions.</td>', 'Excellent compostion. It looks a little grainy which I know is hard to control under low light conditions.', '2004-02-03 05:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(566592, 58194, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a clever shot. Just seems a little out of balance. Maybe if you could have been a little closer to the TV and centered it so you could have eliminated the distraction to the right. Also I would have liked to see what it would have looked like if you brought the camera down and to the middle of both of you to get more of the legs (say, from the knees down) and more centered. Just a thought.</td>', 'This is a clever shot. Just seems a little out of balance. Maybe if you could have been a little closer to the TV and centered it so you could have eliminated the distraction to the right. Also I would have liked to see what it would have looked like if you brought the camera down and to the middle of both of you to get more of the legs (say, from the knees down) and more centered. Just a thought.', '2004-02-03 05:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(566594, 57956, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a good composition. I would have preferred a more realistic ball.</td>', 'This is a good composition. I would have preferred a more realistic ball.', '2004-02-03 05:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(566595, 57634, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good idea, just a little out of focus.</td>', 'Good idea, just a little out of focus.', '2004-02-03 05:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(566597, 57905, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I like the candle in the Lightbulb concept. Its a difficult shot to get well.</td>', 'Good idea. I like the candle in the Lightbulb concept. Its a difficult shot to get well.', '2004-02-03 05:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(566601, 58108, 3306, '<td valign="top">Satisfies the theme but just not very interesting.</td>', 'Satisfies the theme but just not very interesting.', '2004-02-03 05:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(566602, 57883, 16046, '<td valign="top">my #1 pick of the bunch, excellent</td>', 'my #1 pick of the bunch, excellent', '2004-02-03 05:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(566603, 58183, 3306, '<td valign="top">This picture has potential. I would have liked a slightly greater DOF and the bottom of the picture takes away from the symetry.</td>', 'This picture has potential. I would have liked a slightly greater DOF and the bottom of the picture takes away from the symetry.', '2004-02-03 05:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(566604, 57417, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well done. Simple, interesting and to the point.</td>', 'Well done. Simple, interesting and to the point.', '2004-02-03 05:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(566605, 57728, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good angle. Nicely done in B &amp; W.</td>', 'Good angle. Nicely done in B & W.', '2004-02-03 05:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(566608, 57812, 3306, '<td valign="top">Original idea. This picture has potential. It seems a little flat. Maybe a different camera angle or tweaking the set up would have improved the final image. Just my opinion. :)</td>', 'Original idea. This picture has potential. It seems a little flat. Maybe a different camera angle or tweaking the set up would have improved the final image. Just my opinion. :)', '2004-02-03 05:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(566609, 57402, 3306, '<td valign="top">Simple, Elegant and to the point. Well done. The only criticism would be a slight glare on the back of the cup.</td>', 'Simple, Elegant and to the point. Well done. The only criticism would be a slight glare on the back of the cup.', '2004-02-03 06:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(566618, 58144, 3306, '<td valign="top">Attractive compositon. Beautiful colors and good lighting.</td>', 'Attractive compositon. Beautiful colors and good lighting.', '2004-02-03 06:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(566619, 57781, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. The slight bit of blue in the backround helps to give a feeling of depth to the picture. Only one slight criticism: seems like there is too much butter being poured on the one area. It just appears too soupy in the foreground. This was not an easy shot to get.</td>', 'I like your idea. The slight bit of blue in the backround helps to give a feeling of depth to the picture. Only one slight criticism: seems like there is too much butter being poured on the one area. It just appears too soupy in the foreground. This was not an easy shot to get.', '2004-02-03 06:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(566620, 58129, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very good. I like how you framed your compostion.</td>', 'Very good. I like how you framed your compostion.', '2004-02-03 06:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(566621, 58179, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good capture.</td>', 'Good capture.', '2004-02-03 06:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(566622, 58205, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very well done. The compostion, angle of the picture, lighting and subject matter are all excellent. The hint of steam coming up from the cup really adds interest and life to the picture.</td>', 'Very well done. The compostion, angle of the picture, lighting and subject matter are all excellent. The hint of steam coming up from the cup really adds interest and life to the picture.', '2004-02-03 06:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(566623, 58205, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, composition and exposure.</td>', 'Nice texture, composition and exposure.', '2004-02-03 06:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(566624, 58204, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and generally good lighting. IMHO the light falls off a bit too much at the bottom.</td>', 'Nice composition and generally good lighting. IMHO the light falls off a bit too much at the bottom.', '2004-02-03 06:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(566625, 58145, 12733, '<td valign="top">The idea is clever; the result is kind of gimmicky and unsettling.</td>', 'The idea is clever; the result is kind of gimmicky and unsettling.', '2004-02-03 06:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(566626, 58206, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting interpretation of the challenge. You caught the surf at just the right moment, and the sharp rendering of the splashes is really effective.</td>', 'This is an interesting interpretation of the challenge. You caught the surf at just the right moment, and the sharp rendering of the splashes is really effective.', '2004-02-03 06:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(566627, 58182, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great rendering of the metallic textures - both shiny and dulled, and I like the reflective surface. I find the out-of-focus target in the background disturbing.</td>', 'Great rendering of the metallic textures - both shiny and dulled, and I like the reflective surface. I find the out-of-focus target in the background disturbing.', '2004-02-03 06:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(566629, 58149, 12733, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the glass - especially on the left - seems irrelevant and ends up dominating my impression of the picture. There''s a lot of banding in the white, or at least it shows up that way on my monitor.</td>', 'The reflections in the glass - especially on the left - seems irrelevant and ends up dominating my impression of the picture. There''s a lot of banding in the white, or at least it shows up that way on my monitor.', '2004-02-03 06:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(566631, 57768, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and exposure on the label, but what happened to the resto of the bottle? And what does it go with?</td>', 'Interesting lighting and exposure on the label, but what happened to the resto of the bottle? And what does it go with?', '2004-02-03 06:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(566634, 57441, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice rendering of the wood texture. The red light along the edge of the Bible''s pages is disturbing because this would normally be white, and the green border clashes with the colors in the photo.</td>', 'Nice rendering of the wood texture. The red light along the edge of the Bible''s pages is disturbing because this would normally be white, and the green border clashes with the colors in the photo.', '2004-02-03 06:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(566635, 58156, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting effects - the whole thing is almost surreal. Is the effect on the key the result of very strong sharpening in the post processing or noise in the original? It works well in this shot.</td>', 'I really like the lighting effects - the whole thing is almost surreal. Is the effect on the key the result of very strong sharpening in the post processing or noise in the original? It works well in this shot.', '2004-02-03 06:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(566636, 58124, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Black and white was a good choice for this picture.</td>', 'Cute idea. Black and white was a good choice for this picture.', '2004-02-03 06:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(566637, 58207, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a different take on the challenge, and it is nicely composed and rendered.</td>', 'This is a different take on the challenge, and it is nicely composed and rendered.', '2004-02-03 06:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(566641, 58085, 12733, '<td valign="top">The rendering of the metallic sheen is well done, but the whole picture is kind of soft, and the top of the rose lacks any detail.</td>', 'The rendering of the metallic sheen is well done, but the whole picture is kind of soft, and the top of the rose lacks any detail.', '2004-02-03 06:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(566642, 58095, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the piles of salt and pepper in the composition. You have a cute set of salt and pepper shakers, and they are rendered very well. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the piles of salt and pepper in the composition. You have a cute set of salt and pepper shakers, and they are rendered very well. Nice shot.', '2004-02-03 06:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(566658, 58180, 6130, '<td valign="top">This is simple and very good.</td>', 'This is simple and very good.', '2004-02-03 06:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
