(566739, 58110, 16493, '<td valign="top">you are making me drool over here. Very effective.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-09 04:42:29.</i></td>', 'you are making me drool over here. Very effective.', '2004-02-03 08:44:16.000000', '2004-02-09 04:42:29.000000', 1),
(566741, 57963, 16493, '<td valign="top">nice light and reflection - must tell us about the making of this one.<br/>Would have liked to see it not so centerd though.</td>', 'nice light and reflection - must tell us about the making of this one.Would have liked to see it not so centerd though.', '2004-02-03 08:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(566749, 58178, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good texture. The image appears somewhat 2 dimensional.</td>', 'Very good texture. The image appears somewhat 2 dimensional.', '2004-02-03 08:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(566750, 57963, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very bright. How did you get that white spot behind the brush?</td>', 'Very bright. How did you get that white spot behind the brush?', '2004-02-03 08:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(566752, 57781, 16493, '<td valign="top">dont like the frame</td>', 'dont like the frame', '2004-02-03 08:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(566754, 57441, 10785, '<td valign="top">The Green Border is a very bad choice.</td>', 'The Green Border is a very bad choice.', '2004-02-03 08:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(566755, 57634, 16493, '<td valign="top">the crop is a little tight on the left.</td>', 'the crop is a little tight on the left.', '2004-02-03 08:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(566759, 57718, 10785, '<td valign="top">When I think whiskey and coke, I would expect to see warmer colors...reds, browns, etc. This negative image looks good, though I would expect this to be used for a vodka or some other clear drink.</td>', 'When I think whiskey and coke, I would expect to see warmer colors...reds, browns, etc. This negative image looks good, though I would expect this to be used for a vodka or some other clear drink.', '2004-02-03 09:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(566808, 57760, 10785, '<td valign="top">Though your shot is crisp with great color, I would like to see a bit less negative space.</td>', 'Though your shot is crisp with great color, I would like to see a bit less negative space.', '2004-02-03 10:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(566814, 57612, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the textures, but not sure I find the colors all that attractive. In addition, the lighting is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Great detail on the textures, but not sure I find the colors all that attractive. In addition, the lighting is a bit harsh.', '2004-02-03 10:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(566820, 57747, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is so similar to another shot (no accusation implied). bound to happen once in a hwile, I guess. This one suffers from either over-sharpening or some other processing problem - the lines of the needle are very jagged. DOF might be too extreme for a really pleasing image, to my eye.</td>', 'This is so similar to another shot (no accusation implied). bound to happen once in a hwile, I guess. This one suffers from either over-sharpening or some other processing problem - the lines of the needle are very jagged. DOF might be too extreme for a really pleasing image, to my eye.', '2004-02-03 10:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(566846, 58080, 15909, '<td valign="top">very plain and hitting the subject: 2 things that go together</td>', 'very plain and hitting the subject: 2 things that go together', '2004-02-03 10:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(566847, 57963, 8139, '<td valign="top">Clean advertising style, traditional subject well captured and processed (i like the light aura on the paste). Good choice of color (my current toothpaste is the same blue). <br/>Not a "WOW" picture, but well done.</td>', 'Clean advertising style, traditional subject well captured and processed (i like the light aura on the paste). Good choice of color (my current toothpaste is the same blue). Not a "WOW" picture, but well done.', '2004-02-03 10:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(566854, 57881, 8139, '<td valign="top">Good one. The blur around the lower lip works well.</td>', 'Good one. The blur around the lower lip works well.', '2004-02-03 10:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(566861, 57751, 8139, '<td valign="top">My fav so far. Well done.</td>', 'My fav so far. Well done.', '2004-02-03 10:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(566887, 57766, 16095, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2004-02-03 11:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(566889, 58202, 16095, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2004-02-03 11:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(566890, 57781, 16095, '<td valign="top">i hope this wins</td>', 'i hope this wins', '2004-02-03 11:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(566892, 58147, 6008, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice is that the crease isnt directly in the middle and so that gives a somewhat unbalanced feel. I can see you used the light off to the top right to get the shadow, but that has caused the lower left to be quite dark. The sharpness is good, and the idea works well and certainly meets the challenge. A suggested recomposition would be to move the light to the top of the book, balance up the crease, and place the glasses over both pages and have the shadow falling toward the bottom.</td>', 'The first thing I notice is that the crease isnt directly in the middle and so that gives a somewhat unbalanced feel. I can see you used the light off to the top right to get the shadow, but that has caused the lower left to be quite dark. The sharpness is good, and the idea works well and certainly meets the challenge. A suggested recomposition would be to move the light to the top of the book, balance up the crease, and place the glasses over both pages and have the shadow falling toward the bottom.', '2004-02-03 11:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(566893, 57941, 16095, '<td valign="top">this would be great spotlighted and black &amp; white!!!!</td>', 'this would be great spotlighted and black & white!!!!', '2004-02-03 11:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(566900, 57936, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal his arm makes from the lower right corner. It''s a good close up with most of his face visible and just enough of the background to add content without cluttering up the image. There is also good texture with his/her fur. Unfortunately Koala bears sleep a lot so I can understand the eyes closed, but with an animal portrait the eyes can be quite important to the emotive factor. Part of the right ear is slightly blown out, but not too distractingly. Good capture.</td>', 'I like the diagonal his arm makes from the lower right corner. It''s a good close up with most of his face visible and just enough of the background to add content without cluttering up the image. There is also good texture with his/her fur. Unfortunately Koala bears sleep a lot so I can understand the eyes closed, but with an animal portrait the eyes can be quite important to the emotive factor. Part of the right ear is slightly blown out, but not too distractingly. Good capture.', '2004-02-03 11:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(566905, 57077, 6008, '<td valign="top">I love the color and seeming glow to the chess pieces. Unfortunately I dont really care for the background. Having it shot in landscape mode gives it a lot of negative space on either side, and I''m not sure if that was your plan as it does look like clouds that certainly give a sense of expanse. As the chess pieces are vertical, especially enlongated with the shadow, I think a portrait orientation may have been better. I really do like the color/tone/lighting on the chess pieces, though!</td>', 'I love the color and seeming glow to the chess pieces. Unfortunately I dont really care for the background. Having it shot in landscape mode gives it a lot of negative space on either side, and I''m not sure if that was your plan as it does look like clouds that certainly give a sense of expanse. As the chess pieces are vertical, especially enlongated with the shadow, I think a portrait orientation may have been better. I really do like the color/tone/lighting on the chess pieces, though!', '2004-02-03 11:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(566910, 57490, 6008, '<td valign="top">Yay Nikon! The composition looks well thought out and all the individual pieces compliments each other well. The yellow cast seems to add to the ageness of the shot and also goes with the tones of red and brown in the background. The only negative is the hot spots on the film cannisters. Overal it''s a good capture.</td>', 'Yay Nikon! The composition looks well thought out and all the individual pieces compliments each other well. The yellow cast seems to add to the ageness of the shot and also goes with the tones of red and brown in the background. The only negative is the hot spots on the film cannisters. Overal it''s a good capture.', '2004-02-03 11:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(566915, 57941, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the connection here is lemon and sugar. This certainly has creativity and it''s different so I like it for that. The composition is good and I like the diagonal of the ''straw'' into the lemon. I dont know if you tried a border then cropped it out or what, but there is a small thin black line at the very top of the image that seems to stand out and look a little odd. The image also looks underexposed and could have used a levels adjustment to increase the brightness.</td>', 'I''m assuming the connection here is lemon and sugar. This certainly has creativity and it''s different so I like it for that. The composition is good and I like the diagonal of the ''straw'' into the lemon. I dont know if you tried a border then cropped it out or what, but there is a small thin black line at the very top of the image that seems to stand out and look a little odd. The image also looks underexposed and could have used a levels adjustment to increase the brightness.', '2004-02-03 11:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(566943, 57191, 16126, '<td valign="top">Composition could be better, the cork and corkscrew are too much in the bottom of the picture, too close to the edge. The colored labels on the labels are a bit distracting. Depth of focus is very nice, good lighting.</td>', 'Composition could be better, the cork and corkscrew are too much in the bottom of the picture, too close to the edge. The colored labels on the labels are a bit distracting. Depth of focus is very nice, good lighting.', '2004-02-03 11:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(566947, 58180, 16126, '<td valign="top">I''m not very impressed with the topic, but the picture is beautiful. Great colors! Good focus also.</td>', 'I''m not very impressed with the topic, but the picture is beautiful. Great colors! Good focus also.', '2004-02-03 12:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(566949, 58106, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Colors are beautiful together. The only thing that distracts me a bit is the shrimp hanging over the edge of the glass, that creates an unbalance.</td>', 'Nice picture. Colors are beautiful together. The only thing that distracts me a bit is the shrimp hanging over the edge of the glass, that creates an unbalance.', '2004-02-03 12:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(566951, 58202, 16126, '<td valign="top">Of the milk-and-cookies photographs, this is one of the best! Great how you captured the spalsh. A bit more space above the cookies might improve.</td>', 'Of the milk-and-cookies photographs, this is one of the best! Great how you captured the spalsh. A bit more space above the cookies might improve.', '2004-02-03 12:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(566952, 57493, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean picture. The reflection of the corkscrew adds interest, rotating it also is more interesting. Good composition!</td>', 'Nice and clean picture. The reflection of the corkscrew adds interest, rotating it also is more interesting. Good composition!', '2004-02-03 12:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(566955, 58204, 16126, '<td valign="top">The idea is nice, but the focus could have been a little better, only the top half is sharp.</td>', 'The idea is nice, but the focus could have been a little better, only the top half is sharp.', '2004-02-03 12:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(566956, 57417, 13136, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised by how many shots like this are in the challenge. Yours is very good. Close up, well defined and good color/lighting.</td>', 'I''m surprised by how many shots like this are in the challenge. Yours is very good. Close up, well defined and good color/lighting.', '2004-02-03 12:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(566957, 58200, 13136, '<td valign="top">The bottle is a little dark. Otherwise, a good shot.</td>', 'The bottle is a little dark. Otherwise, a good shot.', '2004-02-03 12:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(566958, 57894, 13136, '<td valign="top">Cool shot and neat idea.</td>', 'Cool shot and neat idea.', '2004-02-03 12:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(566966, 57829, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Very graphic photo.</td>', 'Nice catch. Very graphic photo.', '2004-02-03 12:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(566969, 58192, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Extra point for ingenuity.</td>', 'Very clever. Extra point for ingenuity.', '2004-02-03 12:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
