(566983, 58035, 13136, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this several times before voting on it. The soft focus is done well, but something about the shot feels strange. I still haven''t figured it out, but I like the shot.</td>', 'I had to look at this several times before voting on it. The soft focus is done well, but something about the shot feels strange. I still haven''t figured it out, but I like the shot.', '2004-02-03 13:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
