(567028, 57758, 14773, '<td valign="top">I''m starving...very nice tone and lighting.</td>', 'I''m starving...very nice tone and lighting.', '2004-02-03 13:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(567030, 58200, 16493, '<td valign="top">Glass and winebottle need a bit more light</td>', 'Glass and winebottle need a bit more light', '2004-02-03 13:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(567032, 57963, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is very interesting. Lighting is very good. I like the halo that seems to be around the toothpaste, it really brings your eyes to focus on the toothpaste. <br/> <br/>I think cropping a bit more of the bottom would help keep the focus on the brush and paste. The reflection of the paste seems to almost be fighting the main subjects for attention.</td>', 'Composition is very interesting. Lighting is very good. I like the halo that seems to be around the toothpaste, it really brings your eyes to focus on the toothpaste.  I think cropping a bit more of the bottom would help keep the focus on the brush and paste. The reflection of the paste seems to almost be fighting the main subjects for attention.', '2004-02-03 13:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(567050, 58145, 5169, '<td valign="top">I can''t grasp the concept</td>', 'I can''t grasp the concept', '2004-02-03 14:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(567051, 57766, 5169, '<td valign="top">Multimillionare military expenses?  If that''s the concept... I agree</td>', 'Multimillionare military expenses?  If that''s the concept... I agree', '2004-02-03 14:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(567060, 58080, 16850, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Works on many levels. Would be my number one pick.</td>', 'Wonderful! Works on many levels. Would be my number one pick.', '2004-02-03 14:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(567063, 57760, 16850, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot. Strength in simplicity. Would be my choice for second.</td>', 'I like it a lot. Strength in simplicity. Would be my choice for second.', '2004-02-03 14:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(567108, 57894, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''d imagine lighting must have been a challenge on this.  Nicely done, although I do think I have the urge to be a little closer to the subject.</td>', 'I''d imagine lighting must have been a challenge on this.  Nicely done, although I do think I have the urge to be a little closer to the subject.', '2004-02-03 15:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(567111, 57905, 4007, '<td valign="top">interesting idea with a lot of potential, but this photo is very blurry and consequently has very little detail in it, which effecively ruins the shot.</td>', 'interesting idea with a lot of potential, but this photo is very blurry and consequently has very little detail in it, which effecively ruins the shot.', '2004-02-03 15:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(567113, 58090, 4007, '<td valign="top">Crisply executed.  Not an especially facinating subject, but interesting enough to work.</td>', 'Crisply executed.  Not an especially facinating subject, but interesting enough to work.', '2004-02-03 15:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(567118, 57875, 4007, '<td valign="top">with the background completely blurred out like that I think the foreground really needs to be a lot sharper to be effective.</td>', 'with the background completely blurred out like that I think the foreground really needs to be a lot sharper to be effective.', '2004-02-03 15:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(567125, 57718, 4007, '<td valign="top">Well.. my two immediate reactions are "there''s no reason for a negative effect on this shot" and "that really produces a cool effect."<br/>So in the end, I think I''ve decided to take the shot as a purely visual experience and say that the unique subjects you had and the way they result from the effect made it a good choice, and the result is a very cool shot.</td>', 'Well.. my two immediate reactions are "there''s no reason for a negative effect on this shot" and "that really produces a cool effect."So in the end, I think I''ve decided to take the shot as a purely visual experience and say that the unique subjects you had and the way they result from the effect made it a good choice, and the result is a very cool shot.', '2004-02-03 15:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(567130, 57493, 4007, '<td valign="top">The tilted horizon is just the right touch to make this interesting.  Great work.</td>', 'The tilted horizon is just the right touch to make this interesting.  Great work.', '2004-02-03 15:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(567131, 57943, 4007, '<td valign="top">interesting study of form, texture, and reflection in curves.  I like the close crop.</td>', 'interesting study of form, texture, and reflection in curves.  I like the close crop.', '2004-02-03 15:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(567203, 57718, 15407, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred the original colors I think... yet I''m sure the voters would have considered it too ''dark''.</td>', 'I would have preferred the original colors I think... yet I''m sure the voters would have considered it too ''dark''.', '2004-02-03 16:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(567212, 58200, 15407, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.  It would have more appeal with me if the wine bottle &amp; glass lightened up somewhat.</td>', 'I like the shot.  It would have more appeal with me if the wine bottle & glass lightened up somewhat.', '2004-02-03 17:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(567213, 58145, 15407, '<td valign="top">Clearly a result of too many Vulcan mind melds! Nice work in the ''darkroom.</td>', 'Clearly a result of too many Vulcan mind melds! Nice work in the ''darkroom.', '2004-02-03 17:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(567218, 57781, 15407, '<td valign="top">Hmm ... butter is green on this end?</td>', 'Hmm ... butter is green on this end?', '2004-02-03 17:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(567224, 57942, 15407, '<td valign="top">Great stuff except for the crop in the upper right.</td>', 'Great stuff except for the crop in the upper right.', '2004-02-03 17:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
