(567254, 57721, 15407, '<td valign="top">Great concept and technically above average to many shots in this challenge, just ''whiter'' than I prefer.</td>', 'Great concept and technically above average to many shots in this challenge, just ''whiter'' than I prefer.', '2004-02-03 17:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
