(567356, 57758, 12268, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much. Love the angle &amp; composition. I would have scored it higher had the table been the whole of the BG &amp; the little fuzzy thingy to the lower left &amp; glare to the middle left not been a bit distracting. 8</td>', 'I like this shot very much. Love the angle & composition. I would have scored it higher had the table been the whole of the BG & the little fuzzy thingy to the lower left & glare to the middle left not been a bit distracting. 8', '2004-02-03 20:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
