(567368, 58208, 15690, '<td valign="top">One picture is worth a thousand words.  Interesting.  Good luck.</td>', 'One picture is worth a thousand words.  Interesting.  Good luck.', '2004-02-03 20:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(567385, 58142, 16703, '<td valign="top">i think this is the best representation of  salt and pepper in this challenge.. well done...</td>', 'i think this is the best representation of  salt and pepper in this challenge.. well done...', '2004-02-03 20:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(567397, 57829, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great concept! I can relate to that well since I live in Los Angeles and we have terrible smog problems. The only issue I have with this entry is compression. It is most present on the second smaller burn-off stack. It seems a bit blurry and pixelated.</td>', 'Great concept! I can relate to that well since I live in Los Angeles and we have terrible smog problems. The only issue I have with this entry is compression. It is most present on the second smaller burn-off stack. It seems a bit blurry and pixelated.', '2004-02-03 20:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(567399, 58101, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great concept and sepia lends well to the "antique feel". I almost wish it was a bit brighter but it''s not that big a deal. Excellent focus, too.</td>', 'Great concept and sepia lends well to the "antique feel". I almost wish it was a bit brighter but it''s not that big a deal. Excellent focus, too.', '2004-02-03 21:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(567401, 57676, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very impressive use of DOF! Really makes you focus on the brush and the immediate surrounding brush strokes on the paper.<br/> <br/>Two minor things I would have fixed:<br/>1. Small miscellaneous dot on the downstroke on the left.<br/>2. Tighter cropping on the left side to eliminate the gray corner in the lower left.<br/> <br/>One thing I may have done differently:<br/>Place the bottle behind the brush or brushstrokes and still apply DOF.</td>', 'Very impressive use of DOF! Really makes you focus on the brush and the immediate surrounding brush strokes on the paper. Two minor things I would have fixed:1. Small miscellaneous dot on the downstroke on the left.2. Tighter cropping on the left side to eliminate the gray corner in the lower left. One thing I may have done differently:Place the bottle behind the brush or brushstrokes and still apply DOF.', '2004-02-03 21:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(567403, 58190, 12268, '<td valign="top">What a shot! I wished I had taken it. Nothing worng here! Beautiful bird, very crisp! Bumping this up to a 9!</td>', 'What a shot! I wished I had taken it. Nothing worng here! Beautiful bird, very crisp! Bumping this up to a 9!', '2004-02-03 21:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(567404, 57936, 12268, '<td valign="top">very cute shot! Love the sllep kuala. Nice crop &amp; composition. 8</td>', 'very cute shot! Love the sllep kuala. Nice crop & composition. 8', '2004-02-03 21:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(567406, 57863, 8054, '<td valign="top">The colors of the pencil are interesting but the shadow is a bit large.</td>', 'The colors of the pencil are interesting but the shadow is a bit large.', '2004-02-03 21:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(567410, 58136, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice details and textures and sharp focus, too. A bit of a stretch to fit the challenge, in my opinion, but excellent interpretation, nonetheless. Very original. 8.</td>', 'Nice details and textures and sharp focus, too. A bit of a stretch to fit the challenge, in my opinion, but excellent interpretation, nonetheless. Very original. 8.', '2004-02-03 21:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(567413, 58191, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot of the duck in flight. Good application of DOF. However, my one complaint is the use of noise as I think I''d prefer it without.</td>', 'Nice action shot of the duck in flight. Good application of DOF. However, my one complaint is the use of noise as I think I''d prefer it without.', '2004-02-03 21:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(567415, 58137, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective in this entry. The DOF applied to the coffee beans is also excellent. I''m not a fan of the shadow across the right third of the coffee in the mug. If the lighting was more even across the entire mug, I''d rate this higher.</td>', 'Nice perspective in this entry. The DOF applied to the coffee beans is also excellent. I''m not a fan of the shadow across the right third of the coffee in the mug. If the lighting was more even across the entire mug, I''d rate this higher.', '2004-02-03 21:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(567419, 57883, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice shot! exposure on the snow is good; colors too. fits the challenge well.</td>', 'nice shot! exposure on the snow is good; colors too. fits the challenge well.', '2004-02-03 21:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(567426, 57958, 12160, '<td valign="top">good still life photo, i like the composition and the dark b/g. A warmer look might add mood and drama to it perhaps by way of a tungsten light source as opposed to daylight. It will also reduce the reflections on the glass surfaces. It''s a great photo nonetheless.</td>', 'good still life photo, i like the composition and the dark b/g. A warmer look might add mood and drama to it perhaps by way of a tungsten light source as opposed to daylight. It will also reduce the reflections on the glass surfaces. It''s a great photo nonetheless.', '2004-02-03 21:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
