(567525, 58105, 5822, '<td valign="top">I Like the romantic and soft feel to this image but find the lighting to be objectionable...I think you''ve lost too much detail in the skin tones.  Also, the composition could be improved by not such a tight crop where you''re cutting off fingers.</td>', 'I Like the romantic and soft feel to this image but find the lighting to be objectionable...I think you''ve lost too much detail in the skin tones.  Also, the composition could be improved by not such a tight crop where you''re cutting off fingers.', '2004-02-03 23:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
