(567551, 58156, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful compostion and color that has a few minor flaws, such as that I can barely see your background and it appears the image has a lot of lint.  Also, the key looks like it''s been over-sharpened.</td>', 'Wonderful compostion and color that has a few minor flaws, such as that I can barely see your background and it appears the image has a lot of lint.  Also, the key looks like it''s been over-sharpened.', '2004-02-04 00:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(567560, 57641, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent leading lines and composition here. I wish you had used another colored toothbrush (the bristles) or toothpaste as I would have liiked to have seen some color contrast between the two. In addition, the lighting is too harsh and you''ve lost detail in parts of the image.</td>', 'Excellent leading lines and composition here. I wish you had used another colored toothbrush (the bristles) or toothpaste as I would have liiked to have seen some color contrast between the two. In addition, the lighting is too harsh and you''ve lost detail in parts of the image.', '2004-02-04 00:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(567647, 57807, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait contrasted well against the bright background.  Good contrast, detail and textures. Very life-like...almost too life-like...but I guess that''s the harsh realities referred to in your title, which I like very much as well. Meets the challenge well. Great effort.</td>', 'Excellent portrait contrasted well against the bright background.  Good contrast, detail and textures. Very life-like...almost too life-like...but I guess that''s the harsh realities referred to in your title, which I like very much as well. Meets the challenge well. Great effort.', '2004-02-04 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
