(567728, 57896, 8054, '<td valign="top">Lighting on the subject seems to be perfect but on the background surface is a different story. Seems washed out on the right side. I would have preferred a smoother gradation and a smaller hotspot. Perfect focus and amazing details, though.</td>', 'Lighting on the subject seems to be perfect but on the background surface is a different story. Seems washed out on the right side. I would have preferred a smoother gradation and a smaller hotspot. Perfect focus and amazing details, though.', '2004-02-04 00:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(567744, 58203, 8054, '<td valign="top">Incredible lighting effects make the utensils appear to glow (or maybe it''s just some dodging effects that are responsible). The reflections of the tines in the knife make the fork look complete. I wish that more of the subject was in focus.</td>', 'Incredible lighting effects make the utensils appear to glow (or maybe it''s just some dodging effects that are responsible). The reflections of the tines in the knife make the fork look complete. I wish that more of the subject was in focus.', '2004-02-04 01:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(567751, 58114, 8054, '<td valign="top">Neat salt and papper shakers. I like the reflections on them and that they do not reveal much of their environment (room photographer etc). The duotone/sepia also works amazingly well.</td>', 'Neat salt and papper shakers. I like the reflections on them and that they do not reveal much of their environment (room photographer etc). The duotone/sepia also works amazingly well.', '2004-02-04 01:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(567757, 57758, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great POV, lighting, focus and detail. The DOF works well with the chopsitcks. My faults with this are the shadows at the top and the dark spot in the lower left. If those were not in the picture I''d rate this very high.</td>', 'Great POV, lighting, focus and detail. The DOF works well with the chopsitcks. My faults with this are the shadows at the top and the dark spot in the lower left. If those were not in the picture I''d rate this very high.', '2004-02-04 01:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
