(567767, 58090, 11078, '<td valign="top">good idea and well composed</td>', 'good idea and well composed', '2004-02-04 01:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(567769, 57611, 8054, '<td valign="top">AMAZING! I love how you can see only half of the glass. The glass beads/stones are a nice touch. I also like the spotlight by the Maker''s Mark bottle. Very clean and extremely detailed. But that last bit is also your downfall. There''s too much detail in the glass as I can see some background reflected in it. If that was not there, I''d rate this a 10. I wish there were half points cause then I''d give you 9.5 but I cannot so you get a 9. Great job!</td>', 'AMAZING! I love how you can see only half of the glass. The glass beads/stones are a nice touch. I also like the spotlight by the Maker''s Mark bottle. Very clean and extremely detailed. But that last bit is also your downfall. There''s too much detail in the glass as I can see some background reflected in it. If that was not there, I''d rate this a 10. I wish there were half points cause then I''d give you 9.5 but I cannot so you get a 9. Great job!', '2004-02-04 01:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
