(567834, 58013, 16230, '<td valign="top">I have never seen anything so hideous. But, the photo is great. &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'I have never seen anything so hideous. But, the photo is great. <g>', '2004-02-04 01:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(567838, 58183, 7151, '<td valign="top">OK, for the theme, though to me, pen and pencil seem a bit more contrasting than going together (you use a pen OR pencil), but that''s a bit nit-picky.  :)  The setup is really interesting - how you got the bundle balanced on the one pencil.  DOF is a bit too narrow I think, since the tip of the pen is out of focus  (again stressing the contrast, not the togetherness, though I assume unintentionally).  Lighting and use of colors are good.  I think this would really stand out in a "one of these things doesn''t belong here" type competition.  Still, a good entry.</td>', 'OK, for the theme, though to me, pen and pencil seem a bit more contrasting than going together (you use a pen OR pencil), but that''s a bit nit-picky.  :)  The setup is really interesting - how you got the bundle balanced on the one pencil.  DOF is a bit too narrow I think, since the tip of the pen is out of focus  (again stressing the contrast, not the togetherness, though I assume unintentionally).  Lighting and use of colors are good.  I think this would really stand out in a "one of these things doesn''t belong here" type competition.  Still, a good entry.', '2004-02-04 01:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(567839, 58119, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Interesting use of back lighting.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice.  Interesting use of back lighting.  I like it.', '2004-02-04 01:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(567842, 58177, 7151, '<td valign="top">Good idea, composition and lighting setup are great.  Lighting on the spool is a bit intense.  I''d have prefered a bit of a simpler title.  Choice of background could have been better.  Overall, good shot.</td>', 'Good idea, composition and lighting setup are great.  Lighting on the spool is a bit intense.  I''d have prefered a bit of a simpler title.  Choice of background could have been better.  Overall, good shot.', '2004-02-04 01:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(567845, 57956, 7151, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good lighting.  Composition could have been better - the tight framing could work well, but it''s so tight it has a bit of a square, blocked off feel - you don''t get the feel of the ball in the glove, the two together, but the ball to one side (vertically), the glove to the other.  A real baseball would have photographed better.  Good effort.</td>', 'Good idea, good lighting.  Composition could have been better - the tight framing could work well, but it''s so tight it has a bit of a square, blocked off feel - you don''t get the feel of the ball in the glove, the two together, but the ball to one side (vertically), the glove to the other.  A real baseball would have photographed better.  Good effort.', '2004-02-04 01:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(567847, 57607, 15690, '<td valign="top">This one makes me laugh.  What a great sense of humor.  Good luck.</td>', 'This one makes me laugh.  What a great sense of humor.  Good luck.', '2004-02-04 02:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(567848, 58205, 7151, '<td valign="top">Good picture, odd title (I presume I get it, but detracts from the challenge theme).</td>', 'Good picture, odd title (I presume I get it, but detracts from the challenge theme).', '2004-02-04 02:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(567855, 57751, 7151, '<td valign="top">Great picture, bad title for the challenge theme.  (How can they be partners - the cat would eat the fish.  What crime would they commit toghether.)</td>', 'Great picture, bad title for the challenge theme.  (How can they be partners - the cat would eat the fish.  What crime would they commit toghether.)', '2004-02-04 02:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(567860, 58192, 7151, '<td valign="top">You really sold this one well.  I almost overlooked the finished product, then the purpose of the arrow sunk in - the layout is brilliant.  Nice job.</td>', 'You really sold this one well.  I almost overlooked the finished product, then the purpose of the arrow sunk in - the layout is brilliant.  Nice job.', '2004-02-04 02:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(567864, 57870, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nice ice - not enough snow.  The shadows might have been interesting, but in the end, for me, they clash with the vertical icicles and become a distraction.</td>', 'Nice ice - not enough snow.  The shadows might have been interesting, but in the end, for me, they clash with the vertical icicles and become a distraction.', '2004-02-04 02:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(567865, 57960, 4258, '<td valign="top">A more even lighting would make this picture even better</td>', 'A more even lighting would make this picture even better', '2004-02-04 02:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(567867, 57676, 4258, '<td valign="top">looks more of Paper and Brush, a higher DoF would help</td>', 'looks more of Paper and Brush, a higher DoF would help', '2004-02-04 02:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(567868, 57613, 7151, '<td valign="top">I had several ideas like this - the one thing is visual (the mountains), the other is implied or conceptual (Colorado).  In the end I didn''t pursue it because to pull it off, both "things" I think really need to have impact in the shot - here, Colorado doesn''t.  Nice mountain shot though.</td>', 'I had several ideas like this - the one thing is visual (the mountains), the other is implied or conceptual (Colorado).  In the end I didn''t pursue it because to pull it off, both "things" I think really need to have impact in the shot - here, Colorado doesn''t.  Nice mountain shot though.', '2004-02-04 02:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(567869, 57893, 4258, '<td valign="top">Her skin has a very dry and patchy look</td>', 'Her skin has a very dry and patchy look', '2004-02-04 02:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(567870, 57875, 7151, '<td valign="top">A photo and focus.  (Sorry, obnoxious, but I couldn''t resist.)  The composition is too steril - offset the wineglass so the fire is more visible.  And, seriously, something needs to be in focus.  Personally, I think both the fire and the glass should be in focus, since they''re both named subjects of your photo.  A nice idea, and a tough shot, but you just didn''t pull it off.</td>', 'A photo and focus.  (Sorry, obnoxious, but I couldn''t resist.)  The composition is too steril - offset the wineglass so the fire is more visible.  And, seriously, something needs to be in focus.  Personally, I think both the fire and the glass should be in focus, since they''re both named subjects of your photo.  A nice idea, and a tough shot, but you just didn''t pull it off.', '2004-02-04 02:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(567871, 57493, 4258, '<td valign="top">Good composition, though I dont like the tilt...</td>', 'Good composition, though I dont like the tilt...', '2004-02-04 02:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(567873, 57881, 7151, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Effective use of color and soft focus.  Lighitng and composition are excellent.  The only blemish is the title - a little too cutsie.  My favorite so far this challenge.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Effective use of color and soft focus.  Lighitng and composition are excellent.  The only blemish is the title - a little too cutsie.  My favorite so far this challenge.', '2004-02-04 02:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(567874, 57766, 4258, '<td valign="top">nice concept but the plastic figures look too tame to symbolise war</td>', 'nice concept but the plastic figures look too tame to symbolise war', '2004-02-04 02:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(567876, 57881, 4258, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - would also fit very well in the shallow DoF challenge...</td>', 'Nice composition - would also fit very well in the shallow DoF challenge...', '2004-02-04 02:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(567884, 57894, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the idea on this one and the picture is pretty nice too.  Like what you did with the colors on this one.  Makes for a great original photo.  Good work 8</td>', 'I like the idea on this one and the picture is pretty nice too.  Like what you did with the colors on this one.  Makes for a great original photo.  Good work 8', '2004-02-04 02:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(567886, 57921, 3540, '<td valign="top">Seems to grey to me.  A little more contrast would feel beeter I think.  Other thing that I can see is that the crop is a little tight..</td>', 'Seems to grey to me.  A little more contrast would feel beeter I think.  Other thing that I can see is that the crop is a little tight..', '2004-02-04 02:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(567913, 57757, 15588, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2004-02-04 04:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(567914, 58110, 15588, '<td valign="top">Do not know if you drop and shot or had it hanging from something, but I like how the cookie seems to just hang,</td>', 'Do not know if you drop and shot or had it hanging from something, but I like how the cookie seems to just hang,', '2004-02-04 04:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(567916, 58080, 15588, '<td valign="top">Smple but impactive.</td>', 'Smple but impactive.', '2004-02-04 04:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(567919, 57607, 15588, '<td valign="top">Pea "Nuts" and bolts ?, Creative.</td>', 'Pea "Nuts" and bolts ?, Creative.', '2004-02-04 04:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(567927, 57791, 15588, '<td valign="top">The 3-D effect I like, but a couple of the balls does not seem to fit in, like the edges are a liittle off, still gave you a nice rating.</td>', 'The 3-D effect I like, but a couple of the balls does not seem to fit in, like the edges are a liittle off, still gave you a nice rating.', '2004-02-04 05:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(567932, 58114, 4258, '<td valign="top">Nice - looks almost computer generated :)</td>', 'Nice - looks almost computer generated :)', '2004-02-04 05:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(567944, 57728, 4258, '<td valign="top">I would have included the other corner of the lips as well</td>', 'I would have included the other corner of the lips as well', '2004-02-04 05:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(567945, 58106, 4258, '<td valign="top">Yum Yum</td>', 'Yum Yum', '2004-02-04 05:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(567947, 57721, 4258, '<td valign="top">good use of level correction - somehow but the tilted ink bottle is disturbing :)</td>', 'good use of level correction - somehow but the tilted ink bottle is disturbing :)', '2004-02-04 05:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(567952, 58183, 4258, '<td valign="top">would have been a nice shot but for the bottom also a bit of noise reduction using Neat Image would help</td>', 'would have been a nice shot but for the bottom also a bit of noise reduction using Neat Image would help', '2004-02-04 05:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(567955, 58085, 4258, '<td valign="top">A bit more DoF and focus and this will be a killer</td>', 'A bit more DoF and focus and this will be a killer', '2004-02-04 05:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(568071, 58202, 10705, '<td valign="top">I tried a photo similar to this and couldn''t quite pull it off.  I really like your shot ... very nice!  ... any tips on how you did it???</td>', 'I tried a photo similar to this and couldn''t quite pull it off.  I really like your shot ... very nice!  ... any tips on how you did it???', '2004-02-04 08:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(568125, 57894, 7703, '<td valign="top">This is like a part of a music video that Bjork Gudmundsdottir (from Iceland) made for 5-6 years ago. Good photo with focus on right things ... give you 8</td>', 'This is like a part of a music video that Bjork Gudmundsdottir (from Iceland) made for 5-6 years ago. Good photo with focus on right things ... give you 8', '2004-02-04 08:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(568126, 57962, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like your shot, and I agree that bricks and mortar go together, but the focus of your photo is the ivy (at least for me).  Having said that, it makes for a much better photo than just bricks &amp; mortar :)</td>', 'I like your shot, and I agree that bricks and mortar go together, but the focus of your photo is the ivy (at least for me).  Having said that, it makes for a much better photo than just bricks & mortar :)', '2004-02-04 08:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(568127, 57721, 7703, '<td valign="top">This is not the best photo I have seen ... great white background and well lighted but there is something that distract me because of how the ink is in the photo. Give you 6.</td>', 'This is not the best photo I have seen ... great white background and well lighted but there is something that distract me because of how the ink is in the photo. Give you 6.', '2004-02-04 08:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(568128, 57371, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve entertwined the thread and the needle, and the shadow really adds, too.  The texture of the background and the uneven lighting (where it was curved) is a little distracting.  Overall, good composition and focus.</td>', 'I like how you''ve entertwined the thread and the needle, and the shadow really adds, too.  The texture of the background and the uneven lighting (where it was curved) is a little distracting.  Overall, good composition and focus.', '2004-02-04 08:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(568129, 57995, 7703, '<td valign="top">Great idea to make the thread be out of focus but it''s litle bit to much out of focus. Great focus on the needle. Give you 7</td>', 'Great idea to make the thread be out of focus but it''s litle bit to much out of focus. Great focus on the needle. Give you 7', '2004-02-04 08:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(568131, 57402, 7703, '<td valign="top">Clean photo, good lightning ... hmm give you 9</td>', 'Clean photo, good lightning ... hmm give you 9', '2004-02-04 08:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(568132, 57875, 7703, '<td valign="top">This photo is out of focus. Give you 4</td>', 'This photo is out of focus. Give you 4', '2004-02-04 09:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(568133, 58192, 7703, '<td valign="top">The background could be cleaner ... it''s not totaly black but other then that this is funny and I like this ... something that nobody other thougt of and I give you 9</td>', 'The background could be cleaner ... it''s not totaly black but other then that this is funny and I like this ... something that nobody other thougt of and I give you 9', '2004-02-04 09:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(568157, 58149, 7703, '<td valign="top">The reflection is bad ... give you 5</td>', 'The reflection is bad ... give you 5', '2004-02-04 09:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(568165, 58093, 7703, '<td valign="top">Bad quality ... not interesting photo so I will give you 3</td>', 'Bad quality ... not interesting photo so I will give you 3', '2004-02-04 09:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(568168, 58198, 7703, '<td valign="top">I would prefer the shadow somewhere else but this is OK. Nice DOF. Give you 7</td>', 'I would prefer the shadow somewhere else but this is OK. Nice DOF. Give you 7', '2004-02-04 09:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(568172, 58060, 7703, '<td valign="top">There are realy nothing interesting with this photo ... hope you will do better next time ... -3</td>', 'There are realy nothing interesting with this photo ... hope you will do better next time ... -3', '2004-02-04 09:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(568219, 58145, 7703, '<td valign="top">Ok maybe funny but I don''t like the womens part of the mouth ... it don''t fit together -5</td>', 'Ok maybe funny but I don''t like the womens part of the mouth ... it don''t fit together -5', '2004-02-04 10:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(568264, 58106, 12160, '<td valign="top">hmmm, yummy! nice shot. I love the sharpness and composition, colour and lighting are good as well.</td>', 'hmmm, yummy! nice shot. I love the sharpness and composition, colour and lighting are good as well.', '2004-02-04 10:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(568267, 58191, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice stopped motion and shallow dof. black and white works well.</td>', 'nice stopped motion and shallow dof. black and white works well.', '2004-02-04 10:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(568270, 57417, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice detail all over, simple and effective. fits the challenge well.</td>', 'nice detail all over, simple and effective. fits the challenge well.', '2004-02-04 10:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(568274, 57582, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like it when photographers make something mundane look interesting.</td>', 'Nice!  I like it when photographers make something mundane look interesting.', '2004-02-04 10:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(568278, 57894, 12160, '<td valign="top">Exposure is well-handled on the bulb. Very nice colour tones and composition spot on. Nice work!</td>', 'Exposure is well-handled on the bulb. Very nice colour tones and composition spot on. Nice work!', '2004-02-04 10:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(568281, 57962, 9941, '<td valign="top">Unique in the challenge.  Very nice!</td>', 'Unique in the challenge.  Very nice!', '2004-02-04 10:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(568296, 57191, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful close up photo, love the shallow dof and the bokeh effect. nice work.</td>', 'beautiful close up photo, love the shallow dof and the bokeh effect. nice work.', '2004-02-04 10:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(568357, 57723, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the color rendition, texture and detail in this picture. Great shot.</td>', 'I really like the color rendition, texture and detail in this picture. Great shot.', '2004-02-04 11:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(568358, 57998, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflections. I''m not all that crazy about the bright green background.</td>', 'Nice use of reflections. I''m not all that crazy about the bright green background.', '2004-02-04 11:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(568360, 57828, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rendition - the butterfly looks like it is flying right out of the leaves. If the colors in the butterfly were reduced in post-processing I think that was a loss - it comes out looking too much like the surrounding leaves.</td>', 'Beautiful rendition - the butterfly looks like it is flying right out of the leaves. If the colors in the butterfly were reduced in post-processing I think that was a loss - it comes out looking too much like the surrounding leaves.', '2004-02-04 11:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(568361, 57781, 12733, '<td valign="top">I can almost taste it. Very nice rendition. But with that much butter, you''re going to gain a lot of weight.</td>', 'I can almost taste it. Very nice rendition. But with that much butter, you''re going to gain a lot of weight.', '2004-02-04 11:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(568363, 58150, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty high key shot. I like the dew on the tulip. Possibly a little more detail in the top of the flower would have been better - the backtround would not suffer from being a little darker.</td>', 'Very pretty high key shot. I like the dew on the tulip. Possibly a little more detail in the top of the flower would have been better - the backtround would not suffer from being a little darker.', '2004-02-04 11:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(568364, 58042, 12733, '<td valign="top">Sunlight and water may go together, but when you add a starburst filter you get the three''s a crowd effect. I think the sunlight can speak for itself.</td>', 'Sunlight and water may go together, but when you add a starburst filter you get the three''s a crowd effect. I think the sunlight can speak for itself.', '2004-02-04 11:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(568365, 57759, 12733, '<td valign="top">Wow, he''s a cute little guy, and the rendition of both the squirrel and the tree are perfectly sharp. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Wow, he''s a cute little guy, and the rendition of both the squirrel and the tree are perfectly sharp. Beautiful shot.', '2004-02-04 11:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(568368, 57868, 12733, '<td valign="top">He looks like he''s having fun, and almost gives the impression of motion. The clean background gives it away - it would be blurred if he were going at any speed.</td>', 'He looks like he''s having fun, and almost gives the impression of motion. The clean background gives it away - it would be blurred if he were going at any speed.', '2004-02-04 11:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(568369, 57873, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice symbolism, and great detail on the flowers. Is the background melting ice?</td>', 'Nice symbolism, and great detail on the flowers. Is the background melting ice?', '2004-02-04 11:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(568370, 57791, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting special effect does not necessarily a good picture make.</td>', 'An interesting special effect does not necessarily a good picture make.', '2004-02-04 11:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(568372, 57500, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice rendition, but kind of a cliche - especially since this was the example that was given in the statement of the theme.</td>', 'Nice rendition, but kind of a cliche - especially since this was the example that was given in the statement of the theme.', '2004-02-04 11:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(568373, 58148, 14032, '<td valign="top">Would be better if the thread stood out a little more from the background.</td>', 'Would be better if the thread stood out a little more from the background.', '2004-02-04 11:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(568375, 58203, 12733, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for metallic textures, and you''ve rendered them very nicely here. The diagonal composition geves the shot a more dramatic effect that a simple fork and knife would normally offer.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for metallic textures, and you''ve rendered them very nicely here. The diagonal composition geves the shot a more dramatic effect that a simple fork and knife would normally offer.', '2004-02-04 11:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(568376, 58085, 14032, '<td valign="top">Image is a little too soft.</td>', 'Image is a little too soft.', '2004-02-04 11:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(568378, 57929, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the composition , with the colors of the thread combined with the one spool in the front. The lighting makes the thread appear shiny - is that for real?</td>', 'I like the composition , with the colors of the thread combined with the one spool in the front. The lighting makes the thread appear shiny - is that for real?', '2004-02-04 11:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(568379, 57905, 14032, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the candle/bulb isn''t sharp enough for me.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the candle/bulb isn''t sharp enough for me.', '2004-02-04 11:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(568381, 58083, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in the pen and the desk mat. I also like the simple composition and lighting that brings ot the glow of the stones in the pen.</td>', 'I really like the colors in the pen and the desk mat. I also like the simple composition and lighting that brings ot the glow of the stones in the pen.', '2004-02-04 11:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(568382, 58208, 14032, '<td valign="top">Too soft on the whole and too blown out in the center.</td>', 'Too soft on the whole and too blown out in the center.', '2004-02-04 11:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(568384, 57941, 14032, '<td valign="top">Not a bad picture, but lemons and mints?</td>', 'Not a bad picture, but lemons and mints?', '2004-02-04 11:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(568387, 58116, 12733, '<td valign="top">You have captured the feeling of just the two of you alone in the landscape. I think cropping away some of the sky would actually enhance the lonely effect by making the land appear to go even further into the distance. Try moving the picture up and down on the monitor to cut some off to see what I mean.</td>', 'You have captured the feeling of just the two of you alone in the landscape. I think cropping away some of the sky would actually enhance the lonely effect by making the land appear to go even further into the distance. Try moving the picture up and down on the monitor to cut some off to see what I mean.', '2004-02-04 11:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(568389, 58093, 12733, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and a nice complosition, but the noise is excessive and the focus is kind of soft.</td>', 'Good idea, and a nice complosition, but the noise is excessive and the focus is kind of soft.', '2004-02-04 11:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(568390, 57807, 14032, '<td valign="top">It misses the challenge a bit for me, but great picture!</td>', 'It misses the challenge a bit for me, but great picture!', '2004-02-04 11:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(568391, 58090, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice rendition of the textures and composition. The key seems too green for natural color.</td>', 'Nice rendition of the textures and composition. The key seems too green for natural color.', '2004-02-04 11:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(568397, 58191, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great capture, nice timing. I''d like to see a bit more detail in the duck''s face - and that shadowy duck in the water is an unwelcome distraction.</td>', 'Great capture, nice timing. I''d like to see a bit more detail in the duck''s face - and that shadowy duck in the water is an unwelcome distraction.', '2004-02-04 11:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(568400, 58094, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors. Putting it into a background of ice (or what looks like ice) makes it appear really tempting. See if Corona would like to buy this shot for an ad.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors. Putting it into a background of ice (or what looks like ice) makes it appear really tempting. See if Corona would like to buy this shot for an ad.', '2004-02-04 11:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(568403, 58197, 12733, '<td valign="top">A beautiful landscape and a well-photographed fish. Somehow the fish is too big for the overall composition - even given that he is supposed to be a "monster."</td>', 'A beautiful landscape and a well-photographed fish. Somehow the fish is too big for the overall composition - even given that he is supposed to be a "monster."', '2004-02-04 11:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(568405, 57151, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of the glass textures and flame. I like the hint of a reflection below the candle, and the concept of opposites going together.</td>', 'Very nice capture of the glass textures and flame. I like the hint of a reflection below the candle, and the concept of opposites going together.', '2004-02-04 11:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(568411, 57582, 12733, '<td valign="top">Wide angle stretch, and then some. This is a very interesting composition - good use of the diagonal to give it some drama and great sharpness on the foreground metallic textures.</td>', 'Wide angle stretch, and then some. This is a very interesting composition - good use of the diagonal to give it some drama and great sharpness on the foreground metallic textures.', '2004-02-04 11:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(568414, 58010, 12733, '<td valign="top">You opened the book at a good page - the green in the picture sets off the mostly black and white in the rest of it. It also goes nicely with the touches of orange in the glasses frames.</td>', 'You opened the book at a good page - the green in the picture sets off the mostly black and white in the rest of it. It also goes nicely with the touches of orange in the glasses frames.', '2004-02-04 11:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(568419, 58183, 12733, '<td valign="top">The unusual angle makes this shot. Very nice. I also like the colors, which create an interesting composition.</td>', 'The unusual angle makes this shot. Very nice. I also like the colors, which create an interesting composition.', '2004-02-04 11:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(568424, 57962, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the leaves against the masonry.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the leaves against the masonry.', '2004-02-04 11:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(568426, 58136, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, and a really close macro. Nice rendition of the metal zipper.</td>', 'Cute idea, and a really close macro. Nice rendition of the metal zipper.', '2004-02-04 11:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(568428, 58178, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition using these two elements. I can see at least two possible interpretations.</td>', 'An interesting composition using these two elements. I can see at least two possible interpretations.', '2004-02-04 11:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(568432, 57963, 12733, '<td valign="top">The sharp rendition and simple composition make this look almost like a painting. That very bright highighlight is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The sharp rendition and simple composition make this look almost like a painting. That very bright highighlight is a bit distracting.', '2004-02-04 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(568437, 57751, 12733, '<td valign="top">The cat may think they go together; I''m not sure the fish woujld agree. Nice rendition of the fish; I''d like to see more detail in the cat, though I have a black cat and I know how hard it is to get detail.</td>', 'The cat may think they go together; I''m not sure the fish woujld agree. Nice rendition of the fish; I''d like to see more detail in the cat, though I have a black cat and I know how hard it is to get detail.', '2004-02-04 12:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(568439, 58106, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit, nice and sharp - I can almost taste it.</td>', 'Beautifully lit, nice and sharp - I can almost taste it.', '2004-02-04 12:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(568523, 57747, 12417, '<td valign="top">The needle should have a sharper focus and a different or added soft light source to make the needle shiny would have really stepped up this image.</td>', 'The needle should have a sharper focus and a different or added soft light source to make the needle shiny would have really stepped up this image.', '2004-02-04 12:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(568525, 57721, 12417, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and great color, but I found it failed to pull me in and grab my interest/attention.</td>', 'Nice picture and great color, but I found it failed to pull me in and grab my interest/attention.', '2004-02-04 12:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(568531, 57612, 12417, '<td valign="top">Great cropping and texture capture</td>', 'Great cropping and texture capture', '2004-02-04 12:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(568540, 58101, 10848, '<td valign="top">Good shot, good lighting and good contrast</td>', 'Good shot, good lighting and good contrast', '2004-02-04 13:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(568544, 57921, 10848, '<td valign="top">Who cannot realte to this shot, great shot, I like the black and white choice for this shot, seem very appropriate</td>', 'Who cannot realte to this shot, great shot, I like the black and white choice for this shot, seem very appropriate', '2004-02-04 13:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(568548, 57936, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot ! Perfect lighting and wonderful contrast 10</td>', 'This is a great shot ! Perfect lighting and wonderful contrast 10', '2004-02-04 13:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(568556, 58082, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, wonderful colors 10</td>', 'This is a great shot, wonderful colors 10', '2004-02-04 13:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(568561, 57881, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot, perfect lighting and dof, I like the subtle dreamy effect here 10</td>', 'Great shot, perfect lighting and dof, I like the subtle dreamy effect here 10', '2004-02-04 13:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(568564, 58083, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pen, I like the bright colors here, adds interest to this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful pen, I like the bright colors here, adds interest to this shot.', '2004-02-04 13:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(568567, 57857, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is very good, perfect lighting, the dof here is perfect for this shot.</td>', 'This is very good, perfect lighting, the dof here is perfect for this shot.', '2004-02-04 13:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(568573, 58145, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is so cute, we got a good chuckle from this one, you and your wife favor alot, ha ha.....good job and thanks for the chuckle 9</td>', 'This is so cute, we got a good chuckle from this one, you and your wife favor alot, ha ha.....good job and thanks for the chuckle 9', '2004-02-04 13:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(568575, 57723, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, wonderful lighting and great contrast 10</td>', 'Beautiful colors, wonderful lighting and great contrast 10', '2004-02-04 13:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(568578, 57893, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2004-02-04 13:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(568586, 58144, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the lighting is great, I like the choice of frame also, very nice</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the lighting is great, I like the choice of frame also, very nice', '2004-02-04 13:17:33.000000', NULL, 1);
