(568626, 58114, 11241, '<td valign="top">The overall tone of the shot is great, and you cropped it very well.....I would give it a 10 if I could vote</td>', 'The overall tone of the shot is great, and you cropped it very well.....I would give it a 10 if I could vote', '2004-02-04 13:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(568684, 57705, 6999, '<td valign="top">Compositionally I find this kind of obvious - sure it''s an interesting scene, architecturally, and I actively like the irregularity of the lamp-posts, but such a grey day, such very very flat light has wiped out any real interest, visually, from this. Had it been my own shot, I''d either have tried to go back another day, or probably not submitted it. I think it''s lacking in mood, is what I''m trying to express.</td>', 'Compositionally I find this kind of obvious - sure it''s an interesting scene, architecturally, and I actively like the irregularity of the lamp-posts, but such a grey day, such very very flat light has wiped out any real interest, visually, from this. Had it been my own shot, I''d either have tried to go back another day, or probably not submitted it. I think it''s lacking in mood, is what I''m trying to express.', '2004-02-04 14:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(568693, 57943, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think i can claim to have some experience of photographing shiny cutlery ... compositionally I find this a touch weak - the relationship between the two things is rather arbitrary. The points of real contrast are in weak areas of the frame - either too low or too central, the balance of the ''weight'' of them is heavily skewed in favour of the fork, the sharp lines are too sharp resulting in ''jaggies'', and the reflections, in balance with the background, are so busy and not terribly well placed. All of which is, naturally, my opinion only.</td>', 'I think i can claim to have some experience of photographing shiny cutlery ... compositionally I find this a touch weak - the relationship between the two things is rather arbitrary. The points of real contrast are in weak areas of the frame - either too low or too central, the balance of the ''weight'' of them is heavily skewed in favour of the fork, the sharp lines are too sharp resulting in ''jaggies'', and the reflections, in balance with the background, are so busy and not terribly well placed. All of which is, naturally, my opinion only.', '2004-02-04 14:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(568701, 58147, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Lacks something, for me - perhaps only that the truly interesting moment of light is where the page fold is - and that''s weak compositionally. Certainly one of the more intersting entries so far though.</td>', 'Great lighting. Lacks something, for me - perhaps only that the truly interesting moment of light is where the page fold is - and that''s weak compositionally. Certainly one of the more intersting entries so far though.', '2004-02-04 14:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(568707, 58114, 6999, '<td valign="top">I don''t se what the negative space top of frame adds to this shot - your cropping is otherwise so close to the edges of your subjects. After a long look, I actually think it detracts - it serves to remove some interst from the progression of those reflections.</td>', 'I don''t se what the negative space top of frame adds to this shot - your cropping is otherwise so close to the edges of your subjects. After a long look, I actually think it detracts - it serves to remove some interst from the progression of those reflections.', '2004-02-04 14:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(568724, 57807, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, though somewhat forced as a fit for this challenge, as your very explicit title acknowledges. Still a great portrait, though.</td>', 'Great portrait, though somewhat forced as a fit for this challenge, as your very explicit title acknowledges. Still a great portrait, though.', '2004-02-04 15:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(568726, 57751, 15805, '<td valign="top">My favourite in this challenge... simple and efficient composition. The black cat is a great contrast to the white background and the colorful fish. Good job!</td>', 'My favourite in this challenge... simple and efficient composition. The black cat is a great contrast to the white background and the colorful fish. Good job!', '2004-02-04 15:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(568727, 58124, 15805, '<td valign="top">The most original and funniest idea in this challenge! The composition is also good but I wish the newspaper was in focus, too. Good job!</td>', 'The most original and funniest idea in this challenge! The composition is also good but I wish the newspaper was in focus, too. Good job!', '2004-02-04 15:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
