(568791, 57996, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried a different/darker background. Nice photo but I don''t think there is enough contrast between the subject and the counter.</td>', 'I might have tried a different/darker background. Nice photo but I don''t think there is enough contrast between the subject and the counter.', '2004-02-04 16:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
