(569341, 57843, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. Good composition; lighting is good. I find some sort of imbalance on the subjects against the blue background. The high contrast between the stockings and the b/g is good but imo they overpower the stilletos which are too dark against the background... just a thought, it''s a good photo nonetheless,</td>', 'Very nice idea. Good composition; lighting is good. I find some sort of imbalance on the subjects against the blue background. The high contrast between the stockings and the b/g is good but imo they overpower the stilletos which are too dark against the background... just a thought, it''s a good photo nonetheless,', '2004-02-04 23:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(569346, 57564, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice close-up, almost like an ad photo. I like the dominant green color that suggests the idea of freshness or coolness. The subject, title and the composition all fit nicely together for good photo. nice job. imo it would have made for a more powerful photo if the soda can was open and some of it poured onto the glass. Very effective photo nonetheless.</td>', 'Very nice close-up, almost like an ad photo. I like the dominant green color that suggests the idea of freshness or coolness. The subject, title and the composition all fit nicely together for good photo. nice job. imo it would have made for a more powerful photo if the soda can was open and some of it poured onto the glass. Very effective photo nonetheless.', '2004-02-05 00:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
