(570304, 57718, 14012, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t get to many "over processed" or "too PSed". I think you did a great job with this. The editing really works well. Crop and focus are great. I think this is my favorite so far. Good luck.</td>', 'I hope you don''t get to many "over processed" or "too PSed". I think you did a great job with this. The editing really works well. Crop and focus are great. I think this is my favorite so far. Good luck.', '2004-02-05 20:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
