(570587, 57582, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great of depth. Diagonal composition really makes the shot dynamic and interesting. Contrast is great makes the subject seem to pop out of the background. "8"</td>', 'Great of depth. Diagonal composition really makes the shot dynamic and interesting. Contrast is great makes the subject seem to pop out of the background. "8"', '2004-02-06 02:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(570592, 57757, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition and framing is very good. I like how the composition contains layers of circles upon circle. The bowl, inside the bowl, the cereal, the spoon, more cereal. Very good textures were captured of the cereal.</td>', 'Composition and framing is very good. I like how the composition contains layers of circles upon circle. The bowl, inside the bowl, the cereal, the spoon, more cereal. Very good textures were captured of the cereal.', '2004-02-06 02:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(570594, 58207, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The nice circular shapes in the image really helps to keep your interest in the shot. The angle shot gives it a dynamic feeling. Colors are pretty good showing off the metallic natural of the quarters.</td>', 'Great composition. The nice circular shapes in the image really helps to keep your interest in the shot. The angle shot gives it a dynamic feeling. Colors are pretty good showing off the metallic natural of the quarters.', '2004-02-06 02:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(570595, 57499, 10084, '<td valign="top">The colors definitely give a warming feeling. Composition is very interesting. the background really helps to push the subjects out of the shot. One thing I don''t like is that there seems to be a halo around the flowers. "9"</td>', 'The colors definitely give a warming feeling. Composition is very interesting. the background really helps to push the subjects out of the shot. One thing I don''t like is that there seems to be a halo around the flowers. "9"', '2004-02-06 02:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(570597, 57896, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is very interesting with the diagonal alignment of the bolt pointing at the nut. Great closeup. You can see all the texture of the metal and all the imperfections on it. The grooves of the bolt is interesting.</td>', 'Composition is very interesting with the diagonal alignment of the bolt pointing at the nut. Great closeup. You can see all the texture of the metal and all the imperfections on it. The grooves of the bolt is interesting.', '2004-02-06 02:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
