(571202, 57816, 12475, '<td valign="top">A really appealing bird photo (and I love that his foot is in motion).</td>', 'A really appealing bird photo (and I love that his foot is in motion).', '2004-02-06 16:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(571203, 57963, 12475, '<td valign="top">You made art out of a toothbrush! This is beautiful.</td>', 'You made art out of a toothbrush! This is beautiful.', '2004-02-06 16:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(571206, 57869, 12475, '<td valign="top">i really like the idea here; I''d think like the shot better if it were lighter, but very nice work.</td>', 'i really like the idea here; I''d think like the shot better if it were lighter, but very nice work.', '2004-02-06 16:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(571208, 57430, 12475, '<td valign="top">Very nice; I really like this kind of "found" shot, lifting the mundane into something altogether different. I would almost prefer it without the concreteness of the sign, but that''s a personal thing, I think.</td>', 'Very nice; I really like this kind of "found" shot, lifting the mundane into something altogether different. I would almost prefer it without the concreteness of the sign, but that''s a personal thing, I think.', '2004-02-06 16:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(571211, 57859, 12475, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, and so is the lighting. I think the border detracts though  (and I''m not a border-hater, necessarily). Also, the shot appears a bit crowded. Still, I''m now officially thirsty! :)</td>', 'The colors are nice, and so is the lighting. I think the border detracts though  (and I''m not a border-hater, necessarily). Also, the shot appears a bit crowded. Still, I''m now officially thirsty! :)', '2004-02-06 16:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(571212, 57500, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is small and a bit dark; I think it would have more impact if it were larger.</td>', 'This is small and a bit dark; I think it would have more impact if it were larger.', '2004-02-06 16:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(571213, 58186, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is an ambitious concept but one that''s hard to carry off without looking busy.</td>', 'This is an ambitious concept but one that''s hard to carry off without looking busy.', '2004-02-06 16:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(571215, 57642, 12475, '<td valign="top">I like the idea...but this is small and dark; hard to see the difference between the salt and pepper.</td>', 'I like the idea...but this is small and dark; hard to see the difference between the salt and pepper.', '2004-02-06 16:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(571218, 57441, 12475, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The shot is a bit overbright in front, and dark and grainy in the rear, though; I almost missed the man in the back pew, and he adds quite a bit of emotional interest to the shot. Good try!</td>', 'Nice composition. The shot is a bit overbright in front, and dark and grainy in the rear, though; I almost missed the man in the back pew, and he adds quite a bit of emotional interest to the shot. Good try!', '2004-02-06 17:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(571220, 57768, 12475, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I''d like to see more of the bottle than just the label; and I''m not sure why those 2 dark triangles in front of the pretzels. And detail could be crisper. I like the colored light reflections, which makes me think this was take in a real bar!</td>', 'Hmmm, I''d like to see more of the bottle than just the label; and I''m not sure why those 2 dark triangles in front of the pretzels. And detail could be crisper. I like the colored light reflections, which makes me think this was take in a real bar!', '2004-02-06 17:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(571222, 58197, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is weird and fun; kind of like one of those jackalope postcards. There could be more detail and interest in the background.</td>', 'This is weird and fun; kind of like one of those jackalope postcards. There could be more detail and interest in the background.', '2004-02-06 17:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(571223, 58195, 12475, '<td valign="top">A shot like this should be more appetizing! :) Perhaps a different color background and a more interesting angle than top-down would help.</td>', 'A shot like this should be more appetizing! :) Perhaps a different color background and a more interesting angle than top-down would help.', '2004-02-06 17:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(571225, 58194, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea, but it comes across as a snapshot more than an intentional composition.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea, but it comes across as a snapshot more than an intentional composition.', '2004-02-06 17:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(571227, 58177, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is interesting; I really like the spotlighting and B&amp;W. I think it''s a bit tilted (not always a bad thing in my book, but here it''s distracting) and some detail is lost on the spindle and thread.</td>', 'This is interesting; I really like the spotlighting and B&W. I think it''s a bit tilted (not always a bad thing in my book, but here it''s distracting) and some detail is lost on the spindle and thread.', '2004-02-06 17:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(571229, 57490, 12475, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The yellow is too strong for my taste.</td>', 'Nice idea. The yellow is too strong for my taste.', '2004-02-06 17:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(571231, 57883, 12475, '<td valign="top">Great, great colors. I like the contrast between warm red and icy blue.</td>', 'Great, great colors. I like the contrast between warm red and icy blue.', '2004-02-06 17:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(571233, 57998, 12475, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, with great detail, balance, and color.</td>', 'Very nicely composed, with great detail, balance, and color.', '2004-02-06 17:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(571249, 57766, 2293, '<td valign="top">Powerful statement. Of course very true as well. The lighting and poses on the figurines is captivating. I know they''re fake, but it pulls me in nonetheless. Good work.</td>', 'Powerful statement. Of course very true as well. The lighting and poses on the figurines is captivating. I know they''re fake, but it pulls me in nonetheless. Good work.', '2004-02-06 17:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(571251, 57417, 2293, '<td valign="top">Vivid, original. I like it.</td>', 'Vivid, original. I like it.', '2004-02-06 17:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(571274, 58040, 2158, '<td valign="top">The simple ideas so often seem to work the best.  I love this.</td>', 'The simple ideas so often seem to work the best.  I love this.', '2004-02-06 17:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(571355, 58082, 3306, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Doesn''t look real! Great shot.</td>', 'Awesome. Doesn''t look real! Great shot.', '2004-02-06 19:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(571374, 57880, 6597, '<td valign="top">goodcolor 8</td>', 'goodcolor 8', '2004-02-06 20:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(571375, 57611, 6597, '<td valign="top">don''y like whiskey but a very good shot 8</td>', 'don''y like whiskey but a very good shot 8', '2004-02-06 20:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(571464, 57935, 9462, '<td valign="top">Absolutely exquisite!!!</td>', 'Absolutely exquisite!!!', '2004-02-06 22:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(571476, 57939, 12268, '<td valign="top">I like that angle &amp; the composition of this shot. Not sure about the sepia tone bc it takes away a bit from the contrast between the salt &amp; the pepper. 7</td>', 'I like that angle & the composition of this shot. Not sure about the sepia tone bc it takes away a bit from the contrast between the salt & the pepper. 7', '2004-02-06 22:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(571478, 57612, 12268, '<td valign="top">very cool mac shot here. good lighting &amp; sharp image. 7</td>', 'very cool mac shot here. good lighting & sharp image. 7', '2004-02-06 22:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(571562, 58119, 4007, '<td valign="top">Great lighting really gives this shot a powerful mood.  Good work.</td>', 'Great lighting really gives this shot a powerful mood.  Good work.', '2004-02-07 00:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(571628, 57676, 4007, '<td valign="top">I think the shallow depth of field didn''t work out for this shot.</td>', 'I think the shallow depth of field didn''t work out for this shot.', '2004-02-07 01:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(571630, 57751, 16230, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-05 14:37:49.</i></td>', '.', '2004-02-07 01:43:56.000000', '2006-05-05 15:37:49.000000', 1),
(571631, 58129, 4007, '<td valign="top">The amount of background outside of the mirror frame should be symmetrical on each side.</td>', 'The amount of background outside of the mirror frame should be symmetrical on each side.', '2004-02-07 01:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(571634, 57751, 14553, '<td valign="top">overexposure done right. not only do the cat and fish go together, but the fish and water, and so does black and white. great choice of colours and focus, if this is not the winner, i don''t know what is.</td>', 'overexposure done right. not only do the cat and fish go together, but the fish and water, and so does black and white. great choice of colours and focus, if this is not the winner, i don''t know what is.', '2004-02-07 02:40:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(571635, 58110, 14553, '<td valign="top">another ribbon winner for sure,  great exposure, the milk could have be purer though, but your depth of field goes well with the placement of your subjects.</td>', 'another ribbon winner for sure,  great exposure, the milk could have be purer though, but your depth of field goes well with the placement of your subjects.', '2004-02-07 02:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(571637, 57812, 14553, '<td valign="top">wow! i though i was the only one who would of thought of this combination, it would have turned out better if you put them in some sort of heirarchy, paper above the rocks, rock looming above scissors but yours is composed well nonetheless.</td>', 'wow! i though i was the only one who would of thought of this combination, it would have turned out better if you put them in some sort of heirarchy, paper above the rocks, rock looming above scissors but yours is composed well nonetheless.', '2004-02-07 02:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(571638, 58178, 14553, '<td valign="top">one of the best salt/pepper combinations in this challenge, the colors seem to be undercontrasted; i would have loved to see a brighter white salt, but i suppose if you would have done that the peper would have been unpleasently contrasted, i wasn''t too fond of your border either....good job</td>', 'one of the best salt/pepper combinations in this challenge, the colors seem to be undercontrasted; i would have loved to see a brighter white salt, but i suppose if you would have done that the peper would have been unpleasently contrasted, i wasn''t too fond of your border either....good job', '2004-02-07 02:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(571639, 57402, 4258, '<td valign="top">A pretty cup and saucer - since a cup and saucer is such a common object I would have tried a different angle to add interest...</td>', 'A pretty cup and saucer - since a cup and saucer is such a common object I would have tried a different angle to add interest...', '2004-02-07 02:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(571641, 57995, 14553, '<td valign="top">beautiful, the best string/needle in this challenge! why? because you have an excellent depth of field, your picture is simple, the colors of the background middle ground and foreground are all linked on the same color! wow! i would have been proud to take this picture. -------&gt;(9)</td>', 'beautiful, the best string/needle in this challenge! why? because you have an excellent depth of field, your picture is simple, the colors of the background middle ground and foreground are all linked on the same color! wow! i would have been proud to take this picture. ------->(9)', '2004-02-07 02:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(571644, 58156, 14553, '<td valign="top">well exposed! your submission meets the challenge requirements, while i don''t understand what locking mechanisms the key would unlock your picture is one of my favorites, top 10.</td>', 'well exposed! your submission meets the challenge requirements, while i don''t understand what locking mechanisms the key would unlock your picture is one of my favorites, top 10.', '2004-02-07 02:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(571645, 58082, 15407, '<td valign="top">I''m very envious of you being able to photograph one of the greatest ''Light Shows'' on Earth and do such a fine job.  Ill bet that some people think it to be painted.  I grew up near San Francisco in Central California &amp; I only saw the Northern Lights about 5 or 6 times.  I got to see them a few more times in Northern Idaho and used up every picture I had available. Your photos are wonderful.  My entry in this challenge is a direct result of the comments left &amp; PMs to me from the Painting with Light challenge.  I wanted to show the uninformed what it takes to get a photo. Sometimes they just don''t see.</td>', 'I''m very envious of you being able to photograph one of the greatest ''Light Shows'' on Earth and do such a fine job.  Ill bet that some people think it to be painted.  I grew up near San Francisco in Central California & I only saw the Northern Lights about 5 or 6 times.  I got to see them a few more times in Northern Idaho and used up every picture I had available. Your photos are wonderful.  My entry in this challenge is a direct result of the comments left & PMs to me from the Painting with Light challenge.  I wanted to show the uninformed what it takes to get a photo. Sometimes they just don''t see.', '2004-02-07 02:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(571646, 57883, 14553, '<td valign="top">you couldn''t find a better combinations of colors if you tried! good exposure. great time of day shot.</td>', 'you couldn''t find a better combinations of colors if you tried! good exposure. great time of day shot.', '2004-02-07 02:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(571683, 57878, 4258, '<td valign="top">next time try hanging a few long white paper strips in front of the glass but out of the frame for a better effect.</td>', 'next time try hanging a few long white paper strips in front of the glass but out of the frame for a better effect.', '2004-02-07 04:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(571697, 58178, 12160, '<td valign="top">very good image, i think this is the best of the many salt ''n pepper entries. good exposure and focus, nicely framed too.</td>', 'very good image, i think this is the best of the many salt ''n pepper entries. good exposure and focus, nicely framed too.', '2004-02-07 05:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(571714, 58035, 4258, '<td valign="top">Bit too much soft focus for this kind of picture ...</td>', 'Bit too much soft focus for this kind of picture ...', '2004-02-07 07:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(571726, 58137, 4258, '<td valign="top">bit more efforts with the lights and this will be a good photograph</td>', 'bit more efforts with the lights and this will be a good photograph', '2004-02-07 07:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(571728, 57995, 4258, '<td valign="top">Nice pic - also fits the Shallow DoF challenge ;)</td>', 'Nice pic - also fits the Shallow DoF challenge ;)', '2004-02-07 07:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(571794, 57759, 3540, '<td valign="top">NIce photo.  I''d rather see him with a little more headroom in this shot though, to give him a place to go.  The small format would not favor that though I''m sure of that.  Good pic</td>', 'NIce photo.  I''d rather see him with a little more headroom in this shot though, to give him a place to go.  The small format would not favor that though I''m sure of that.  Good pic', '2004-02-07 10:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(571796, 57843, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m a little disappointed at this picture.  You really could''ve done a lot of things with these legs and shoes.  cutting off the leg on the left was probably not advised.  Probably included a little more of the top, just for perspective''s sake and made the background solid.  Definitely there are photos here to be had, but this isn''t one of the better ones.<br/></td>', 'I''m a little disappointed at this picture.  You really could''ve done a lot of things with these legs and shoes.  cutting off the leg on the left was probably not advised.  Probably included a little more of the top, just for perspective''s sake and made the background solid.  Definitely there are photos here to be had, but this isn''t one of the better ones.', '2004-02-07 10:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(571797, 57490, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is VERY nicely composed, but the yellow tinge ruins it for me.  If you were going for an aged look a duotone image may have worked better...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is VERY nicely composed, but the yellow tinge ruins it for me.  If you were going for an aged look a duotone image may have worked better...TC', '2004-02-07 10:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(571798, 57768, 3540, '<td valign="top">underexposed.  I think those are pretzels in front of the lager vessel.  Its very hard to tell though.  I think this is a little too soft as well.  proper lighting would''ve done you a world of good.  I''m really surprised not to have seen more of these</td>', 'underexposed.  I think those are pretzels in front of the lager vessel.  Its very hard to tell though.  I think this is a little too soft as well.  proper lighting would''ve done you a world of good.  I''m really surprised not to have seen more of these', '2004-02-07 10:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(571800, 57829, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent photojournalistic type photo.  Good definition in the smoke and I like the way the towers are engulfed.  Good find and great shot 9</td>', 'Excellent photojournalistic type photo.  Good definition in the smoke and I like the way the towers are engulfed.  Good find and great shot 9', '2004-02-07 10:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(571802, 58180, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the amber tone of this photo.  The subject is okay.  I really think you''d pick up some mood points by greyscaling this or making it sepia tone.</td>', 'I don''t really like the amber tone of this photo.  The subject is okay.  I really think you''d pick up some mood points by greyscaling this or making it sepia tone.', '2004-02-07 10:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(571804, 57402, 3540, '<td valign="top">This needs more headroom I think.  Its just a little too tight on the top for me.  Good exposure and worthy subjects.</td>', 'This needs more headroom I think.  Its just a little too tight on the top for me.  Good exposure and worthy subjects.', '2004-02-07 10:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(571806, 58035, 3540, '<td valign="top">This would be way more impressive on someone.  As it is it could be a doily on a leather couch.  Its just not the same...</td>', 'This would be way more impressive on someone.  As it is it could be a doily on a leather couch.  Its just not the same...', '2004-02-07 10:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(571807, 57881, 3540, '<td valign="top">This would be much better bigger and maybe even a little tighter on the lips.  She has nice lips and this is a great color, I''d have really concentrated the viewers attention immediately to that and taken all other factors out of play to ensure that the focus was directed at exactly one thing.</td>', 'This would be much better bigger and maybe even a little tighter on the lips.  She has nice lips and this is a great color, I''d have really concentrated the viewers attention immediately to that and taken all other factors out of play to ensure that the focus was directed at exactly one thing.', '2004-02-07 10:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(571808, 58148, 11846, '<td valign="top">I wish the contrast was a bit more defined ...but this is lovely</td>', 'I wish the contrast was a bit more defined ...but this is lovely', '2004-02-07 11:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(571822, 58082, 17024, '<td valign="top">Very Cool! Great contrat between the Aurora and the white and black mountains and snow.</td>', 'Very Cool! Great contrat between the Aurora and the white and black mountains and snow.', '2004-02-07 11:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(571823, 57751, 12252, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2004-02-07 11:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(571824, 57757, 12252, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Good idea, and good execution...</td>', 'Excellent! Good idea, and good execution...', '2004-02-07 11:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(571835, 58205, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good light and exposure.  I like the composition but perhaps a bit too much empty space--cutting the top inch or so would have made it just right, IMHO.</td>', 'Nice idea, good light and exposure.  I like the composition but perhaps a bit too much empty space--cutting the top inch or so would have made it just right, IMHO.', '2004-02-07 13:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(571836, 58083, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting pen, good composition, good lighting</td>', 'Interesting pen, good composition, good lighting', '2004-02-07 13:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(571837, 57642, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but Lighting seems a bit harsh with some hot spots,  and its a bit too small to evaluate in other ways.  You might have used more negative space here too to make the composition more dynamic.</td>', 'Good idea, but Lighting seems a bit harsh with some hot spots,  and its a bit too small to evaluate in other ways.  You might have used more negative space here too to make the composition more dynamic.', '2004-02-07 13:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(571839, 57759, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the squirrel, and the angled tree is perfect for this.  Nice use of DOF too.</td>', 'Great shot of the squirrel, and the angled tree is perfect for this.  Nice use of DOF too.', '2004-02-07 13:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(571840, 57876, 811, '<td valign="top">I know I am probably missing something here, but I honestly don''t get it.  Photographically speaking, the different bands of color are interesting, and the focus is good, but overall it is kinda flat.  Maybe more context would help (at least for me).</td>', 'I know I am probably missing something here, but I honestly don''t get it.  Photographically speaking, the different bands of color are interesting, and the focus is good, but overall it is kinda flat.  Maybe more context would help (at least for me).', '2004-02-07 13:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(571841, 58124, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but seems slightly tilted right.  Not a pretty subject to shoot but done with good taste and humor.</td>', 'Good composition, but seems slightly tilted right.  Not a pretty subject to shoot but done with good taste and humor.', '2004-02-07 13:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(571844, 58105, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, a bit tto much soft focus and too little contrast probably on purpose to enhance the softness, but it sticks out in that way.  Would have been neat to get tsome sparkle on the ring as a contrast against the softness.</td>', 'Nice composition, a bit tto much soft focus and too little contrast probably on purpose to enhance the softness, but it sticks out in that way.  Would have been neat to get tsome sparkle on the ring as a contrast against the softness.', '2004-02-07 13:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(571846, 57812, 811, '<td valign="top">I started to do a shot very similar to this, but was too lazy to go outside and get a rock.  hahah<br/>Photographically, I think your shot comes up a little short because it is so "flat."  A lower perspective and filling the frame more with the rock and scissors would have really helped, I think.  Wrinkling the paper adds interest and texture to it, but it is composed in such a way to look "static."  I find my eyes pulled to the outside black border, away from the subject.<br/>This shot has a lot of potential, I think.  Perhaps composing it so that the scissors are closer to the rock, the paper provides the entire background, and the whole thing is more vertical than horizontal would ahve really made it pop.  Of course, it is just my opinion, so ymmv.  Good luck.</td>', 'I started to do a shot very similar to this, but was too lazy to go outside and get a rock.  hahahPhotographically, I think your shot comes up a little short because it is so "flat."  A lower perspective and filling the frame more with the rock and scissors would have really helped, I think.  Wrinkling the paper adds interest and texture to it, but it is composed in such a way to look "static."  I find my eyes pulled to the outside black border, away from the subject.This shot has a lot of potential, I think.  Perhaps composing it so that the scissors are closer to the rock, the paper provides the entire background, and the whole thing is more vertical than horizontal would ahve really made it pop.  Of course, it is just my opinion, so ymmv.  Good luck.', '2004-02-07 13:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(571847, 57403, 12253, '<td valign="top">Had the same idea myself (peanut b. and jelly at leat), but ddn''t end up shooting it because I could not do it artistically.  This meets the challenge well, but lacks a sense of "flare" or artistry.  Personally, I was going to try smearing the peanut butter and jelly together on a glass plate in a nice swirly pattern and shoot it as a closeup.</td>', 'Had the same idea myself (peanut b. and jelly at leat), but ddn''t end up shooting it because I could not do it artistically.  This meets the challenge well, but lacks a sense of "flare" or artistry.  Personally, I was going to try smearing the peanut butter and jelly together on a glass plate in a nice swirly pattern and shoot it as a closeup.', '2004-02-07 13:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(571849, 58195, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how you have "framed" the shot with the tile.  It is a good idea, but colorwise is kinda bland to me.  Maybe if you had some of those blue chips, or had the dip in  different color bowl, it would have a little more spark to it, for me.</td>', 'I like how you have "framed" the shot with the tile.  It is a good idea, but colorwise is kinda bland to me.  Maybe if you had some of those blue chips, or had the dip in  different color bowl, it would have a little more spark to it, for me.', '2004-02-07 13:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(571850, 58095, 811, '<td valign="top">Good color contrast.  I think a lower, closer perspective would work with shot, so that you didn''t have quite so much background showing.</td>', 'Good color contrast.  I think a lower, closer perspective would work with shot, so that you didn''t have quite so much background showing.', '2004-02-07 13:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(571852, 57893, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but in the desaturation, the lipstick looks rather flat and one dimensional, I think.</td>', 'I like the composition, but in the desaturation, the lipstick looks rather flat and one dimensional, I think.', '2004-02-07 13:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(571855, 58036, 12253, '<td valign="top">Tough shot, black dog, white bone, outdoor lighting!  Dog is perfect, but bone is overexposed.  Hard to shoot dogs, I know firsthand, and this composition is good but could be better.  If you were going to cut his hind anyway, it would have been better if it were in the upper right corner, and then his bottom foot were there (basically, his lines would be the diagonal.</td>', 'Tough shot, black dog, white bone, outdoor lighting!  Dog is perfect, but bone is overexposed.  Hard to shoot dogs, I know firsthand, and this composition is good but could be better.  If you were going to cut his hind anyway, it would have been better if it were in the upper right corner, and then his bottom foot were there (basically, his lines would be the diagonal.', '2004-02-07 13:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(571857, 57962, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful close up shot, with really interesting color combinations and aesthetics.  Good work!</td>', 'Beautiful close up shot, with really interesting color combinations and aesthetics.  Good work!', '2004-02-07 13:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(571858, 58085, 811, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot.  I think, though, a razor-sharp focus would have made it more effective.  The composition is nice.</td>', 'This is a cool shot.  I think, though, a razor-sharp focus would have made it more effective.  The composition is nice.', '2004-02-07 13:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(571860, 58197, 811, '<td valign="top">The color contrast between the fish and mountains is nice.  however, it lacks depth, and the focus on the fish could be a little stronger I think.  that would make the softness of the background look more deliberate and effective.</td>', 'The color contrast between the fish and mountains is nice.  however, it lacks depth, and the focus on the fish could be a little stronger I think.  that would make the softness of the background look more deliberate and effective.', '2004-02-07 13:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(571861, 57875, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, generally well done.  Some comments: seems a tad tilted, it would be nice to have had enough light in the glass to see some color in the wine.  Mostly centered composition is not as dynamic.  Use of DOF is excellent -- just missed the DOF challenge!</td>', 'Nice idea, generally well done.  Some comments: seems a tad tilted, it would be nice to have had enough light in the glass to see some color in the wine.  Mostly centered composition is not as dynamic.  Use of DOF is excellent -- just missed the DOF challenge!', '2004-02-07 13:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(571862, 57766, 811, '<td valign="top">The shadows add a nice effect.  Good composition.</td>', 'The shadows add a nice effect.  Good composition.', '2004-02-07 13:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(571863, 57728, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good idea!  Good tones, seems to not have enough DOF though, and I think it would have been good to leave all of her lips in.</td>', 'Very good idea!  Good tones, seems to not have enough DOF though, and I think it would have been good to leave all of her lips in.', '2004-02-07 13:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(571866, 58108, 811, '<td valign="top">Being able to see more of the birds would have made this even more effective, I think, though I understand the difficulty in doing that.  I like the green tree in the lower left, for some reason.  Adds stability to the shot, I thinkl</td>', 'Being able to see more of the birds would have made this even more effective, I think, though I understand the difficulty in doing that.  I like the green tree in the lower left, for some reason.  Adds stability to the shot, I thinkl', '2004-02-07 13:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(571867, 58208, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting here, but the composition seems a bit jumbled and random, to me -- which may be the effect you were going for.  However, I have difficulty finding what it is you want me "get" from this picture.</td>', 'I like the lighting here, but the composition seems a bit jumbled and random, to me -- which may be the effect you were going for.  However, I have difficulty finding what it is you want me "get" from this picture.', '2004-02-07 13:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(571870, 58202, 12253, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing, good setup, but the overexposure of the large area of white cream detracts a bit.</td>', 'Perfect timing, good setup, but the overexposure of the large area of white cream detracts a bit.', '2004-02-07 13:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(571872, 58080, 3540, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the framing of this shot.  The use of negative space is not well warranted here in my opinion, or maybe the pieces are just too close to the bottom.  Maybe the frame is the right size, I''d just rather see the pieces moved more toward the middle of the frame.   Its a little too soft as well, it goes beyond my lack of focus comfort zone.</td>', 'Don''t like the framing of this shot.  The use of negative space is not well warranted here in my opinion, or maybe the pieces are just too close to the bottom.  Maybe the frame is the right size, I''d just rather see the pieces moved more toward the middle of the frame.   Its a little too soft as well, it goes beyond my lack of focus comfort zone.', '2004-02-07 13:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(571874, 57705, 3540, '<td valign="top">This would be a much better picture on a different day.  Lets just pick a day like June 30th.  Sky is utterly depressing as I live in Michigan and I know all about this crappy sky business.  Looks like it could be an interesting picture, just not when you took it.</td>', 'This would be a much better picture on a different day.  Lets just pick a day like June 30th.  Sky is utterly depressing as I live in Michigan and I know all about this crappy sky business.  Looks like it could be an interesting picture, just not when you took it.', '2004-02-07 13:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(571875, 57613, 3540, '<td valign="top">what about Coors?  The sky looks like something is wrong.  This is also a very tough picture to properly expose with the extreme white and extreme dark sections in the same photo.  Its a little soft, there is a little problem with a landscape shot like this in this format, we just aren''t getting the full effect.</td>', 'what about Coors?  The sky looks like something is wrong.  This is also a very tough picture to properly expose with the extreme white and extreme dark sections in the same photo.  Its a little soft, there is a little problem with a landscape shot like this in this format, we just aren''t getting the full effect.', '2004-02-07 13:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(571877, 57958, 3540, '<td valign="top">not sure I like the way this was arranged.  The wine bottle on the extreme edge really throws the balance of the composition way off.  There are also a lot of stray glares on the glasses that are pretty distracting.  The idea is pretty good.  I think you would gain a lot by just switching the position of the wine and the glasses.</td>', 'not sure I like the way this was arranged.  The wine bottle on the extreme edge really throws the balance of the composition way off.  There are also a lot of stray glares on the glasses that are pretty distracting.  The idea is pretty good.  I think you would gain a lot by just switching the position of the wine and the glasses.', '2004-02-07 13:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(571878, 58182, 3540, '<td valign="top">Well taken photo.  I think it needs a litle room at the bottom of the frame.  Its just a little too crowded.  Good idea and well shot.</td>', 'Well taken photo.  I think it needs a litle room at the bottom of the frame.  Its just a little too crowded.  Good idea and well shot.', '2004-02-07 13:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(571879, 57421, 3540, '<td valign="top">Composition is just too straight on.  There are a lot of different combinations of ball-bat positions and relative positions that could''ve been used to add some interest to this photo.  Its definitely more original than mine, which works to your advantage.  I think there''s a good way to get this arranged to add interest, maintain balance and properly represent the subjects you''ve put forth.</td>', 'Composition is just too straight on.  There are a lot of different combinations of ball-bat positions and relative positions that could''ve been used to add some interest to this photo.  Its definitely more original than mine, which works to your advantage.  I think there''s a good way to get this arranged to add interest, maintain balance and properly represent the subjects you''ve put forth.', '2004-02-07 13:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(571880, 58190, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good shot of this bird.   I''m not taking any points away for this, but I was thinking of this topic in a little more traditional terms.   I would''ve changed the framing a little though and maybe moved back just a little bit.</td>', 'Good shot of this bird.   I''m not taking any points away for this, but I was thinking of this topic in a little more traditional terms.   I would''ve changed the framing a little though and maybe moved back just a little bit.', '2004-02-07 13:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(571882, 58082, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot if you could get rid of all the noise.  There is abundant noise in the sky and even some in the snow.  who''da thunk it?  Maybe go with the lower ISO and a reduced exposure and probably you''d have got a ribbon for this challenge.  This is absolutely amazing as a subject, but only pretty good as a photo in my opinion. 8</td>', 'This is a really cool shot if you could get rid of all the noise.  There is abundant noise in the sky and even some in the snow.  who''da thunk it?  Maybe go with the lower ISO and a reduced exposure and probably you''d have got a ribbon for this challenge.  This is absolutely amazing as a subject, but only pretty good as a photo in my opinion. 8', '2004-02-07 13:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(571885, 57868, 3540, '<td valign="top">This framing seems almost how I ''d do it.  I would''ve made the skiier a little further back, toward the right of the frame and left more room in front of her so she has a place to go.  Exposure is just a little dark and there looks like there''s a sunflare or something else weird on the window of the cabin behind the trees.7</td>', 'This framing seems almost how I ''d do it.  I would''ve made the skiier a little further back, toward the right of the frame and left more room in front of her so she has a place to go.  Exposure is just a little dark and there looks like there''s a sunflare or something else weird on the window of the cabin behind the trees.7', '2004-02-07 13:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(571887, 58040, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great picture to go on a box of hair tint.  I like the way the color of the comb kind of blends in with her hair color.  Nice hair and a good picture.  I think this is also a good border for this shot.  That might be part of the reason I think it would be a successful marketing photo.  Good luck 7</td>', 'This looks like a great picture to go on a box of hair tint.  I like the way the color of the comb kind of blends in with her hair color.  Nice hair and a good picture.  I think this is also a good border for this shot.  That might be part of the reason I think it would be a successful marketing photo.  Good luck 7', '2004-02-07 13:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(571890, 57747, 3540, '<td valign="top">noisy, looks like some compression issues.  This just isn''t a very clean nor crisp photo.</td>', 'noisy, looks like some compression issues.  This just isn''t a very clean nor crisp photo.', '2004-02-07 13:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(571894, 58059, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks like a coastal city.  I''m not sure why.  My first thought was maybe Rio.  Nice rainbow!  To bad the rest of the sky didn''t cooperate. It looks pretty depressing aside from the rainbow.</td>', 'This looks like a coastal city.  I''m not sure why.  My first thought was maybe Rio.  Nice rainbow!  To bad the rest of the sky didn''t cooperate. It looks pretty depressing aside from the rainbow.', '2004-02-07 13:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
