(571925, 57905, 13728, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, that didn''t get executed as wll as it could.  The exposure is dard, and it is hard to see the light bulb part also it looks grainy and would have done better if croped closer.  This is a very hard thing to photgraph,  I love the idea, and it would be well worth trying for a better exposure.</td>', 'This is a great idea, that didn''t get executed as wll as it could.  The exposure is dard, and it is hard to see the light bulb part also it looks grainy and would have done better if croped closer.  This is a very hard thing to photgraph,  I love the idea, and it would be well worth trying for a better exposure.', '2004-02-07 14:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
