(571975, 57721, 5158, '<td valign="top">Like it for its crispnes and clear composition. What disturbs me a little is that the objects seem the fly on the background, as if the were cut out. I to like the clean white of the background.</td>', 'Like it for its crispnes and clear composition. What disturbs me a little is that the objects seem the fly on the background, as if the were cut out. I to like the clean white of the background.', '2004-02-07 17:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
