(572136, 58197, 6073, '<td valign="top">When you submitted this, did it look real to you?  I think the only thing that would make this look more fake is a person walking on the water in the background.   That said, I can see it has been validated...thank goodness.  <br/> <br/>The two things might go together, but they don''t look natural in this setting, which detracts from the scoring.  The fish looks like the pic was taken two days ago, and the mountain like it was taken in 1972.   <br/> <br/>I think you would be have done (Scoring) better if you would have gotten the two components to work more naturally together.   It''s a neat photo though...very interesting to look at.</td>', 'When you submitted this, did it look real to you?  I think the only thing that would make this look more fake is a person walking on the water in the background.   That said, I can see it has been validated...thank goodness.   The two things might go together, but they don''t look natural in this setting, which detracts from the scoring.  The fish looks like the pic was taken two days ago, and the mountain like it was taken in 1972.    I think you would be have done (Scoring) better if you would have gotten the two components to work more naturally together.   It''s a neat photo though...very interesting to look at.', '2004-02-07 21:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(572137, 58145, 6073, '<td valign="top">Interesting.....but you knew that going in.  Brothers?</td>', 'Interesting.....but you knew that going in.  Brothers?', '2004-02-07 21:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(572158, 58148, 6073, '<td valign="top">Great title, and a nice capture.  Very well done.  Only thing I''d address is the needle.  It looks a little bit oversharpened on my monitor.  Maybe the compression?  Doesn''t quit look linear.</td>', 'Great title, and a nice capture.  Very well done.  Only thing I''d address is the needle.  It looks a little bit oversharpened on my monitor.  Maybe the compression?  Doesn''t quit look linear.', '2004-02-07 21:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(572161, 57920, 6073, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to put down my beer and get on the treadmill.</td>', 'Makes me want to put down my beer and get on the treadmill.', '2004-02-07 21:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(572164, 57611, 6073, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.  I like the bottom portion of the crop, but not the topside so much.  Unique idea and a nice photo.</td>', 'Pretty cool.  I like the bottom portion of the crop, but not the topside so much.  Unique idea and a nice photo.', '2004-02-07 21:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(572168, 57935, 6073, '<td valign="top">We''ve had snow on the ground for two weeks.  Thanks for the escape.  Very well done.  Good color &amp; contrast....w/strong focus.  Possibly a good idea for S DOF challenge.</td>', 'We''ve had snow on the ground for two weeks.  Thanks for the escape.  Very well done.  Good color & contrast....w/strong focus.  Possibly a good idea for S DOF challenge.', '2004-02-07 21:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(572177, 58182, 6073, '<td valign="top">I would have love to seen this with just a black background.  Awesome job on the gun and amo.  Very cool...the target in the back blows it for me.   Great concept!  <br/> <br/>I''d recommend a little more foreground, so we can see the top of the bullets reflect, and a solid well lite background.  This is a really good photo minus that target.</td>', 'I would have love to seen this with just a black background.  Awesome job on the gun and amo.  Very cool...the target in the back blows it for me.   Great concept!   I''d recommend a little more foreground, so we can see the top of the bullets reflect, and a solid well lite background.  This is a really good photo minus that target.', '2004-02-07 21:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(572181, 57430, 7778, '<td valign="top">Despite the the very tight crop near the road sign (especially above it), its inclusion adds both dimension and balance to this soft and partly sensual chiaroscuro. A little sidelight on part of the sign would have been delightful as well. An array of shapes, tones, textures and lines juxtaposed with graffiti without any sense of clutter!<br/> <br/>One of the most satisfying and creative images in this challenge, IMO.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Despite the the very tight crop near the road sign (especially above it), its inclusion adds both dimension and balance to this soft and partly sensual chiaroscuro. A little sidelight on part of the sign would have been delightful as well. An array of shapes, tones, textures and lines juxtaposed with graffiti without any sense of clutter! One of the most satisfying and creative images in this challenge, IMO.   ', '2004-02-07 21:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(572189, 58040, 6073, '<td valign="top">I find the border distracting.  Good photo otherwise.</td>', 'I find the border distracting.  Good photo otherwise.', '2004-02-07 21:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(572197, 57944, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a Lesser Scaup</td>', 'Nice photo of a Lesser Scaup', '2004-02-07 22:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(572206, 58150, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like this the drops on a pretty Tulip and blured background 7</td>', 'I like this the drops on a pretty Tulip and blured background 7', '2004-02-07 22:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(572218, 58035, 7778, '<td valign="top">While this capture is reasonably accomplished and seductively rendered, as a photo, it is also short on -range-. <br/> <br/>Both title and image relay the subject poignantly, yet the polished fringes of leather suggest an article of clothing and fashion rather than a material per se. The unfortunate and likely unintended effect is that someone viewing the image is reminded of catalog images, intended to sell a product.<br/> <br/>If the article used here could have been more difficult to date and could be displayed more generically, this image would, IMHO, be an entirely different animal.<br/> <br/>With a greater tonal range (both in the white and black areas), the photo would be transporting.<br/> <br/>Despite my stated criteria, I consider it among the best in this challenge.</td>', 'While this capture is reasonably accomplished and seductively rendered, as a photo, it is also short on -range-.  Both title and image relay the subject poignantly, yet the polished fringes of leather suggest an article of clothing and fashion rather than a material per se. The unfortunate and likely unintended effect is that someone viewing the image is reminded of catalog images, intended to sell a product. If the article used here could have been more difficult to date and could be displayed more generically, this image would, IMHO, be an entirely different animal. With a greater tonal range (both in the white and black areas), the photo would be transporting. Despite my stated criteria, I consider it among the best in this challenge.', '2004-02-07 22:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(572229, 57747, 11832, '<td valign="top">Seems kind of grainy, dont know if intentionally added, but I just dont like it, altough, good use of DOF. 6<br/></td>', 'Seems kind of grainy, dont know if intentionally added, but I just dont like it, altough, good use of DOF. 6', '2004-02-07 23:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
