(572738, 57905, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot overall.  I like the effect and would love to know how you acheived it.  <br/> <br/>But alas, as interesting as it is the quality of the shot leave me wanting.  The out of focus on the bulb part and candle really leaves me wanting.  More clarity and focus would really make this pop.  Also if the light could have been limited to the bulb itself for some reason and completely black around it.  Started with a 4 moving to a 5</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot overall.  I like the effect and would love to know how you acheived it.   But alas, as interesting as it is the quality of the shot leave me wanting.  The out of focus on the bulb part and candle really leaves me wanting.  More clarity and focus would really make this pop.  Also if the light could have been limited to the bulb itself for some reason and completely black around it.  Started with a 4 moving to a 5', '2004-02-08 22:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(572743, 57383, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very good idea but the actual shot leaves me wondering.  The top bubble getting cut off really hurts the shot and the glare on the bottom bubble is very distracting.  The overall shot looks a bit washed out and out of focus.  A 4</td>', 'This is a very good idea but the actual shot leaves me wondering.  The top bubble getting cut off really hurts the shot and the glare on the bottom bubble is very distracting.  The overall shot looks a bit washed out and out of focus.  A 4', '2004-02-08 22:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(572744, 57634, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very classy shot but the soft focus doesn''t really work for me on this for some reason.  I like it but it doesn''t feel quite right, maybe it''s just a tad too soft?  And how in the world did you get that Oreo to sit on the glass like that without it breaking?  Started at a 5, moving to a 7</td>', 'This is a very classy shot but the soft focus doesn''t really work for me on this for some reason.  I like it but it doesn''t feel quite right, maybe it''s just a tad too soft?  And how in the world did you get that Oreo to sit on the glass like that without it breaking?  Started at a 5, moving to a 7', '2004-02-08 22:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(572745, 57641, 12448, '<td valign="top">They certainly go together, at least 3 times a day in my life!  This is a great idea but I think it would work better if the light wasn''t so bright, the bottom of the toothbrush blends in so much with the bottom of the picture and the while it''s nice that the toothpaste and bristles are almost the same color a bit of contrast might be better for this shot.  Also the neck of the tube is almost blinding on my monitor which has been calibrated, the threads are lost on the center part of it.<br/> <br/>A 5</td>', 'They certainly go together, at least 3 times a day in my life!  This is a great idea but I think it would work better if the light wasn''t so bright, the bottom of the toothbrush blends in so much with the bottom of the picture and the while it''s nice that the toothpaste and bristles are almost the same color a bit of contrast might be better for this shot.  Also the neck of the tube is almost blinding on my monitor which has been calibrated, the threads are lost on the center part of it. A 5', '2004-02-08 22:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(572747, 57747, 12448, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, almost did it myself!  The shot is well done, the needle almost looks like it''s floating in mid air, the way you set it up is very nice.  The DOF is a good idea but the thread in the background is almost too fuzzy and the end of the spool getting cut off is a bit distracting.  If the single thread was in focus with the needle and the spool was out of focus I think I would like this shot much more.  A 5 to start, moving to a 7</td>', 'I really like the idea, almost did it myself!  The shot is well done, the needle almost looks like it''s floating in mid air, the way you set it up is very nice.  The DOF is a good idea but the thread in the background is almost too fuzzy and the end of the spool getting cut off is a bit distracting.  If the single thread was in focus with the needle and the spool was out of focus I think I would like this shot much more.  A 5 to start, moving to a 7', '2004-02-08 22:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(572749, 58192, 1031, '<td valign="top">Clever combination of themes,</td>', 'Clever combination of themes,', '2004-02-08 22:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(572751, 57751, 527, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great composition and choice of background.<br/> <br/>T</td>', 'Very nice. Great composition and choice of background. T', '2004-02-08 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(572752, 58191, 12448, '<td valign="top">They do go together without a doubt.  But the graininess of this shot really bothers me.  That might be what you were going for but for me personally, there are very few shots where graininess works and this is not one of them.  The catching the duck in mid flight is excellent but it looks more like he''s ready to land on land than water also.  Picky, I know but since they are supposed to be together.  A 5</td>', 'They do go together without a doubt.  But the graininess of this shot really bothers me.  That might be what you were going for but for me personally, there are very few shots where graininess works and this is not one of them.  The catching the duck in mid flight is excellent but it looks more like he''s ready to land on land than water also.  Picky, I know but since they are supposed to be together.  A 5', '2004-02-08 22:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(572753, 58082, 1031, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a cover for a Sci-Fi pulp magazine.</td>', 'Reminds me of a cover for a Sci-Fi pulp magazine.', '2004-02-08 22:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(572754, 57607, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice use of humor to create an interesting background.</td>', 'Nice use of humor to create an interesting background.', '2004-02-08 22:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(572755, 58182, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job positioning the pistol at an unusual angle. I''ll try to avoid those extra-lethal bullets.</td>', 'Nice job positioning the pistol at an unusual angle. I''ll try to avoid those extra-lethal bullets.', '2004-02-08 22:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(572757, 58139, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hippos and water, together forever without a doubt.  I''m guessing this is a zoo shot so you really didn''t have a lot of control over the set up.  THe lighting and focus is wonderful and the overall cropping is also well done but not being able to see the front of the face is a bit off putting to me.  At first I didn''t like this shot overall because it seemed a bit dark to me but upon a second look I see that really works well for this shot.  Started with a 5, moving to an 8</td>', 'Hippos and water, together forever without a doubt.  I''m guessing this is a zoo shot so you really didn''t have a lot of control over the set up.  THe lighting and focus is wonderful and the overall cropping is also well done but not being able to see the front of the face is a bit off putting to me.  At first I didn''t like this shot overall because it seemed a bit dark to me but upon a second look I see that really works well for this shot.  Started with a 5, moving to an 8', '2004-02-08 22:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(572759, 57723, 1031, '<td valign="top">Too bad they don''t come in one pod like that!</td>', 'Too bad they don''t come in one pod like that!', '2004-02-08 22:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(572760, 57843, 12448, '<td valign="top">Well, yes they do go together but not quite like this in my mind, LOL!  I would expect fish net stockings to start and to be able to see the heel of the shoe, a shot from behind or the side would have much more impact for me.  The bare leg above the stocking is distracting as is the sweater that is hanging down.  Perhaps a tighter crop on the top?  Also the way the legs are positioned rather strangely to me, not sure quite what you were going for.  A 5</td>', 'Well, yes they do go together but not quite like this in my mind, LOL!  I would expect fish net stockings to start and to be able to see the heel of the shoe, a shot from behind or the side would have much more impact for me.  The bare leg above the stocking is distracting as is the sweater that is hanging down.  Perhaps a tighter crop on the top?  Also the way the legs are positioned rather strangely to me, not sure quite what you were going for.  A 5', '2004-02-08 22:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(572765, 57493, 527, '<td valign="top">This is very good. I really like the composition and colors. Sharp and clean also,<br/> <br/>T</td>', 'This is very good. I really like the composition and colors. Sharp and clean also, T', '2004-02-08 22:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(572767, 58095, 12448, '<td valign="top">I almost did this shot too!  I tried a couple of different ways but couldn''t get it to work for me.  This is not a bad shot but the salt and pepper getting cut off on the bottom hurts the shot and all the stray seasoning is very distracting.  Also the light is a bit harsh it would seem.  A 5</td>', 'I almost did this shot too!  I tried a couple of different ways but couldn''t get it to work for me.  This is not a bad shot but the salt and pepper getting cut off on the bottom hurts the shot and all the stray seasoning is very distracting.  Also the light is a bit harsh it would seem.  A 5', '2004-02-08 22:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(572771, 58093, 12448, '<td valign="top">Another great idea but the shot left me wanting.  The motion of the shovel, the snow falling all makes for a very busy picture and nothing really to focus on and catch my eye and keep it there.  I would possibly put the shovel upright in a snow bank or have it on the sidewalk full of snow.  A 5</td>', 'Another great idea but the shot left me wanting.  The motion of the shovel, the snow falling all makes for a very busy picture and nothing really to focus on and catch my eye and keep it there.  I would possibly put the shovel upright in a snow bank or have it on the sidewalk full of snow.  A 5', '2004-02-08 23:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(572774, 57807, 527, '<td valign="top">I think the theme is a bit of a stretch but I really like the photo. Great texture, values and composition.<br/> <br/>T</td>', 'I think the theme is a bit of a stretch but I really like the photo. Great texture, values and composition. T', '2004-02-08 23:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(572776, 57403, 12448, '<td valign="top">PB&amp;J, without a doubt the most well know together pair!  This is a college student''s main staple, along with mac and cheese.  The shot is a bit bright and out of focus.  Also, knowing several college students, they would never cut off the crusts, they are always hungry and would eat every single crumb! ;)  <br/> <br/>The knife is a bit of distraction because it''s so clean with just the touch of peanut butter on the end, seems there should be peanut butter and jelly smeared on it from cutting the bread and the clean cuts on the bread also are a bit to clean, you know?  A 5 to start, going to a 6</td>', 'PB&J, without a doubt the most well know together pair!  This is a college student''s main staple, along with mac and cheese.  The shot is a bit bright and out of focus.  Also, knowing several college students, they would never cut off the crusts, they are always hungry and would eat every single crumb! ;)   The knife is a bit of distraction because it''s so clean with just the touch of peanut butter on the end, seems there should be peanut butter and jelly smeared on it from cutting the bread and the clean cuts on the bread also are a bit to clean, you know?  A 5 to start, going to a 6', '2004-02-08 23:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(572777, 58145, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, you and your wife do look a lot alike!  Spooky!  I can''t wait to hear how this was done!<br/> <br/>I like the shot and the division in the middle is almost perfect but not quite and her side in the middle is really out of focus for some reason compared to the sid on the right.  A 6</td>', 'Wow, you and your wife do look a lot alike!  Spooky!  I can''t wait to hear how this was done! I like the shot and the division in the middle is almost perfect but not quite and her side in the middle is really out of focus for some reason compared to the sid on the right.  A 6', '2004-02-08 23:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(572779, 57718, 12448, '<td valign="top">OmGOSH, you would ruin a good whiskey with that vile coke?  LOL!  Just kidding.  I like the together idea but I don''t like the post processing, the x-ray type look.  The ice looks very dirty and just not very appealing at all to me.  a 6</td>', 'OmGOSH, you would ruin a good whiskey with that vile coke?  LOL!  Just kidding.  I like the together idea but I don''t like the post processing, the x-ray type look.  The ice looks very dirty and just not very appealing at all to me.  a 6', '2004-02-08 23:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(572788, 58145, 1031, '<td valign="top">You must get some strangelooks when you have to show a photo-ID.</td>', 'You must get some strangelooks when you have to show a photo-ID.', '2004-02-08 23:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(572813, 57751, 10818, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo..maybe best of the challenge.  Do fish and cats actually go together?  Debatable.  But a great shot.</td>', 'Fantastic photo..maybe best of the challenge.  Do fish and cats actually go together?  Debatable.  But a great shot.', '2004-02-08 23:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(572821, 57493, 1041, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  Great composition, the reflection of the cork and corkscrew in the glass just round it off nicely.  My top 3 this week.</td>', 'Stunning.  Great composition, the reflection of the cork and corkscrew in the glass just round it off nicely.  My top 3 this week.', '2004-02-08 23:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(572822, 57612, 1041, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the crispness, colors and texture.  My top 3 this week.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the crispness, colors and texture.  My top 3 this week.', '2004-02-08 23:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(572823, 58101, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and toned.  They go well together and there''s so much texture for the eyes to feast on.  My top 3 this week.</td>', 'Nicely lit and toned.  They go well together and there''s so much texture for the eyes to feast on.  My top 3 this week.', '2004-02-08 23:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(572826, 58040, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great, love the comb and it goes well with the hair.  The border lost you a point but still in my top 10 this week.</td>', 'Great, love the comb and it goes well with the hair.  The border lost you a point but still in my top 10 this week.', '2004-02-08 23:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(572827, 58080, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I wish the back of the pieces wouldn''t melt into the background, but the composition and high-key approach are great for this photo.  In my top 10 this week.</td>', 'Very nice.  I wish the back of the pieces wouldn''t melt into the background, but the composition and high-key approach are great for this photo.  In my top 10 this week.', '2004-02-08 23:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(572829, 58114, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nicely arranged.  One of those photos where reflections add to the shot.  Love the colors.  In my top 10 this week.</td>', 'Nicely arranged.  One of those photos where reflections add to the shot.  Love the colors.  In my top 10 this week.', '2004-02-08 23:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(572831, 57881, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very nice and very appropriate for the challenge.  The lips and the lipstick color clash, matching would''ve given you an extra point.  Soft focus is very nice here, so is the composition and crop.  In my top 10 this week.</td>', 'Very nice and very appropriate for the challenge.  The lips and the lipstick color clash, matching would''ve given you an extra point.  Soft focus is very nice here, so is the composition and crop.  In my top 10 this week.', '2004-02-08 23:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(572832, 57762, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great idea, plus I''m always rooting for left-handed people :)  B&amp;w works well.  In my top 10 this week.</td>', 'Great idea, plus I''m always rooting for left-handed people :)  B&w works well.  In my top 10 this week.', '2004-02-08 23:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(572833, 58105, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, and good for  the challenge.  I don''t like the color, it''s too unnatural somehow.  Otherwise a fine pic and in my top 10 this week.</td>', 'Very nice composition, and good for  the challenge.  I don''t like the color, it''s too unnatural somehow.  Otherwise a fine pic and in my top 10 this week.', '2004-02-08 23:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
