(572871, 57441, 14499, '<td valign="top">Oh I see, there are seats in the foreground!  Dam (oh well, drat, darn, doh!)... to dull to see the first time I looked, I had to read a comment befor I noticed them.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-09 22:18:32.</i></td>', 'Oh I see, there are seats in the foreground!  Dam (oh well, drat, darn, doh!)... to dull to see the first time I looked, I had to read a comment befor I noticed them.', '2004-02-09 00:35:53.000000', '2004-02-09 22:18:32.000000', 0),
