(572900, 57935, 14476, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon, train.  Nicely done, indeed!</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon, train.  Nicely done, indeed!', '2004-02-09 00:54:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(572911, 57758, 16301, '<td valign="top">I thought you were gonna be in the top ten! Well, this is how DPC is. But its a great photo, personally one of the best in this challenge. <br/> <br/>Good luck in the other challenges...</td>', 'I thought you were gonna be in the top ten! Well, this is how DPC is. But its a great photo, personally one of the best in this challenge.  Good luck in the other challenges...', '2004-02-09 01:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(572915, 57878, 8054, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tarique:</b></div><hr/><i> next time try hanging a few long white paper strips in front of the glass but out of the frame for a better effect. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Would that just serve to reflect more light onto the subject? I''m building a small wood frame to take product pictures at work and it will have open sides for lighting. I plan to drape white sheets on the sides and top to diffuse light. That setup should eliminate the harsh shadows like the ones found in this picture.</td>', 'Originally posted by tarique: next time try hanging a few long white paper strips in front of the glass but out of the frame for a better effect.   Would that just serve to reflect more light onto the subject? I''m building a small wood frame to take product pictures at work and it will have open sides for lighting. I plan to drape white sheets on the sides and top to diffuse light. That setup should eliminate the harsh shadows like the ones found in this picture.', '2004-02-09 01:20:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(572918, 57878, 8054, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all those people who voted and left comments for my entry. It was a fairly rushed picture as I didn''t plan my time well. Next challenge, I hope to use my "light box" for more even lighting. And, yes, I snacked on lots of Oreos while shooting.  :D</td>', 'Thanks to all those people who voted and left comments for my entry. It was a fairly rushed picture as I didn''t plan my time well. Next challenge, I hope to use my "light box" for more even lighting. And, yes, I snacked on lots of Oreos while shooting.  :D', '2004-02-09 01:25:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(572921, 57935, 5158, '<td valign="top">Also from Cangrats for your first ribbon! Way to go!</td>', 'Also from Cangrats for your first ribbon! Way to go!', '2004-02-09 01:39:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(572933, 57935, 10437, '<td valign="top">Oh Sally, I am so happy for you, a RIBBON:-)<br/> <br/>Congratulations, so well deserved (one of the 14 TENS is mine)!</td>', 'Oh Sally, I am so happy for you, a RIBBON:-) Congratulations, so well deserved (one of the 14 TENS is mine)!', '2004-02-09 02:09:09.000000', NULL, 0),
