(572944, 57751, 5158, '<td valign="top">Congrats to your second blue ribbon!<br/>Was my favorit acctually, so I''m happy to see it here on the frontpage.</td>', 'Congrats to your second blue ribbon!Was my favorit acctually, so I''m happy to see it here on the frontpage.', '2004-02-09 02:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
