(573016, 58040, 4906, '<td valign="top">Another ribbon - Well done Jörg!</td>', 'Another ribbon - Well done Jörg!', '2004-02-09 04:39:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(573023, 58058, 7543, '<td valign="top">Well this didn''t go well... I can understand the "where is the hot" comments, it''s not obvious if you werent there. Actually the stream was a bit hot and the steam froze on the near by grass and plants. <br/> <br/>Maybe the outtakes clear things up: <a href="//www.fiski.net/~halim/gallery/album61" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Frozen surroundings of the hot stream</a></td>', 'Well this didn''t go well... I can understand the "where is the hot" comments, it''s not obvious if you werent there. Actually the stream was a bit hot and the steam froze on the near by grass and plants.  Maybe the outtakes clear things up: Frozen surroundings of the hot stream', '2004-02-09 04:46:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(573050, 58147, 6999, '<td valign="top">i meant to come back to this and say that despite my comments this was one of my top three in this challenge - that still only garnered you a 7 from me I fear (it just wasn''t so striking), but it was clearly among the best. Oddly, all my preferred shots in this challenge were from favourite photographers of mine.</td>', 'i meant to come back to this and say that despite my comments this was one of my top three in this challenge - that still only garnered you a 7 from me I fear (it just wasn''t so striking), but it was clearly among the best. Oddly, all my preferred shots in this challenge were from favourite photographers of mine.', '2004-02-09 05:48:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(573051, 57829, 6999, '<td valign="top">One of my top pics for this challenge - oddly, all three were from favourite photographers (just shows that I''m right to have selected them). Pretty good scoring and placing, especially for a non-shiny-happy photo on dpc.</td>', 'One of my top pics for this challenge - oddly, all three were from favourite photographers (just shows that I''m right to have selected them). Pretty good scoring and placing, especially for a non-shiny-happy photo on dpc.', '2004-02-09 05:52:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(573053, 57191, 3087, '<td valign="top">Responding to your request for comments in the forums:<br/> <br/>Actually I''m not going to be so helpful as I would have scored this a 6 or 7. <br/> <br/>I like the feel of perspective that you have achieved by going close in to the subjects in the foreground and also by using a low viewpoint. I also really like the low DOF that has resulted.<br/> <br/>Another thing I like is the inclusion of the cork text - adds an interesting detail.<br/> <br/>I would say that the overall image is quite dark - not badly lit, just in terms of choices of backdrop and subject matter - which may not appeal to a lot of voters.<br/> <br/>I''d also add that composition isn''t particularly strong or balanced - there is an interesting diagonal from the corkscrew and top right bottle but otherwise the composition feels very random, and doesn''t click for me.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Responding to your request for comments in the forums: Actually I''m not going to be so helpful as I would have scored this a 6 or 7.  I like the feel of perspective that you have achieved by going close in to the subjects in the foreground and also by using a low viewpoint. I also really like the low DOF that has resulted. Another thing I like is the inclusion of the cork text - adds an interesting detail. I would say that the overall image is quite dark - not badly lit, just in terms of choices of backdrop and subject matter - which may not appeal to a lot of voters. I''d also add that composition isn''t particularly strong or balanced - there is an interesting diagonal from the corkscrew and top right bottle but otherwise the composition feels very random, and doesn''t click for me. ', '2004-02-09 05:54:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(573058, 58058, 15919, '<td valign="top">Fín mynd en virðist greinilega ekki alveg hafa fallið í kramið.  Menn virðast ekki alveg hafa komið auga á hvað sé heitt á myndinni enda er það ekki alveg augljóst.  Water and ice eða eitthvað svoleiðis hefði kannski verið betri titill.</td>', 'Fín mynd en virðist greinilega ekki alveg hafa fallið í kramið.  Menn virðast ekki alveg hafa komið auga á hvað sé heitt á myndinni enda er það ekki alveg augljóst.  Water and ice eða eitthvað svoleiðis hefði kannski verið betri titill.', '2004-02-09 06:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
