(573121, 57430, 6999, '<td valign="top">Take heart from the quality of the people that bothered to comment, Jon; and thanks from me for putting up something more intersting than the run-of-the-mill. I was one of the 7''s, but I scored nothing higher in this challenge. Good to see challenging stuff.</td>', 'Take heart from the quality of the people that bothered to comment, Jon; and thanks from me for putting up something more intersting than the run-of-the-mill. I was one of the 7''s, but I scored nothing higher in this challenge. Good to see challenging stuff.', '2004-02-09 07:31:04.000000', NULL, 0),
