(573162, 57843, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This one really killed me, cause I totally missed it.  Thought it was a pretty decent photo.  Oh well, live and learn.  At first I thought it was the title that was killing me, but turns out it just was technically not good. <br/> <br/>I didn''t show the stilettos because they aren''t stilettos... original title for this was "Shoes and socks" but was told it was too dull of a title, was also thinking about "Sugar &amp; Spice" but in the end I don''t think it would''ve made a difference.  Thanks for all the feedback! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-09 11:00:41.</i></td>', 'Wow!  This one really killed me, cause I totally missed it.  Thought it was a pretty decent photo.  Oh well, live and learn.  At first I thought it was the title that was killing me, but turns out it just was technically not good.  I didn''t show the stilettos because they aren''t stilettos... original title for this was "Shoes and socks" but was told it was too dull of a title, was also thinking about "Sugar & Spice" but in the end I don''t think it would''ve made a difference.  Thanks for all the feedback! :)', '2004-02-09 08:18:26.000000', '2004-02-09 11:00:41.000000', 0),
