(573202, 58040, 5158, '<td valign="top">Juhu! <br/>:) Thanx for all your votes and comments :)<br/> <br/>I actually didn''t expect to get a ribbon for it, but now I''m very happy.<br/>It was one of my most expensive images so far: 2.5 Euro for the comb, 3.99 Euro for a brush I didn''t use and most important 3.99 Euro for a Happy Meal at McDonalds for Kira. Otherwise it would have been difficult for me to work in/with her hair for almost 30 min.<br/>I actually wanted to make something different, showing her combing herself, because she has very long hairs by now. Didn''t work well so.<br/>So when she was laying on the floor, watching TV, I was able to try several positions of the comb in her hair and finally got the submitted one. As most times now, as light source I used my old external flash bouncing at the ceiling. This flash has been my third best photographical investment (after the canon A40 and G3): did cost me 45 Euro and works like magic to me.<br/> <br/>I was pretty sure that the border might be liked and disliked. And so it went: 5 comments pro border, 5 comments contra. But I tired various other ones and they didn''t work. No border didn''t work at all!<br/> <br/>Thanks again,<br/> <br/>Jörg</td>', 'Juhu! :) Thanx for all your votes and comments :) I actually didn''t expect to get a ribbon for it, but now I''m very happy.It was one of my most expensive images so far: 2.5 Euro for the comb, 3.99 Euro for a brush I didn''t use and most important 3.99 Euro for a Happy Meal at McDonalds for Kira. Otherwise it would have been difficult for me to work in/with her hair for almost 30 min.I actually wanted to make something different, showing her combing herself, because she has very long hairs by now. Didn''t work well so.So when she was laying on the floor, watching TV, I was able to try several positions of the comb in her hair and finally got the submitted one. As most times now, as light source I used my old external flash bouncing at the ceiling. This flash has been my third best photographical investment (after the canon A40 and G3): did cost me 45 Euro and works like magic to me. I was pretty sure that the border might be liked and disliked. And so it went: 5 comments pro border, 5 comments contra. But I tired various other ones and they didn''t work. No border didn''t work at all! Thanks again, Jörg', '2004-02-09 09:11:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(573241, 57611, 2891, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your votes.  I would like to know why people voted 1,2,3 as I do not think this photo belongs there without a reason or comment.</td>', 'Thank you all for your votes.  I would like to know why people voted 1,2,3 as I do not think this photo belongs there without a reason or comment.', '2004-02-09 10:10:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(573267, 57565, 16499, '<td valign="top">In fact, the reflection is falling off the polished body of the guitar and without the shadow it would not be contrast enough. I liked the fact that the shadow looks like a loudspeaker of the old days and the center of image is the ligt (sound) waves which are in focus. That is why the guitar is not sharp and not accentuated at all. My mistake is that although reflections are sharp they are not percepted correctly withthe background of blurry shadow.<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for  comments!</td>', 'In fact, the reflection is falling off the polished body of the guitar and without the shadow it would not be contrast enough. I liked the fact that the shadow looks like a loudspeaker of the old days and the center of image is the ligt (sound) waves which are in focus. That is why the guitar is not sharp and not accentuated at all. My mistake is that although reflections are sharp they are not percepted correctly withthe background of blurry shadow. Thanks everyone for  comments!', '2004-02-09 10:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(573343, 58058, 7543, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by garlic:</b></div><hr/><i> Fín mynd en virðist greinilega ekki alveg hafa fallið í kramið.  Menn virðast ekki alveg hafa komið auga á hvað sé heitt á myndinni enda er það ekki alveg augljóst.  Water and ice eða eitthvað svoleiðis hefði kannski verið betri titill. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Þú segir nokkuð, það skín ekki vel í gegn hvað er í gangi. Tók þessa mynd ekki fyrir þessa áskorun, svo það má segja að maður hafi "skójárnað" myndina hér inn. Takk fyrir kommentið.</td>', 'Originally posted by garlic: Fín mynd en virðist greinilega ekki alveg hafa fallið í kramið.  Menn virðast ekki alveg hafa komið auga á hvað sé heitt á myndinni enda er það ekki alveg augljóst.  Water and ice eða eitthvað svoleiðis hefði kannski verið betri titill.   Þú segir nokkuð, það skín ekki vel í gegn hvað er í gangi. Tók þessa mynd ekki fyrir þessa áskorun, svo það má segja að maður hafi "skójárnað" myndina hér inn. Takk fyrir kommentið.', '2004-02-09 11:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
