(573473, 57873, 16188, '<td valign="top">Now that the voting is over, I can post more about this.  It just goes to prove that something which seems totally obvious to one person can be absolutely unclear to another. :)  Youth and age go together for me because they are part of an arc which living things go through, if they are lucky to live long enough.  In this case, I used the young (just having bloomed) flowers and the old (having sat in the back garden through an entire year''s weather) door to represent youth and age abstractly.  I appreciated the comments I received because it showed me how unclear my concept was to most people.  :)  I also thought of a different title, after the fact, which might have worked better - Opposites Attract...?<br/> <br/>Lol... it''s always very good to have the cockiness knocked out of one''s attitude.  I thought the image was perfect for this challenge and that the photograph was perfect as is.   I knew other people wouldn''t necessarily agree with the latter but didn''t think anyone would think the concept was out of place so I live and I learn. :)</td>', 'Now that the voting is over, I can post more about this.  It just goes to prove that something which seems totally obvious to one person can be absolutely unclear to another. :)  Youth and age go together for me because they are part of an arc which living things go through, if they are lucky to live long enough.  In this case, I used the young (just having bloomed) flowers and the old (having sat in the back garden through an entire year''s weather) door to represent youth and age abstractly.  I appreciated the comments I received because it showed me how unclear my concept was to most people.  :)  I also thought of a different title, after the fact, which might have worked better - Opposites Attract...? Lol... it''s always very good to have the cockiness knocked out of one''s attitude.  I thought the image was perfect for this challenge and that the photograph was perfect as is.   I knew other people wouldn''t necessarily agree with the latter but didn''t think anyone would think the concept was out of place so I live and I learn. :)', '2004-02-09 13:40:36.000000', NULL, 0),
