(573753, 57905, 14603, '<td valign="top">Expected to see this shot a lot higher up the list than this.<br/>I did leave a comment that it would probably get scored down for lack of clarity and it looks like it got hammered. However, the clever idea should have made up some ground for you.<br/> <br/>If you had managed to get the image sharp then I have no doubts that this would have been ribbon potential.<br/> <br/>Gordon</td>', 'Expected to see this shot a lot higher up the list than this.I did leave a comment that it would probably get scored down for lack of clarity and it looks like it got hammered. However, the clever idea should have made up some ground for you. If you had managed to get the image sharp then I have no doubts that this would have been ribbon potential. Gordon', '2004-02-09 18:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
