(574559, 57768, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun shot, Kim. If you look at the comments below, note words like ''crisp'' and ''dark.'' This is a great idea, and dark isn''t a bad thing at all-as long as folks can see a reason for it. Crisp is important, unless you deliberately want soft focus--then you usually need to be enthusiastic about it. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Fun shot, Kim. If you look at the comments below, note words like ''crisp'' and ''dark.'' This is a great idea, and dark isn''t a bad thing at all-as long as folks can see a reason for it. Crisp is important, unless you deliberately want soft focus--then you usually need to be enthusiastic about it. Keep up the good work!', '2004-02-10 13:03:55.000000', NULL, 0),
